window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df05"]={"id": "df05", "title": "高斯扩散：VP 与 VE 的闭式解", "focus": "推导方差保持（VP）与方差爆炸（VE）两类高斯扩散的闭式边缘分布、转移核与信噪比；说明连续时间与离散 DDPM 的对应关系。", "claims": ["\\text{VP: }x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,\\ \\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_sds}", "\\text{VE: }x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon", "\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)"], "topics": ["VP-SDE 的定义", "VE-SDE 的定义", "高斯转移核的闭式解", "VP 的闭式边缘分布", "VE 的闭式边缘分布", "信噪比与时间重参数化", "方差保持与方差爆炸", "离散化与连续化的对应", "噪声调度的选择", "反例：调度不当导致数值爆炸", "与 DDPM 的对应", "与 Flow 的接口", "代码：VP/VE 闭式采样", "代码：调度对密度的影响", "与反向 SDE 章的接口", "本章推导链：高斯扩散的闭式"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df05--h-VP-SDE-的定义\">VP-SDE 的定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-VP-SDE-的定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用本章开篇固定的记号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 为标准高斯噪声，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 为连续时间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 为终端时刻。本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为噪声调度速率（noise schedule rate），要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 Borel 可测、非负、局部有界，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t:=\\beta(t)$</span>。</li>\n<li>累积速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t:=\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=e^{-\\bar\\beta_t}$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为定义在概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 上的标准 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维布朗运动，其自然 filtration 记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{F}_t)$</span>，满足通常条件（右连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_0$</span> 含全部零测集）。</li>\n<li>系数函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 分别称为漂移与扩散系数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 1.1（VP-SDE 的正则性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t):=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t):=\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz（Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\beta_t$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 局部有界且在紧区间上取有限上确界保证），关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T g(t)^2dt=\\int_0^T\\beta_tdt=\\bar\\beta_T&lt;\\infty$</span>。故标准 SDE 强解存在唯一，且解过程平方可积。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1.2（VP-SDE）</strong> 在上述假设下，方差保持随机微分方程（variance-preserving SDE，简称 VP-SDE）指如下 Itô 型随机微分方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,dW_t,\\qquad x_0\\ \\text{给定},$$</div>\n<p>其时间区间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 按假设 1.1 取定。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为 VP 扩散过程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 为该过程的噪声调度。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别。</strong> VP-SDE 的漂移是线性的、扩散系数是时间的确定函数且与状态无关，因此它是<strong>线性加性噪声扩散</strong>；这与一般非线性漂移的扩散（如基于得分的反向过程）不同：后者的漂移依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，不是本节对象。VP-SDE 又与 VE-SDE 不同：VE-SDE 的漂移为零、扩散系数随时间增大，而 VP-SDE 的漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t$</span> 承担“收缩”作用，用以在注入噪声的同时抑制方差增长。二者共享“高斯转移核”这一结构，但漂移是否为零是定义层面的分水岭，故本节只定义 VP，不展开 VE。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-1-线性-SDE-的解与-Itô-等距\">1. 线性 SDE 的解与 Itô 等距<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-1-线性-SDE-的解与-Itô-等距\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1.3（显式解）</strong> 在假设 1.1 下，VP-SDE 的强解几乎必然满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=e^{-\\frac12\\bar\\beta_t}x_0+\\int_0^t e^{-\\frac12(\\bar\\beta_t-\\bar\\beta_s)}\\sqrt{\\beta_s}\\,dW_s,\\qquad t\\in[0,T].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t:=e^{\\frac12\\bar\\beta_t}x_t$</span>。由 Itô 公式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=e^{\\frac12\\bar\\beta_t}x$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 绝对连续，满足 Itô 公式的假设），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dy_t=e^{\\frac12\\bar\\beta_t}\\Big(dx_t+\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,dt\\Big)\n=e^{\\frac12\\bar\\beta_t}\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,dW_t.$$</div>\n<p>两边从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t=y_0+\\int_0^t e^{\\frac12\\bar\\beta_s}\\sqrt{\\beta_s}\\,dW_s$</span>。代回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=e^{-\\frac12\\bar\\beta_t}y_t$</span> 即得所述表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.4（一阶、二阶矩）</strong> 在假设 1.1 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[x_t\\mid x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cov}(x_t\\mid x_0)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1.3，条件期望中随机积分项的条件期望为零（Itô 积分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_0$</span> 的条件期望为零，因其为鞅且初值为零，且被积函数确定），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_t\\mid x_0]=e^{-\\frac12\\bar\\beta_t}x_0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>。协方差由 Itô 等距：随机积分项的协方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t e^{-(\\bar\\beta_t-\\bar\\beta_s)}\\beta_s\\,ds\\cdot I_d\n=\\Big(e^{-\\bar\\beta_t}\\int_0^t e^{\\bar\\beta_s}\\beta_s\\,ds\\Big)I_d\n=e^{-\\bar\\beta_t}\\big(e^{\\bar\\beta_t}-1\\big)I_d=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d,$$</div>\n<p>其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t e^{\\bar\\beta_s}\\beta_s\\,ds=e^{\\bar\\beta_t}-e^{\\bar\\beta_0}=e^{\\bar\\beta_t}-1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_0=0$</span> 且被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{ds}e^{\\bar\\beta_s}$</span>）。交叉项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 独立而为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.5（方差保持恒等式）</strong> 在假设 1.1 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}x_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(x_0)=I_d$</span>，则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(x_t)=I_d$</span>，即边缘方差被精确保持。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由全协方差公式与命题 1.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(x_t)=\\mathbb{E}\\operatorname{Cov}(x_t\\mid x_0)+\\operatorname{Cov}(\\mathbb{E}[x_t\\mid x_0])=\\mathbb{E}[(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d]+\\operatorname{Cov}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d+\\bar\\alpha_t I_d=I_d$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论解释了“方差保持”名称的来源：当数据标准化到单位协方差时，任意时刻的边缘协方差恒为单位阵。注意这是<strong>边缘</strong>性质，不是轨道性质；单条轨道并不保持范数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-2-前向过程的马尔可夫性与半群\">2. 前向过程的马尔可夫性与半群<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-2-前向过程的马尔可夫性与半群\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1.6（转移核）</strong> 在假设 1.1 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)$</span> 是时齐 Markov 过程（漂移与扩散系数不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 之外的依赖，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，故严格说是<strong>非时齐</strong> Markov 过程），其转移核为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{t\\mid s}(x_t\\in A\\mid x_s=x)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_t;\\ \\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid s}}\\,x,\\ (1-\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid s})I_d\\big),\\qquad 0\\le s&lt;t\\le T,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid s}:=e^{-\\int_s^t\\beta_u du}=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，由命题 1.3 的积分表示，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=e^{-\\frac12\\int_s^t\\beta_u du}x_s+\\int_s^t e^{-\\frac12\\int_u^t\\beta_v dv}\\sqrt{\\beta_u}\\,dW_u$</span>。第二项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span> 可测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span> 与独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span> 的高斯增量（布朗运动增量独立）的确定性线性组合，且其条件分布由 Itô 等距给出协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid s})I_d$</span>，均值零。故条件分布为所述高斯。Markov 性由解的强解唯一性与布朗运动的 Markov 性直接得到（条件分布只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.7（半群相容性）</strong> 在命题 1.6 的记号下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;u&lt;t\\le T$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid s}=\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid u}\\bar\\alpha_{u\\mid s}$</span>，且转移核满足 Chapman–Kolmogorov 等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{t\\mid s}(A\\mid x)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_{t\\mid u}(A\\mid y)\\,p_{u\\mid s}(dy\\mid x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 指数可加性给出第一个等式。对第二个等式，只需验证两个高斯核的卷积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{u\\mid s}}x,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{u\\mid s})I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid u}}y,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid u})I_d)$</span> 的复合。复合后的均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid u}}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{u\\mid s}}x=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid s}}x$</span>，协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid u}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{u\\mid s})I_d+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid u})I_d=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid u}\\bar\\alpha_{u\\mid s})I_d=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid s})I_d$</span>，与命题 1.6 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-3-连续时间与离散-DDPM-的接口-仅定义层面\">3. 连续时间与离散 DDPM 的接口（仅定义层面）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-3-连续时间与离散-DDPM-的接口-仅定义层面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.8（离散 VP 链）</strong> 给定步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span> 与离散调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_n\\}_{n=1}^N\\subset(0,1)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_n:=1-\\beta_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n:=\\prod_{k=1}^n\\alpha_k$</span>。离散 VP 前向链定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_n=\\sqrt{\\alpha_n}\\,x_{n-1}+\\sqrt{1-\\alpha_n}\\,\\varepsilon_n,\\qquad \\varepsilon_n\\overset{iid}{\\sim}\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),\\ n=1,\\dots,N.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1.9（离散链的闭式边缘）</strong> 在定义 1.8 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n}\\,\\bar\\varepsilon_n,\\qquad \\bar\\varepsilon_n\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\varepsilon_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\alpha_1}\\varepsilon_1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\alpha_1$</span> 一致。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 时成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_n=\\sqrt{\\alpha_n}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}}\\bar\\varepsilon_{n-1}\\big)+\\sqrt{1-\\alpha_n}\\varepsilon_n\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n}x_0+\\sqrt{\\alpha_n(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1})}\\bar\\varepsilon_{n-1}+\\sqrt{1-\\alpha_n}\\varepsilon_n.$$</div>\n<p>后两项为独立高斯之和，协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_n(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1})I_d+(1-\\alpha_n)I_d=(1-\\alpha_n\\bar\\alpha_{n-1})I_d=(1-\\bar\\alpha_n)I_d$</span>，故可合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n}\\bar\\varepsilon_n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.10（连续极限的匹配条件）</strong> 设离散调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n=\\beta(n\\Delta t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 Riemann 可积。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=n\\Delta t$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n\\to\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s ds}$</span>，从而离散边缘分布依分布收敛到 VP-SDE 的边缘分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Riemann 和的收敛性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k\\Delta t\\to\\int_0^t\\beta_s ds$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_n=\\sum_{k=1}^n\\log(1-\\beta_k)\\to-\\int_0^t\\beta_s ds$</span>（用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-u)=-u+O(u^2)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k\\beta_k\\to0$</span>，后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 保证）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n\\to\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。再由命题 1.9 与命题 1.6，两族高斯的均值与协方差均收敛，故依分布收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题只建立<strong>边缘分布</strong>层面的对应；轨道层面的 Euler–Maruyama 收敛需要额外假设（漂移 Lipschitz、扩散一致有界），留待第 8 节处理。本节不越界展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-4-具体例子-一维标准正态数据的-VP-边缘\">4. 具体例子：一维标准正态数据的 VP 边缘<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-4-具体例子-一维标准正态数据的-VP-边缘\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1.11</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\beta t}$</span>，由命题 1.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{e^{-\\beta t}}x_0,1-e^{-\\beta t})$</span>，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{0.5}=e^{-1}\\approx0.3679$</span>，均值系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{0.5}}\\approx0.6065$</span>，噪声系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{0.5}}\\approx0.7951$</span>。直接验证方差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6065^2+0.7951^2=0.3679+0.6321=1$</span>，与推论 1.5 一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nd, beta, t = 1, 2.0, 0.5\nabar = np.exp(-beta * t)\nmean_coef = np.sqrt(abar)\nnoise_coef = np.sqrt(1.0 - abar)\n\n# 解析方差\nvar_analytic = mean_coef**2 + noise_coef**2\nassert np.isclose(var_analytic, 1.0), var_analytic\nprint(&quot;abar =&quot;, abar, &quot;mean_coef =&quot;, mean_coef, &quot;noise_coef =&quot;, noise_coef)\nprint(&quot;analytic variance =&quot;, var_analytic)\n\n# 蒙特卡洛验证边缘方差\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nn = 200000\nx0 = rng.standard_normal(n)\neps = rng.standard_normal(n)\nxt = mean_coef * x0 + noise_coef * eps\nprint(&quot;xt shape =&quot;, xt.shape, &quot;empirical var =&quot;, xt.var())\nassert abs(xt.var() - 1.0) &lt; 0.02\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>abar = 0.36787944117144233</code>，<code>analytic variance = 1.0</code>，<code>xt shape = (200000,)</code>，经验方差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.0$</span>（容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span> 内）。该例同时验证了命题 1.4 的均值/协方差公式与推论 1.5 的方差保持恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>VP-SDE 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,dW_t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 非负、局部有界、可积的假设下强解存在唯一，显式解由命题 1.3 给出，其条件均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 与条件协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span> 精确刻画了“信号衰减 + 噪声注入”的平衡。</li>\n<li>转移核为高斯核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid s}}x,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t\\mid s})I_d)$</span>，满足 Chapman–Kolmogorov 相容性；当数据标准化到单位协方差时边缘协方差恒为单位阵，这是“方差保持”的精确含义（推论 1.5）。</li>\n<li>离散 VP 链的闭式边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n}\\bar\\varepsilon_n$</span> 与连续时间公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n=\\beta(n\\Delta t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> Riemann 可积时于边缘分布层面一致（命题 1.9、1.10），为后续节的闭式边缘、信噪比与 DDPM 对应提供了定义层面的接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-5-生成元与-Fokker-Planck-方程-定义的算子表述\">5. 生成元与 Fokker–Planck 方程：定义的算子表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-5-生成元与-Fokker-Planck-方程-定义的算子表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1.3 与 1.6 给出了 VP-SDE 的轨道与核表述；本节再给出其<strong>算子表述</strong>，因为后续反向 SDE 章与得分动力学都以生成元为接口。这一小节只做定义与一个恒等式的推导，不涉及反向过程。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1.12（VP 生成元）</strong> 在假设 1.1 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>（二阶连续可微且二阶导有界），定义 VP-SDE 的无穷小生成元</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal{L}_t f)(x):=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\,x\\cdot\\nabla f(x)+\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\,\\Delta f(x),\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,\\ t\\in[0,T],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f$</span> 为梯度（列向量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta f=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_{x_i}^2 f$</span> 为 Laplacian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cdot$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的标准内积。指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.13（Dynkin 公式）</strong> 在假设 1.1 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta f$</span> 有界。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[f(x_t)\\mid x_s=x\\big]=f(x)+\\int_s^t\\mathbb{E}\\big[(\\mathcal{L}_u f)(x_u)\\mid x_s=x\\big]\\,du.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_u)$</span> 用 Itô 公式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_u$</span> 为连续半鞅，二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle x\\rangle_u=\\beta_u I_d\\,du$</span>，满足 Itô 公式假设）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(x_t)-f(x_s)=\\int_s^t\\nabla f(x_u)\\cdot dx_u+\\tfrac12\\int_s^t\\sum_{i,j=1}^d\\partial_{x_i x_j}f(x_u)\\,d\\langle x^i,x^j\\rangle_u.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_u=-\\tfrac12\\beta_u x_u\\,du+\\sqrt{\\beta_u}\\,dW_u$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle x^i,x^j\\rangle_u=\\beta_u\\delta_{ij}\\,du$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(x_t)-f(x_s)=\\int_s^t\\Big[-\\tfrac12\\beta_u x_u\\cdot\\nabla f(x_u)+\\tfrac12\\beta_u\\Delta f(x_u)\\Big]du+\\int_s^t\\sqrt{\\beta_u}\\,\\nabla f(x_u)\\cdot dW_u.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span> 取条件期望。随机积分项为鞅，条件期望为零；被积函数有界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta f$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 局部有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_u\\|$</span> 在有限区间上平方可积），故可用 Fubini 定理交换条件期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$du$</span> 积分（被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\omega,u)$</span> 可积，由有界性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_s^t\\beta_u du&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.14（Fokker–Planck 方程）</strong> 在假设 1.1 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|^2p_0(x)dx&lt;\\infty$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 存在，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 在分布意义下满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\,\\nabla\\cdot\\big(x\\,p_t(x)\\big)+\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\,\\Delta p_t(x),\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 为散度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(xp)=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_{x_i}(x_i p)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 取测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>（紧支撑光滑）。由命题 1.13 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>（紧支撑故各阶导有界），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi(x)p_t(x)dx=\\int(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)p_t(x)dx.$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Delta\\varphi$</span> 代入，并对第一项分部积分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑，边界通量消失；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的支撑外为零，故边界项为零），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)p_t\\,dx=\\int\\varphi\\Big[\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\nabla\\cdot(xp_t)+\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Delta p_t\\Big]dx.$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 任意，上式即 Fokker–Planck 方程的分布表述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.15（高斯解的自洽性）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，且它满足命题 1.14 的方程。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=(2\\pi)^{-d/2}e^{-\\|x\\|^2/2}$</span> 代入。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t=-x\\,p_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t=(\\|x\\|^2-d)p_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(xp_t)=d\\,p_t+x\\cdot\\nabla p_t=d\\,p_t-\\|x\\|^2p_t$</span>。于是右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\beta_t[(d-\\|x\\|^2)+(\\|x\\|^2-d)]p_t=0=\\partial_t p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是推论 1.5 的密度版本：边缘分布不随时间变化，正是“方差保持”的分布含义。它与命题 1.13、1.14 一起，把 VP-SDE 的轨道、核、算子三种表述闭合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-6-时间重参数化下的不变性\">6. 时间重参数化下的不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-6-时间重参数化下的不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后续第 6 节将讨论信噪比与时间重参数化；本节只建立一个<strong>定义层面</strong>的事实：VP-SDE 在单调时间变换下保持同一族边缘分布，这为“同一过程的不同时间坐标”提供依据，避免把时间坐标与过程本身混为一谈。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1.16（时间重参数化）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:[0,T]\\to[0,T']$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格递增满射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(0)=0$</span>。定义新过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_\\tau:=x_{\\tau^{-1}(\\tau)}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_u:=x_{t(u)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t(u):=\\tau^{-1}(u)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.17（重参数化后的 SDE）</strong> 在假设 1.1 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_u$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\tilde x_u=-\\tfrac12\\tilde\\beta_u\\tilde x_u\\,du+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_u}\\,d\\tilde W_u,\\qquad \\tilde\\beta_u:=\\beta_{t(u)}\\,t'(u),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W_u:=\\int_0^u\\sqrt{t'(v)}\\,dW_{t(v)}$</span> 是标准布朗运动（在 filtration <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal{F}}_u:=\\mathcal{F}_{t(u)}$</span> 下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Lévy 刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W$</span> 是连续鞅且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\tilde W^i,\\tilde W^j\\rangle_u=\\int_0^u t'(v)\\delta_{ij}dv=u\\,\\delta_{ij}$</span>，故为标准布朗运动。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t(u)}$</span> 用 Itô 公式（时间变换的链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in C^1$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_{t(u)}=-\\tfrac12\\beta_{t(u)}x_{t(u)}\\,t'(u)\\,du+\\sqrt{\\beta_{t(u)}}\\,t'(u)^{1/2}\\,dW_{t(u)}.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_{t(u)}=t'(u)^{1/2}d\\tilde W_u$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W$</span> 的定义反解），故扩散项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\beta_{t(u)}t'(u)}\\,d\\tilde W_u=\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_u}\\,d\\tilde W_u$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.18（边缘不变性）</strong> 在命题 1.17 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_u$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t(u)}$</span> 同分布，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_u=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t(u)}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t(u)}}\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_u=x_{t(u)}$</span> 逐轨道相等，故同分布；再由命题 1.4 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=t(u)$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：时间重参数化只改变“速率”，不改变“路径上的点”。因此后续讨论信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 时，可以自由选择时间坐标而不损失一般性；但必须区分“过程”与“坐标”，这正是禁止把目标值相等当成梯度相等的同类纪律在定义层面的体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-7-一个可检验的恒等式-得分与边缘密度的关系\">7. 一个可检验的恒等式：得分与边缘密度的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-7-一个可检验的恒等式-得分与边缘密度的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个<strong>仅由定义与命题 1.4 推出</strong>的恒等式，作为与后续得分动力学章的接口。它不依赖反向 SDE，也不依赖得分匹配的任何训练目标。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.19（VP 边缘得分）</strong> 在假设 1.1 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 由命题 1.14 给出。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的点，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\frac{\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x\\mid x_t=x\\big]}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\int p_{t\\mid 0}(x\\mid x_0)p_0(x_0)dx_0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t\\mid 0}(x\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}(x;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求梯度并在积分号下求导（被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 光滑，且高斯核的梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\|x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|^2/(2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))}$</span> 控制，可用 Leibniz 法则，条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x_0\\|p_0(x_0)dx_0&lt;\\infty$</span>，由假设 1.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla p_t(x)=\\int\\Big(-\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)p_{t\\mid 0}(x\\mid x_0)p_0(x_0)dx_0.$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span>，并注意被积函数中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t\\mid 0}p_0/p_t$</span> 正是后验密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0\\mid t}(x_0\\mid x)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\mathbb{E}[\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x\\mid x_t=x]}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.20（高斯数据的闭式得分）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-x$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 1.15，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-x$</span>。也可由命题 1.19 验证：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x$</span>（高斯条件期望的线性性），代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t x-x)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=-x$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.19 是本节与后续得分动力学章的唯一接口：它把“条件期望”这一概率对象与“得分”这一分析对象精确对应，且分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时趋于零，提示了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近的数值敏感性——这一边界情形按纪律留待第 10 节反例节处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-8-定义的自洽性检查-三个表述的等价链\">8. 定义的自洽性检查：三个表述的等价链<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-8-定义的自洽性检查-三个表述的等价链\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节已给出 VP-SDE 的三种表述：轨道（命题 1.3）、核（命题 1.6）、算子/密度（命题 1.13、1.14）。三者必须自洽，否则定义不成立。本小节给出等价链的验证，作为定义收尾。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.21（三表述等价）</strong> 在假设 1.1 与命题 1.14 的密度假设下，以下三条等价：(i) 命题 1.3 的轨道解；(ii) 命题 1.6 的高斯转移核；(iii) 命题 1.14 的 Fokker–Planck 解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：已由命题 1.6 证明。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：高斯核族关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可微，直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\int p_{t\\mid 0}(x\\mid x_0)p_0(x_0)dx_0$</span> 求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t$</span> 并验证等于 Fokker–Planck 右端（对高斯核逐点验证，再用 Leibniz 法则在积分号下求导，条件同命题 1.19）。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：Fokker–Planck 方程的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|^2p_0&lt;\\infty$</span> 下唯一（由命题 1.13 的 Dynkin 公式与测试函数逼近），而命题 1.3 的轨道解诱导的密度满足该方程，故二者一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题不引入新对象，只确认定义的三个面向指向同一过程。它也是后续“闭式边缘分布”节的逻辑前提：只有在三表述等价成立时，才能用任一表述计算边缘而不担心不一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 验证命题 1.19 与推论 1.20：高斯数据下得分恒为 -x\nd, beta, t = 4, 1.5, 0.7\nabar = np.exp(-beta * t)\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nn = 100000\nx0 = rng.standard_normal((n, d))\neps = rng.standard_normal((n, d))\nxt = np.sqrt(abar) * x0 + np.sqrt(1 - abar) * eps\n\n# 后验均值 E[x0 | xt] 的解析值（高斯情形）\npost_mean = np.sqrt(abar) * xt\nscore_formula = (np.sqrt(abar) * post_mean - xt) / (1 - abar)\nscore_direct = -xt\nassert np.allclose(score_formula, score_direct, atol=1e-10)\nprint(&quot;xt shape =&quot;, xt.shape, &quot;max |score_formula - (-xt)| =&quot;, np.abs(score_formula + xt).max())\n\n# 验证命题 1.14：高斯密度下 Fokker-Planck 右端为零\nx = rng.standard_normal((n, d))\np = np.exp(-0.5 * (x**2).sum(axis=1)) / (2 * np.pi) ** (d / 2)\ngrad_logp = -x\nlap_term = ((x**2).sum(axis=1) - d) * p\ndiv_term = (d - (x**2).sum(axis=1)) * p\nrhs = 0.5 * beta * (div_term + lap_term)\nassert np.allclose(rhs, 0.0, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;max |Fokker-Planck rhs| =&quot;, np.abs(rhs).max())\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>xt shape = (100000, 4)</code>，<code>max |score_formula - (-xt)| = 0.0</code>（数值误差内），<code>max |Fokker-Planck rhs| = 0.0</code>（数值误差内）。该代码同时检验命题 1.19 的得分恒等式与命题 1.14 在高斯解下的自洽性（推论 1.15）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-9-定义边界的显式声明\">9. 定义边界的显式声明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-9-定义边界的显式声明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的定义依赖三条假设，缺一不可，此处显式列出其作用与失效方式，为第 10 节反例节预留接口（本节不展开反例构造）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 非负</strong>：保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 单调不增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span> 为实数。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 变号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 可能大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，命题 1.4 的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 可能为负，转移核不再是概率核。</li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 局部有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta&lt;\\infty$</span></strong>：保证命题 1.3 的随机积分平方可积、命题 1.13 的 Fubini 交换合法。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta=\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处边缘退化为纯噪声，命题 1.19 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 但分子中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to0$</span>，得分公式仍形式成立但需重新验证可积性。</li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span></strong>：保证命题 1.19 中 Leibniz 求导的支配条件。若仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>，得分公式的分子可能不可积；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 有重尾，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 附近可能不满足命题 1.14 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 密度假设。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三条不是“适当条件”，而是本节每个命题证明中实际用到的条件；第 10 节将给出至少一个违反其中一条导致公式失效的具体构造。本节到此为止，不再引入新符号或新命题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-VE-SDE-的定义\">VE-SDE 的定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-VE-SDE-的定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据随机变量，其分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 为连续时间指标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为 VP 节的非负速率函数。本节新引入如下符号，并在此一次性定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\sigma_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span>：噪声尺度函数，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格单调递增、连续可微。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\varepsilon_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span>：标准布朗运动，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立，其自然滤流记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{F}_t)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span>：VE 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘分布密度（相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的 Lebesgue 测度）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span>：给定初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件分布密度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t:=\\sigma_t^2 I_d\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span>：VE 过程的累积协方差矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维单位阵。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列如下，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 初值可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的欧氏范数。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 噪声尺度正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:[0,T]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 连续可微、严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\sigma_s^2\\,\\mathrm{d}s&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 独立性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\varepsilon_t:t\\ge 0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_0)$</span> 相互独立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 可测性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 为 Borel 概率测度，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布函数可测。</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，本节所有期望、积分与求导均可交换，依据将在各命题证明中显式引用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-1-VE-SDE-的构造性定义\">1. VE-SDE 的构造性定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-1-VE-SDE-的构造性定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.1（VE-SDE）</strong> 称如下 Itô 随机微分方程初值问题为方差爆炸（Variance Exploding，VE）扩散：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}x_t = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\Sigma_t}{\\mathrm{d}t}}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_t,\\qquad x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}},\\qquad t\\in[0,T],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\mathrm{d}\\Sigma_t/\\mathrm{d}t}$</span> 按矩阵平方根理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\sqrt{2\\dot\\sigma_t}\\,I_d$</span> 的记号约定——更精确地，本节采用如下等价标量形式作为定义本体：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}x_t = g_t\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_t,\\qquad g_t:=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{d}(\\sigma_t^2)}{\\mathrm{d}t}}=\\sqrt{2\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t=\\mathrm{d}\\sigma_t/\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。在 (A2) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 连续、非负、平方可积。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>。VP-SDE（第 1 节）的漂移项非零，形如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_t$</span>，其漂移将状态向原点收缩，从而保持方差有界；VE-SDE 的漂移项恒为零，状态仅由布朗运动驱动，故方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 单调增长。二者在“是否含确定性收缩”这一点上结构性不同：VE 是纯加性噪声过程，VP 是带线性收缩的加性噪声过程。这一区别将在第 7 节（方差保持与方差爆炸）中定量刻画，本节只作定义层面的区分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.2（VE-SDE 的强解存在唯一）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，定义 1.1 的初值问题存在唯一强解，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t = x_0 + \\int_0^t g_s\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_s.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。漂移项为零，扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续且平方可积（由 (A2)），故满足 Itô 存在唯一性定理的 Lipschitz 与线性增长条件（此处漂移为零，扩散系数仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，条件自动满足）。强解由 Itô 积分给出。独立性 (A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与布朗运动可在同一概率空间上联合构造。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.3（VE 过程的显式表达）</strong> 在命题 1.2 的条件下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t = x_0 + \\sigma_t\\,\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),\\ \\varepsilon\\perp x_0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 1.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-x_0=\\int_0^t g_s\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_s$</span>。Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t g_s\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_s$</span> 是高斯随机变量，其均值为零，协方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}\\!\\left(\\int_0^t g_s\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_s\\right)=\\int_0^t g_s^2\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\,I_d=\\int_0^t 2\\sigma_s\\dot\\sigma_s\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\,I_d=\\bigl(\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_0^2\\bigr)I_d=\\sigma_t^2 I_d,$$</div>\n<p>其中第二个等号用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_s^2=2\\sigma_s\\dot\\sigma_s$</span>，第三个等号用了微积分基本定理与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>（(A2)）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t g_s\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_s\\stackrel{d}{=}\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>。独立性来自 Itô 积分对初值的可加分解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1.3 正是本章 canonical claim 中 VE 的闭式表达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>；本节把它作为定义 1.1 的推论而非独立假设导出，从而保证符号自洽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-2-条件转移核的闭式表达\">2. 条件转移核的闭式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-2-条件转移核的闭式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（VE 高斯转移核）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\bigl(x_t;\\,x_0,\\,\\sigma_t^2 I_d\\bigr),$$</div>\n<p>即密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)^{-d/2}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\|x_t-x_0\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由推论 1.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是确定性平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 加上高斯向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，故条件分布为均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span> 的高斯分布。密度表达式由多元高斯密度公式直接写出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.2（与 VP 转移核的对照）</strong> VP 节的转移核形如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，其均值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 收缩、协方差有界；VE 的转移核均值恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、协方差无界增长。二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时的极限行为截然不同，这一差异将在第 3 节（高斯转移核的闭式解）中统一处理，本节只给出 VE 侧闭式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-3-边缘分布的闭式表达\">3. 边缘分布的闭式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-3-边缘分布的闭式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3.1（VE 边缘分布）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘分布为高斯混合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\mathcal{N}\\bigl(x_t;\\,x_0,\\,\\sigma_t^2 I_d\\bigr)\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(\\mathrm{d}x_0).$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)^{-d/2}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\|x_t-x_0\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\right)p_0(x_0)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 为条件密度。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 积分即得边缘密度。积分与期望的交换由 Fubini 定理保证：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto\\mathcal{N}(x_t;x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)p_0(x_0)$</span> 关于乘积测度非负可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\int\\mathcal{N}\\,p_0\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0\\,\\mathrm{d}x_t=1&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 Fubini 适用。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.2（VE 边缘分布的一阶二阶矩）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[x_t]=\\mathbb{E}[x_0],\\qquad \\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+\\sigma_t^2 I_d.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由推论 1.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\perp x_0$</span>。取期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_t]=\\mathbb{E}[x_0]+\\sigma_t\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon]=\\mathbb{E}[x_0]$</span>。取协方差，由独立性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+\\sigma_t^2\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon)=\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+\\sigma_t^2 I_d.$$</div>\n<p>这里用了协方差的双线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon)=I_d$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3.2 是“方差爆炸”名称的数学来源：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+d\\sigma_t^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 无界增长。该名称的定量刻画留待第 7 节，本节只确认恒等式成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-4-一个可检验的恒等式-得分与边缘分布的关系\">4. 一个可检验的恒等式：得分与边缘分布的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-4-一个可检验的恒等式-得分与边缘分布的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4.1（VE 得分恒等式）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度有密度、密度可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\bigl(\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]-x_t\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 3.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\int\\mathcal{N}(x_t;x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)p_{\\mathrm{data}}(\\mathrm{d}x_0)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度，高斯密度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{x_t-x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}\\mathcal{N}$</span>。在积分号下求导需验证 Leibniz 条件：被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微，且其梯度被可积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\|x_t-x_0\\|}{\\sigma_t^2}\\mathcal{N}$</span> 控制；由 (A1) 与高斯密度的指数衰减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\frac{\\|x_t-x_0\\|}{\\sigma_t^2}\\mathcal{N}\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(\\mathrm{d}x_0)&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立，故 Leibniz 法则适用。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\int\\left(-\\frac{x_t-x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}\\right)\\mathcal{N}(x_t;x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(\\mathrm{d}x_0).$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)$</span>，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathcal{N}\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(\\mathrm{d}x_0)}{p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)}$</span> 正是后验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\left(\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]-x_t\\right).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.1 是 VE 侧得分函数的闭式表达，也是第 15 节（与反向 SDE 章的接口）所需的输入：反向 SDE 的漂移将直接调用该得分。本节只建立恒等式，不展开反向动力学。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-5-具体例子-一维标准高斯的-VE-边缘\">5. 具体例子：一维标准高斯的 VE 边缘<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-5-具体例子-一维标准高斯的-VE-边缘\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 5.1</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>）。验证命题 3.1 与推论 3.2。</p>\n<p>由命题 3.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\int\\mathcal{N}(x_t;x_0,t^2)\\mathcal{N}(x_0;0,1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0$</span>。两个高斯的卷积仍为高斯，均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+t^2$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\,1+t^2).$$</div>\n<p>由推论 3.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_t]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=1+t^2$</span>，与直接计算一致。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)=p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span> 的边界条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时说明：VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处退化为数据分布，这与 VP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 的退化一致；但 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处的边缘方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+T^2$</span> 而非有界，正是“爆炸”一词的由来。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-6-代码-VE-闭式采样与恒等式验证\">6. 代码：VE 闭式采样与恒等式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-6-代码-VE-闭式采样与恒等式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码实现推论 1.3 的采样与命题 4.1 的得分恒等式数值验证，全部可运行、带 assert。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd = 4\nN = 200_000\n\n# 数据分布：标准高斯\nx0 = rng.standard_normal((N, d))\n\n# 噪声尺度：sigma_t = t, t in [0, 1]\ndef sigma(t):\n    return t\n\n# 推论 1.3：x_t = x_0 + sigma_t * eps\nt = 0.7\neps = rng.standard_normal((N, d))\nxt = x0 + sigma(t) * eps\nassert xt.shape == (N, d)\n\n# 验证推论 3.2：均值与协方差\nmean_xt = xt.mean(axis=0)\ncov_xt = np.cov(xt, rowvar=False)\nexpected_cov = np.eye(d) * (1.0 + sigma(t)**2)\nassert np.allclose(mean_xt, np.zeros(d), atol=0.02)\nassert np.allclose(cov_xt, expected_cov, atol=0.05)\n\n# 验证命题 4.1：得分恒等式\n# 对标准高斯数据，后验均值 E[x0 | xt] = xt / (1 + sigma_t^2)\npost_mean = xt / (1.0 + sigma(t)**2)\nscore_numeric = (post_mean - xt) / sigma(t)**2\n# 解析得分：nabla log N(0, 1+t^2) = -xt / (1+t^2)\nscore_analytic = -xt / (1.0 + sigma(t)**2)\nassert np.allclose(score_numeric, score_analytic, atol=1e-6)\n\nprint(&quot;xt shape:&quot;, xt.shape)\nprint(&quot;mean_xt:&quot;, mean_xt)\nprint(&quot;cov_xt diag:&quot;, np.diag(cov_xt))\nprint(&quot;expected cov diag:&quot;, np.diag(expected_cov))\nprint(&quot;score check passed:&quot;, np.allclose(score_numeric, score_analytic))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>xt shape: (200000, 4)</code>；<code>mean_xt</code> 各分量接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；<code>cov_xt diag</code> 各分量接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.49$</span>；<code>score check passed: True</code>。代码中 <code>assert</code> 全部通过，验证了推论 1.3、推论 3.2 与命题 4.1 在标准高斯数据上的正确性。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>VE-SDE 定义为漂移为零、扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\sqrt{2\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t}$</span> 的 Itô 方程，其强解由命题 1.2 给出，显式表达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 由推论 1.3 严格导出，与本章 canonical claim 一致。</li>\n<li>VE 的高斯转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>（命题 2.1），边缘分布为高斯混合（命题 3.1），其一阶二阶矩恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>（推论 3.2）定量刻画了“方差爆炸”。</li>\n<li>VE 得分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\sigma_t^{-2}(\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]-x_t)$</span>（命题 4.1）在 Leibniz 条件下严格成立，为后续反向 SDE 与得分动力学提供闭式输入；与 VP 的结构性区别在于漂移是否为零，该区别将在第 7 节定量展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-7-生成过程与数据过程的严格分离\">7. 生成过程与数据过程的严格分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-7-生成过程与数据过程的严格分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 1.1 中初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 与布朗运动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 独立，这一独立性不是技术性便利，而是 VE 构造的语义核心。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 视为数据分布的一个样本、把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 视为外部噪声源，则整个前向过程是“数据被外部噪声污染”的加性过程，数据与噪声之间没有任何反馈。这一点与 VP 一致（VP 的漂移项依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 但不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>），但与一般的 SDE 生成模型（例如以数据为漂移吸引子的 Langevin 型过程）在结构上不同：VE 的前向过程不包含任何把状态拉回数据的机制，它只做一件事——以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的尺度叠加独立高斯噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（前向过程的马尔可夫性与半群表示）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 是关于滤流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{F}_t)$</span> 的马尔可夫过程，其转移半群为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(P_{s,t}f)(x)=\\mathbb{E}\\bigl[f(x_t)\\mid x_s=x\\bigr]=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}f(y)\\,\\mathcal{N}\\bigl(y;\\,x,\\,(\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2)I_d\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm{d}y,\\qquad 0\\le s\\le t\\le T,$$</div>\n<p>对任意有界 Borel 可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由推论 1.3 的增量形式，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=x_s+\\bigl(\\sigma_t\\varepsilon_t-\\sigma_s\\varepsilon_s\\bigr),$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon_t-\\sigma_s\\varepsilon_s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span> 独立（布朗运动的独立增量性），且其分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,(\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2)I_d)$</span>——这里用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\sigma_t\\varepsilon_t-\\sigma_s\\varepsilon_s)=\\sigma_t^2 I_d-\\sigma_s^2 I_d$</span> 以及增量的高斯性。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件分布即上述高斯分布平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。马尔可夫性来自条件分布只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span> 而不依赖更早的历史。半群表达式由条件期望的定义直接写出，积分与期望的交换由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界与 Fubini 定理保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7.1 的转移半群只依赖时间差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2$</span>，这提示 VE 的时间参数化存在冗余：真正驱动过程的是累积方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 本身。这一观察将在第 6 节（信噪比与时间重参数化）中被形式化为时间重参数化不变性，本节只记录半群结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-8-与-VP-的漂移结构对照-一个不可交换的极限\">8. 与 VP 的漂移结构对照：一个不可交换的极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-8-与-VP-的漂移结构对照-一个不可交换的极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>VE 与 VP 的差别不仅是“漂移是否为零”，更在于当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 取特定关系时，两者能否在分布层面互相逼近。本节给出一个精确的负结果，说明这种逼近在一般情形下不成立，从而排除“VE 是 VP 的特例”这一常见误读。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（VP 与 VE 的分布不可互换）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 非退化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)\\ne 0$</span>）。则不存在非负速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 使 VP 的边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 与 VE 的边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上恒等，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。VP 的边缘分布（由第 1 节 canonical claim）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}})=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d.$$</div>\n<p>VE 的边缘协方差由推论 3.2 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t^{\\mathrm{VE}})=\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>。若两者分布恒等，则协方差矩阵必相等：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d=\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+\\sigma_t^2 I_d.$$</div>\n<p>移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t-1)\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=(\\sigma_t^2+\\bar\\alpha_t-1)I_d$</span>。左端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)$</span> 的标量倍，右端是单位阵的标量倍。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)\\ne 0$</span> 且非单位阵的标量倍，则两端不可能相等；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=cI_d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\ne 0$</span>，则比较标量得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t-1)c=\\sigma_t^2+\\bar\\alpha_t-1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(\\bar\\alpha_t-1)(c-1)$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span>（VP 节已证），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t-1\\le 0$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge 0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;1$</span> 时右端为负、左端非负，矛盾；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&lt;1$</span> 时右端为正、左端为负，矛盾；仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1$</span> 时两端同时为零，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=I_d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>。故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 不存在这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.1 的结论是：VP 与 VE 是两条结构不同的扩散路径，不能通过调节噪声调度互相转化。它们的共同点仅在于“加性高斯噪声 + 独立初值”这一骨架，而漂移项的有无决定了协方差随时间的定性行为（有界 vs 无界）。这一负结果将在第 7 节（方差保持与方差爆炸）中被正面利用：正因为两者不可互换，才需要分别推导各自的闭式解与得分函数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-9-时间重参数化的不变性\">9. 时间重参数化的不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-9-时间重参数化的不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>VE 的定义中时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 进入方程。若把时间轴重新参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，则 VE-SDE 化为一个标准布朗运动的时间变换。本节把这一观察写成命题，作为第 6 节（信噪比与时间重参数化）的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（VE 的方差时间重参数化）</strong> 在 (A2) 下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(t)=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:[0,T]\\to[0,\\sigma_T^2]$</span> 为严格递增的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_\\tau:=x_{t(\\tau)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t(\\tau)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(t)$</span> 的反函数。则在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{y_\\tau\\}_{\\tau\\in[0,\\sigma_T^2]}$</span> 是标准布朗运动的时间变换，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y_\\tau=x_0+\\sqrt{\\tau}\\,\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),\\ \\varepsilon\\perp x_0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由推论 1.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\sigma_t^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_\\tau=x_0+\\sqrt{\\tau}\\varepsilon$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto\\sqrt{\\tau}$</span> 严格递增且连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_\\tau$</span> 的有限维分布与标准布朗运动经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 时间变换后的分布一致：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\tau_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;\\tau_n$</span>，增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{\\tau_{k+1}}-y_{\\tau_k}=(\\sqrt{\\tau_{k+1}}-\\sqrt{\\tau_k})\\varepsilon$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_{\\tau_k}$</span> 且分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,(\\tau_{k+1}-\\tau_k)I_d)$</span>，这正是时间变换布朗运动的定义性质。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.1 的意义在于：VE 的“时间”在分布层面是冗余的，真正有意义的参数是累积方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\sigma_t^2$</span>。因此任何只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的噪声调度（例如线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=t$</span>、指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=e^{t}-1$</span>）在分布层面给出的是同一个过程的不同时间刻度。这一不变性将在第 9 节（噪声调度的选择）中被用来论证：调度选择影响的是数值离散化的稳定性，而非连续时间下的边缘分布族。本节只建立不变性本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-10-得分恒等式的后验形式与一个可检验推论\">10. 得分恒等式的后验形式与一个可检验推论<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-10-得分恒等式的后验形式与一个可检验推论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4.1 把得分写成后验均值与当前状态的差。本节给出该恒等式的一个等价形式，它在数值实现中更稳定，并给出一个可直接检验的推论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.1（VE 得分的后验分解）</strong> 在命题 4.1 的假设下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}(x_0-x_t)\\,p(x_0\\mid x_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0\\mid x_t)=\\dfrac{\\mathcal{N}(x_t;x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(\\mathrm{d}x_0)}{p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)}$</span> 为后验分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 4.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)=\\sigma_t^{-2}(\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]-x_t)$</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 写成后验积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x_0\\,p(x_0\\mid x_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0$</span>，再减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\int p(x_0\\mid x_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0=x_t$</span>（后验分布归一），即得所述形式。积分与期望的交换由 (A1) 与高斯密度的指数衰减保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 10.2（VE 得分的方向性质）</strong> 在命题 10.1 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 的支撑包含于以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为中心、半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 的球内，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)\\|\\le\\frac{R}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 10.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t)\\|\\le\\sigma_t^{-2}\\int\\|x_0-x_t\\|\\,p(x_0\\mid x_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0$</span>。由支撑假设，被积函数在支撑上不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span>，故积分不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 10.2 给出得分范数的一个先验上界：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 很小时，得分可以很大，这与 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 附近数值不稳定的现象一致。该现象的完整分析属于第 10 节（反例：调度不当导致数值爆炸），本节只记录上界的存在性，不展开失效构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-11-与离散-DDPM-的接口-VE-侧的欧拉离散\">11. 与离散 DDPM 的接口：VE 侧的欧拉离散<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-11-与离散-DDPM-的接口-VE-侧的欧拉离散\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出 VE-SDE 的一个显式离散化，作为第 8 节（离散化与连续化的对应）与第 11 节（与 DDPM 的对应）的接口。离散化本身不在本节展开误差分析，只给出格式与一步的分布恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 11.1（VE 的欧拉-马尔可夫离散）</strong> 取时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=T$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=t_{k+1}-t_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\sigma_k^2=\\sigma_{t_{k+1}}^2-\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span>。VE 的欧拉-马尔可夫离散为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k+1}}=x_{t_k}+\\sqrt{\\Delta\\sigma_k^2}\\,\\xi_k,\\qquad \\xi_k\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),\\ \\xi_k\\perp x_{t_k}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 11.2（离散一步的精确性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，定义 11.1 的一步转移与连续 VE 的精确转移在分布层面恒等：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k+1}}\\mid x_{t_k}\\stackrel{d}{=}\\mathcal{N}\\bigl(x_{t_k},\\,\\Delta\\sigma_k^2 I_d\\bigr)=\\mathcal{N}\\bigl(x_{t_k},\\,(\\sigma_{t_{k+1}}^2-\\sigma_{t_k}^2)I_d\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 7.1，连续 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_k,t_{k+1}]$</span> 上的精确转移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x_{t_k},(\\sigma_{t_{k+1}}^2-\\sigma_{t_k}^2)I_d)$</span>。定义 11.1 的一步是确定性平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 加上高斯向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Delta\\sigma_k^2}\\,\\xi_k$</span>，其分布正是上述高斯分布。故两者在分布层面恒等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11.2 说明：对 VE 而言，欧拉-马尔可夫离散在<strong>边缘分布</strong>意义下是精确的，误差只出现在多步复合时的路径层面（因为离散过程在每个网格点上的条件分布与连续过程一致，但网格点之间的插值路径不同）。这一性质是 VE 相对于 VP 的一个结构性优势：VP 的欧拉离散在有限步下不精确，因为其漂移项需要指数积分；而 VE 的漂移为零，离散一步即精确。该优势的代价是 VE 的方差无界，需要更细的尾部网格，这将在第 9 节与第 10 节中定量讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.3（多步复合的分布恒等）</strong> 在命题 11.2 的条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le k\\le n$</span>，离散过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 处的边缘分布与连续 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 处的边缘分布恒等：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_k}^{\\mathrm{disc}}\\stackrel{d}{=}x_{t_k}^{\\mathrm{cont}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0$</span> 时两者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 时成立，则由命题 11.2 的一步精确性与马尔可夫性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k+1}}^{\\mathrm{disc}}\\mid x_{t_k}^{\\mathrm{disc}}$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x_{t_k}^{\\mathrm{disc}},\\Delta\\sigma_k^2 I_d)$</span>，与连续过程的条件分布一致；再由归纳假设与全概率公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k+1}}^{\\mathrm{disc}}$</span> 的边缘分布等于连续过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k+1}$</span> 处的边缘分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11.3 是本节最强的离散化结论：VE 的欧拉-马尔可夫离散在<strong>所有网格点上</strong>边缘分布精确，无需步长趋于零。这与 VP 形成鲜明对照——VP 的离散化误差来自漂移项的指数近似，即使步长很小也有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 的偏差。该对照将在第 8 节（离散化与连续化的对应）中被系统化，本节只给出 VE 侧的精确性结论，作为后续章节的接口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-高斯转移核的闭式解\">高斯转移核的闭式解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-高斯转移核的闭式解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 为连续时间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t:[0,T]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 为 VP 的非负速率（前节已假定连续且分段有界），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 为 VE 的噪声尺度（前节已假定连续、单调非降、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu,\\Sigma)$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的高斯测度，密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2\\pi)^{-d/2}(\\det\\Sigma)^{-1/2}\\exp(-\\tfrac12(x-\\mu)^\\top\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\succ0$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 表示给定初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件密度（转移核密度）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 表示边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为数据分布。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设（逐条在命题中引用）：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续且分段有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>；从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 连续可微、严格正、严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续、单调非降、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)</strong> 数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_0}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（保证边缘密度的二阶矩有限，从而高斯卷积良定义）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)</strong> 当需要边缘密度显式表达时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度有密度。</p>\n<p>本节的核心对象是转移核密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。它与相邻概念的区别必须说清：转移核是<strong>条件</strong>分布，描述单个初值在噪声作用下的随机演化；边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\int p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)p_0(x_0)\\,dx_0$</span> 是转移核与数据的卷积，属于下一节的内容。本节只解转移核，不展开边缘。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-转移核的定义与高斯性\">转移核的定义与高斯性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-转移核的定义与高斯性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3.1（转移核的高斯性）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，VP 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_t;\\ \\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\ (1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\big).$$</div>\n<p>在 (A2) 下，VE 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_t;\\ x_0,\\ \\sigma_t^2 I_d\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。<strong>证明</strong>：两式均为仿射变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a_t x_0+b_t\\varepsilon$</span>（VP 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；VE 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sigma_t$</span>）作用于标准高斯。仿射变换保持高斯性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,b_t^2 I_d)$</span>，加确定性平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t x_0$</span> 得均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t x_0$</span>、协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2 I_d$</span>。协方差正定要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t&gt;0$</span>：VP 由 (A1) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>；VE 由 (A2) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意此处<strong>没有</strong>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布做任何假设：命题是关于条件分布的，对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 成立。这是转移核与边缘分布的关键区别。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-主定理-闭式解与半群一致性\">主定理：闭式解与半群一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-主定理-闭式解与半群一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 5.3.2（VP 转移核的半群一致性）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，VP 转移核满足复合恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_{t|s}^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_s)\\,p_s^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_s\\mid x_0)\\,dx_s,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t|s}^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_s)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_t;\\ \\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}}\\,x_s,\\ (1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s})I_d\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}=e^{-\\int_s^t\\beta_u\\,du}=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s=e^{-\\int_s^t\\beta_u du}\\in(0,1)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}&gt;0$</span>，右端核良定义。计算卷积：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_s}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}\\varepsilon_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}}x_s+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}}\\varepsilon_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_1,\\varepsilon_2$</span> 独立标准高斯。代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,\\varepsilon_1+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}}\\,\\varepsilon_2.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}\\bar\\alpha_s=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>。第二、三项是独立高斯之和，协方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s})=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_s}-\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_s}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中第一个等号用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}\\bar\\alpha_s=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 一致。积分与期望的交换是有限维高斯卷积的标准计算，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span> 可积（高斯密度），无需额外 Dominated Convergence 条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.3.3（VP 的加性分解）</strong> 在定理 5.3.2 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t\\ \\stackrel{d}{=}\\ \\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,\\varepsilon_1+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}}\\,\\varepsilon_2,$$</div>\n<p>即 VP 噪声的“方差预算”满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_t-x_0)$</span> 的可加分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s})$</span>。这是 VP 名称“方差保持”的代数根源：噪声注入的方差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}$</span> 衰减后累加。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 5.3.4（VE 转移核的半群一致性）</strong> 设 (A2) 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_t;\\ x_s,\\ (\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2)I_d\\big)\\,p_s^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_s\\mid x_0)\\,dx_s.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=x_0+\\sigma_s\\varepsilon_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_s+\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2}\\,\\varepsilon_2$</span>。由 (A2) 单调非降，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2\\ge0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;\\sigma_s$</span> 时严格正，否则退化为确定性平移（此时核为 Dirac，按测度意义理解）。代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_s\\varepsilon_1+\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2}\\varepsilon_2$</span>，独立高斯之和协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_s^2+(\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2)=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意 VE 的复合核<strong>不</strong>写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x_t;\\ x_s,\\sigma_{t|s}^2 I_d)$</span> 的形式再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_s$</span>，而是方差<strong>差</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2$</span>；这与 VP 的乘性结构 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}$</span> 形成对照。两者都是各自 SDE 的精确解在半群下的体现，但代数形式不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-与-SDE-解的对应\">与 SDE 解的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-与-SDE-解的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3.5（VP 转移核即 VP-SDE 的解）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，考虑 VP-SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,dW_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 给定。则其解在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的条件分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路 + 关键步骤</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，Itô 公式给出生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t f(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\langle x,\\nabla f\\rangle+\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Delta f$</span>。验证高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 满足前向 Kolmogorov 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p=\\mathcal{L}_t^*p$</span>：直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(a_t x_0,b_t^2 I_d)$</span> 求导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot a_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t a_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot b_t^2=\\beta_t(1-b_t^2)$</span> 代入，两端逐项相等。初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_0=1,b_0=0$</span>，密度退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，与 SDE 初值一致。由前向方程解的唯一性（系数 Lipschitz、扩散非退化），该密度即 SDE 解的条件律。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>VE 的对应命题形式相同，将漂移取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>、扩散取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\dot\\sigma_t^2}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 可微时），此处不重复展开，留作读者按同一模板验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-具体例子-一维闭式计算\">具体例子：一维闭式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-具体例子-一维闭式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sigma t$</span>（线性调度）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\beta t}$</span>，VP 转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{e^{-\\beta t}}x_0,(1-e^{-\\beta t}))$</span>；VE 转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x_0,\\sigma^2t^2)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span>：VP 均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1}\\approx0.3679$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{-2}\\approx0.8647$</span>；VE 均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。数值验证见下方代码。此例同时检验了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时方差为零）与单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散与连续的接口-仅限转移核层面\">离散与连续的接口（仅限转移核层面）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散与连续的接口-仅限转移核层面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>离散 DDPM 的转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\,x_{t-1},\\ \\beta_t^{\\mathrm{d}}I_d)$</span> 与本节 VP 核的关系是：将离散步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 与连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t}=\\prod_{k\\le t}(1-\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span> 对齐，则离散复合核与定理 5.3.2 的连续核在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 意义下一致；精确对应与误差阶的完整论证属于第 8 节，本节只声明转移核层面的形式匹配，不展开离散化误差。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef vp_kernel(x0, t, beta):\n    a_bar = np.exp(-beta * t)\n    mean = np.sqrt(a_bar) * x0\n    var = 1.0 - a_bar\n    return mean, var\n\ndef ve_kernel(x0, t, sigma):\n    return x0, (sigma * t) ** 2\n\n# 例：x0=1, t=1, beta=2, sigma=1\nm_vp, v_vp = vp_kernel(1.0, 1.0, 2.0)\nm_ve, v_ve = ve_kernel(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)\nprint(&quot;VP mean, var:&quot;, m_vp, v_vp)\nprint(&quot;VE mean, var:&quot;, m_ve, v_ve)\nassert np.isclose(m_vp, np.exp(-1.0))\nassert np.isclose(v_vp, 1.0 - np.exp(-2.0))\nassert np.isclose(m_ve, 1.0) and np.isclose(v_ve, 1.0)\n\n# 半群一致性数值检验（VP）：s=0.3, t=1.0\ns, t, beta = 0.3, 1.0, 2.0\na_s, a_t = np.exp(-beta * s), np.exp(-beta * t)\na_ts = a_t / a_s\n# 复合方差 = a_ts*(1-a_s) + (1-a_ts) 应等于 1-a_t\ncomposed = a_ts * (1 - a_s) + (1 - a_ts)\nprint(&quot;composed var:&quot;, composed, &quot;direct:&quot;, 1 - a_t)\nassert np.isclose(composed, 1 - a_t)\n\n# 采样形状检验\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd, n = 4, 10000\nx0 = np.ones(d)\neps = rng.standard_normal((n, d))\nxt_vp = np.sqrt(np.exp(-2.0)) * x0 + np.sqrt(1 - np.exp(-2.0)) * eps\nxt_ve = x0 + 1.0 * eps\nprint(&quot;VP samples shape:&quot;, xt_vp.shape, &quot;VE samples shape:&quot;, xt_ve.shape)\nassert xt_vp.shape == (n, d) and xt_ve.shape == (n, d)\nprint(&quot;empirical VP var:&quot;, xt_vp.var(axis=0).mean(), &quot;expected:&quot;, 1 - np.exp(-2.0))\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-转移核的对数密度与二次型结构\">转移核的对数密度与二次型结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-转移核的对数密度与二次型结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节给出了转移核的闭式表达，但后续反向 SDE 与得分匹配需要的是<strong>对数密度的梯度</strong>，即得分函数。本小节把转移核写成对数二次型，为得分动力学做准备，同时给出一个可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3.6（转移核的对数密度）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2) 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，VP 与 VE 转移核的对数密度分别为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}-\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\big(2\\pi(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\big),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\|x_t-x_0\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\big(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接代入命题 5.3.1 的高斯密度定义，协方差矩阵为标量乘单位阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det(b_t^2I_d)=b_t^{2d}$</span>，逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^{-2}I_d$</span>。VP 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，VE 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=\\sigma_t^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.3.7（条件得分的闭式）</strong> 在命题 5.3.6 的假设下，转移核对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad \\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对命题 5.3.6 的对数密度求梯度，二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_t-a\\|^2$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(x_t-a)$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2b_t^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t-a)/b_t^2$</span>，取负号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论是本节与后续得分动力学节的<strong>唯一接口</strong>：反向 SDE 的漂移项需要的是<strong>边缘</strong>得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，而非条件得分；但条件得分是边缘得分的构成元件（通过 Tweedie 恒等式或去噪得分匹配的期望表达），其闭式正是本节转移核的直接产物。本节只交付条件得分，边缘得分的推导留给边缘分布节。</p>\n<p><strong>恒等式检验（可检验推论）</strong>：条件得分与噪声的关系。对 VP，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>对 VE，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-x_0)/\\sigma_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\varepsilon/\\sigma_t$</span>。两式说明条件得分与标准化噪声成反比于噪声尺度：噪声尺度越小（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span>），得分绝对值越大，这正是数值上反向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 附近需要更小步长的原因之一。此恒等式将在代码节用有限差分验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-转移核的-Fourier-变换与特征函数\">转移核的 Fourier 变换与特征函数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-转移核的-Fourier-变换与特征函数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为了在边缘分布节做卷积，本小节给出转移核的特征函数。高斯核的 Fourier 变换仍是高斯，这一性质使 VP 与 VE 的边缘密度可以写成数据特征函数与核特征函数的乘积，从而避免显式卷积积分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3.8（转移核的特征函数）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2) 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\xi\\mid x_0)=\\mathbb{E}[e^{i\\langle\\xi,x_t\\rangle}\\mid x_0]$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\xi\\mid x_0)=\\exp\\Big(i\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\langle\\xi,x_0\\rangle-\\tfrac12(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\|\\xi\\|^2\\Big),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\xi\\mid x_0)=\\exp\\Big(i\\langle\\xi,x_0\\rangle-\\tfrac12\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a_tx_0+b_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[e^{i\\langle\\xi,x_t\\rangle}]=e^{i\\langle\\xi,a_tx_0\\rangle}\\mathbb{E}[e^{i\\langle\\xi,b_t\\varepsilon\\rangle}]$</span>。标准高斯的特征函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[e^{i\\langle\\xi,\\varepsilon\\rangle}]=e^{-\\|\\xi\\|^2/2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[e^{i\\langle\\xi,b_t\\varepsilon\\rangle}]=e^{-b_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2/2}$</span>。VP 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；VE 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=\\sigma_t^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.3.9（特征函数的半群因子化）</strong> 在定理 5.3.2 的假设下，VP 的特征函数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\xi\\mid x_0)=\\varphi_s^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\xi\\mid x_0)\\cdot\\varphi_{t|s}^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\xi\\mid 0),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_{t|s}^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\xi\\mid 0)=\\exp(-\\tfrac12(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s})\\|\\xi\\|^2)$</span>。VE 的对应因子化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\xi\\mid x_0)=\\varphi_s^{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\xi\\mid x_0)\\cdot\\exp(-\\tfrac12(\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2)\\|\\xi\\|^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.3.8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 的指数中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_s}$</span>，方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s})$</span>（推论 5.3.3）。将指数拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_s}\\langle\\xi,x_0\\rangle-\\tfrac12(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)\\|\\xi\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s})\\|\\xi\\|^2$</span> 之和，前者即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_s^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span>，后者即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_{t|s}^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\cdot\\mid0)$</span>。VE 同理，方差项拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_s^2+(\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个因子化是半群一致性的频域表述，与定理 5.3.2 的时域卷积互为对偶。它将在边缘分布节直接用于计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的特征函数：只需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的特征函数乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_t(\\xi\\mid0)$</span>，再做逆变换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-转移核的维度与坐标无关性\">转移核的维度与坐标无关性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-转移核的维度与坐标无关性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节公式均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的标准坐标下写出，但转移核的定义不依赖坐标选择。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\in O(d)$</span> 为正交矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=Qx$</span>。则 VP 转移核在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 坐标下仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}Qx_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\varepsilon\\stackrel{d}{=}\\varepsilon$</span>（标准高斯在正交变换下不变）。VE 同理。这说明转移核的各向同性协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2I_d$</span> 是坐标无关的：在任意正交基下形式不变。若协方差非各向同性（例如各维不同噪声尺度），则需逐维写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t,j}^2$</span>，本节不展开，因为 VP 与 VE 的 canonical 定义均为标量噪声尺度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3.10（正交不变性）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\in O(d)$</span>。则对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(QB\\mid Qx_0)=p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(B\\mid x_0),\\qquad p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(QB\\mid Qx_0)=p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(B\\mid x_0).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(QB\\mid Qx_0)=\\mathbb{P}(x_t\\in QB\\mid x_0)=\\mathbb{P}(Q^{-1}x_t\\in B\\mid x_0)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a_tx_0+b_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{-1}x_t=a_tQ^{-1}x_0+b_tQ^{-1}\\varepsilon$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{-1}\\varepsilon\\stackrel{d}{=}\\varepsilon$</span>，故条件分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(B\\mid x_0)$</span> 相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的用途是：在分析转移核的谱性质（如反向 SDE 的稳定性）时，可以不失一般性地取坐标使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 沿第一坐标轴，简化计算而不损失一般性。这是后续反例节构造数值爆炸例子时的标准技巧，本节只声明性质，不展开应用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-边界情形-t-to0-与-t-to-T-的极限\">边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 的极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-边界情形-t-to0-与-t-to-T-的极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>转移核在两个端点退化，必须显式处理，否则后续反向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 的奇异性无法讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3.11（端点极限）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2) 成立。</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\Rightarrow\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\Rightarrow\\delta_{x_0}$</span>（弱收敛）。</p>\n<p>(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds=\\infty$</span>（VP 的常见调度，如线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p>(iii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span>（VE 的常见调度），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 的协方差发散，不存在弱极限测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 由 (A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，高斯方差趋于零，均值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>；由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>，同理。高斯测度方差趋于零时弱收敛于 Dirac（对任意有界连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}f(a_tx_0+b_t\\varepsilon)\\to f(x_0)$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的连续性，无需 Dominated Convergence 之外的额外条件，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界）。(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时均值项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\to0$</span>，方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，故极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>。(iii) 协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to\\infty$</span>，对任意紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(K\\mid x_0)\\to0$</span>，故不存在概率测度极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.3.11 的 (ii) 是 VP 名称的另一层含义：前向过程在无穷远处收敛到标准高斯，使反向过程有明确的起点分布；而 VE 的 (iii) 说明 VE 必须选取<strong>有限</strong>的终端时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，否则反向 SDE 的初值分布无定义。这一区别将在噪声调度节展开为具体约束，本节只作为转移核端点行为的结论记录。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-一个二维具体例子-协方差矩阵的显式验证\">一个二维具体例子：协方差矩阵的显式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-一个二维具体例子-协方差矩阵的显式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(1,-2)^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\ln2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\ln2}=1/2$</span>。VP 转移核为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\Big(x_t;\\ \\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}(1,-2)^\\top,\\ \\tfrac12 I_2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>显式写出密度：均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt2},-\\sqrt2)^\\top$</span>，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(\\tfrac12,\\tfrac12)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\frac{1}{2\\pi\\cdot\\tfrac12}\\exp\\Big(-\\frac{(x_{t,1}-1/\\sqrt2)^2+(x_{t,2}+\\sqrt2)^2}{2\\cdot\\tfrac12}\\Big)=\\frac{1}{\\pi}\\exp\\Big(-\\big((x_{t,1}-1/\\sqrt2)^2+(x_{t,2}+\\sqrt2)^2\\big)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>验证归一化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^2}p\\,dx_t=\\frac{1}{\\pi}\\cdot\\pi=1$</span>（两个独立标准高斯的乘积，每个积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\pi}$</span>，乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 得 1）。此例同时检验了命题 5.3.6 的对数密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 时的常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{2}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\cdot\\tfrac12)=-\\log\\pi$</span>，与显式密度中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\pi$</span> 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-转移核与得分匹配的接口-仅限条件层面\">转移核与得分匹配的接口（仅限条件层面）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-转移核与得分匹配的接口-仅限条件层面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的最后一个接口是条件得分与去噪目标的关系。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a_tx_0+b_t\\varepsilon$</span>。条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-a_tx_0)/b_t^2=-\\varepsilon/b_t$</span>。因此，若有一个网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 逼近<strong>边缘</strong>得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，则其训练目标（去噪得分匹配）可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{x_0\\sim p_0,\\ \\varepsilon}\\Big\\|s_\\theta(a_tx_0+b_t\\varepsilon,t)+\\frac{\\varepsilon}{b_t}\\Big\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其总体最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 处取得。此式的推导需要边缘得分与条件得分之间的 Tweedie 恒等式，属于边缘分布节；本节只交付条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\varepsilon/b_t$</span> 的闭式，作为该恒等式的被积元件。VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sigma_t$</span>，代入即得两类的具体目标。这一接口是本节与后续得分动力学节的唯一数学连接点，其余内容（边缘得分、反向 SDE 漂移）不在本节展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-转移核的矩阵形式与一般协方差推广\">转移核的矩阵形式与一般协方差推广<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-转移核的矩阵形式与一般协方差推广\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节至此的公式均在标量噪声尺度下写出，即协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2I_d$</span>。为使后续章节处理各维异方差（例如按通道或按坐标分组的噪声调度）时不必重新推导，本小节把转移核写成矩阵形式，并证明标量情形是其特例。这不是新假设，而是对 (A1)、(A2) 的坐标逐维化。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5.3.12（矩阵噪声尺度）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t=\\mathrm{diag}(b_{t,1},\\dots,b_{t,d})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t,j}\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t=\\mathrm{diag}(a_{t,1},\\dots,a_{t,d})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{t,j}&gt;0$</span>。定义矩阵形式的仿射转移</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=A_tx_0+B_t\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d).$$</div>\n<p>VP 的标量情形对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I_d$</span>；VE 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t=I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t=\\sigma_tI_d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3.13（矩阵转移核）</strong> 在上述定义下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t$</span> 可逆（即所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t,j}&gt;0$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_t;\\ A_tx_0,\\ B_tB_t^\\top\\big)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_t;\\ A_tx_0,\\ \\mathrm{diag}(b_{t,1}^2,\\dots,b_{t,d}^2)\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：仿射变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto A_tx_0+B_tx$</span> 将标准高斯测度推前为均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_tx_0$</span>、协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_tB_t^\\top$</span> 的高斯测度（线性变换下高斯的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon)\\,B_t^\\top=B_tB_t^\\top$</span>）。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t$</span> 为对角且各元非零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_tB_t^\\top$</span> 正定，密度存在且由高斯密度公式给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.3.14（矩阵情形的半群一致性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{t|s}=A_tA_s^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{t|s}B_{t|s}^\\top=B_tB_t^\\top-A_{t|s}B_sB_s^\\top A_{t|s}^\\top$</span>。若右端半正定（对角情形即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t,j}^2\\ge a_{t,j}^2b_{s,j}^2/a_{s,j}^2$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\int p_{t|s}(x_t\\mid x_s)\\,p_s(x_s\\mid x_0)\\,dx_s,\\qquad p_{t|s}(x_t\\mid x_s)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_t;\\ A_{t|s}x_s,\\ B_{t|s}B_{t|s}^\\top\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=A_sx_0+B_s\\varepsilon_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=A_{t|s}x_s+B_{t|s}\\varepsilon_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_1,\\varepsilon_2$</span> 独立。代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=A_{t|s}A_sx_0+A_{t|s}B_s\\varepsilon_1+B_{t|s}\\varepsilon_2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{t|s}A_s=A_t$</span>，均值项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_tx_0$</span>；协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{t|s}B_sB_s^\\top A_{t|s}^\\top+B_{t|s}B_{t|s}^\\top=B_tB_t^\\top$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{t|s}$</span> 的定义）。半正定性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{t|s}$</span> 可取实对角元，核良定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>标量情形验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{t,j}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t,j}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{t|s}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s}I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{t|s}B_{t|s}^\\top=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d-(\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s)(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)I_d=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t|s})I_d$</span>，与定理 5.3.2 一致。VE 标量情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{t|s}=I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{t|s}B_{t|s}^\\top=(\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2)I_d$</span>，与定理 5.3.4 一致。故矩阵形式确为标量公式的严格推广，而非平行理论。</p>\n<p>矩阵形式的一个直接用途是<strong>逐维信噪比</strong>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 维的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_j(t)=a_{t,j}^2/b_{t,j}^2$</span>。标量 VP 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，与 canonical 定义一致；矩阵 VP 下各维 SNR 不同，反向 SDE 的漂移需逐维处理。本节不展开逐维反向动力学，只记录此推广的存在性与一致性，供后续噪声调度节在非均匀调度下引用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-转移核的熵与-Fisher-信息\">转移核的熵与 Fisher 信息<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-转移核的熵与-Fisher-信息\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>转移核的闭式解还允许计算两个在生成动力学中反复出现的量：条件熵与条件 Fisher 信息。它们不是本节的主线，但作为闭式解的可检验推论，能验证公式自洽，并为后续得分动力学节提供标量恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3.15（条件微分熵）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H\\big(p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\big)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\big(2\\pi e(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\big),\\qquad H\\big(p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\big)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\big(2\\pi e\\,\\sigma_t^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu,\\Sigma)$</span> 的微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\log\\det(2\\pi e\\Sigma)$</span>。VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det=b_t^{2d}$</span>，故熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e b_t^2)$</span>；VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\sigma_t^2I_d$</span>，同理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意条件熵<strong>不依赖</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>：平移不改变微分熵。这与边缘熵不同（边缘熵依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的离散程度），是转移核与边缘分布的又一区别。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3.16（条件 Fisher 信息）</strong> 在命题 5.3.15 的假设下，转移核关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的 Fisher 信息矩阵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I_d,\\qquad \\mathcal{I}_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}I_d.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：Fisher 信息矩阵定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x_t\\mid x_0}[\\nabla\\log p\\,\\nabla\\log p^\\top]$</span>。由推论 5.3.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p=-(x_t-a_tx_0)/b_t^2$</span>，其协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)/b_t^4=b_t^2I_d/b_t^4=b_t^{-2}I_d$</span>。VP 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，VE 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=\\sigma_t^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>Fisher 信息与条件得分的关系是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t=\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla\\log p\\|^2]/d$</span>（各向同性时），即得分平方的期望等于 Fisher 信息。这一恒等式在代码节可用蒙特卡洛验证：从转移核采样，计算条件得分的平方均值，应与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/b_t^2$</span> 吻合。它同时说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 Fisher 信息发散（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\to0$</span>），这是反向 SDE 在起点附近数值刚性的信息论根源，与命题 5.3.11 的端点退化互为印证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 条件熵与 Fisher 信息的数值验证（VP，一维）\nd, a_bar = 1, 0.5\nb2 = 1 - a_bar\nentropy = 0.5 * d * np.log(2 * np.pi * np.e * b2)\nfisher = 1.0 / b2\nprint(&quot;entropy:&quot;, entropy, &quot;fisher:&quot;, fisher)\n\n# 蒙特卡洛验证 Fisher 信息 = E[score^2]\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nx0, n = 0.7, 200000\neps = rng.standard_normal(n)\nxt = np.sqrt(a_bar) * x0 + np.sqrt(b2) * eps\nscore = -(xt - np.sqrt(a_bar) * x0) / b2\nemp_fisher = np.mean(score**2)\nprint(&quot;empirical fisher:&quot;, emp_fisher, &quot;expected:&quot;, fisher)\nassert np.isclose(emp_fisher, fisher, rtol=1e-2)\n\n# 矩阵形式：逐维 SNR 验证\na = np.array([np.sqrt(0.5), np.sqrt(0.8)])\nb = np.sqrt(1 - a**2)\nsnr = a**2 / b**2\nprint(&quot;per-dim SNR:&quot;, snr)\nassert np.allclose(snr, np.array([1.0, 4.0]))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>矩阵例中第一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=0.5$</span> 给出 SNR <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1$</span>，第二维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=0.8$</span> 给出 SNR <span class=\"math-inline\">$=4$</span>，与标量公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha/(1-\\bar\\alpha)$</span> 逐维代入一致。这验证了推论 5.3.14 与逐维 SNR 定义的自洽性，也说明矩阵推广不改变 canonical 的标量 SNR 公式在每维上的形式。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>VP 与 VE 的转移核均为高斯：VP 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，VE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x_0,\\sigma_t^2I_d)$</span>，二者由仿射变换作用于标准高斯直接得到，无需对数据分布作假设。</li>\n<li>两类核均满足半群一致性，但代数结构不同：VP 的复合核方差按乘性因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t|s}=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span> 衰减后相加，VE 的复合核方差为差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2$</span>；VP 核同时是 VP-SDE 前向方程的解。</li>\n<li>转移核是条件分布，与边缘分布的卷积属于后续节；离散 DDPM 核与连续 VP 核在转移核层面形式匹配，误差阶的严格论证留给离散化节。</li>\n<li>转移核的对数密度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的二次型，其梯度（条件得分）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(x_t-a_tx_0)/b_t^2$</span>，与标准化噪声成反比于噪声尺度；这是后续边缘得分与去噪目标推导的被积元件。</li>\n<li>转移核的特征函数为高斯形式，VP 与 VE 均满足频域半群因子化，与定理 5.3.2 的时域卷积互为对偶；正交不变性保证公式在任意正交基下形式不变。</li>\n<li>端点行为必须显式处理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时两类核均弱收敛于 Dirac；VP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s ds=\\infty$</span> 时收敛于标准高斯，VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span> 时协方差发散、无弱极限，故 VE 必须取有限终端时间。</li>\n<li>转移核可推广为矩阵仿射形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=A_tx_0+B_t\\varepsilon$</span>，其协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_tB_t^\\top$</span>，半群一致性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{t|s}B_{t|s}^\\top=B_tB_t^\\top-A_{t|s}B_sB_s^\\top A_{t|s}^\\top$</span> 半正定；标量 VP 与 VE 公式均为其特例，逐维 SNR 仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{t,j}^2/b_{t,j}^2$</span>。</li>\n<li>条件熵只依赖噪声尺度、不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，条件 Fisher 信息为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^{-2}I_d$</span>，与条件得分平方的期望相等；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 Fisher 信息发散，是反向过程数值刚性的信息论根源。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-VP-的闭式边缘分布\">VP 的闭式边缘分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-VP-的闭式边缘分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节 VP-SDE 与第 3 节高斯转移核已建立的符号。为避免歧义，先固定符号表。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>。</li>\n<li>状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为初始值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>。</li>\n<li>非负速率函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span>，可测且局部可积；记累积速率\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$B(t):=\\int_0^t \\beta_s\\,ds,\\qquad \\bar\\alpha_t:=e^{-B(t)}.$$</div></li>\n<li>VP 前向过程由第 1 节定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,dW_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维标准布朗运动，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 独立。</li>\n<li>本节 canonical 形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu,\\Sigma)$</span> 为均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>、协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 的高斯分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘分布。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设如下。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 速率可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上局部可积且非负，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)$</span> 有限、单调不减、绝对连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 初值二阶矩有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。本节主定理只用到一阶与二阶矩；若进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为任意平方可积随机向量，结论分别加强为高斯边缘与一般矩公式。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 独立性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为标准高斯。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 可积性用于交换</strong>：当需要把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\cdot]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的极限交换时，使用 Dominated Convergence，控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0\\|^2+\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，由 (A2) 与 (A3) 可积。</p>\n<p>本节与第 3 节的分工：第 3 节已给出转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t|0}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\big)$</span> 的闭式解；本节不再重复该核的推导，而是由此核与初值分布作边缘化，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 的闭式表达、矩恒等式与一个可检验推论。与 VE 节的边缘分布（第 5 节）区别在于：VP 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 满足平方和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故方差有界；VE 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>，方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增长。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-定义-VP-边缘分布族与信号系数\">定义：VP 边缘分布族与信号系数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-定义-VP-边缘分布族与信号系数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（VP 边缘分布族）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，称族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Phi_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为 VP 前向过程的边缘分布族，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t:=\\mathrm{Law}(x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 由 canonical 形式给出。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 为信号系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 为噪声系数。</p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t^2+b_t^2=1$</span>，这正是“方差保持”一名的数学内容：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_0)=I_d$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_t)=a_t^2 I_d+b_t^2 I_d=I_d$</span>，总方差沿时间不变。这与 VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>（方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d+\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>）形成对照，后者见第 5 节。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（系数恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a_t=a_s\\,a_{t|s},\\qquad a_{t|s}:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s}=e^{-\\frac12\\int_s^t\\beta_u\\,du},$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t^2+b_t^2=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-a_t^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)=\\int_0^t\\beta_u du$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的绝对连续性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)-B(s)=\\int_s^t\\beta_u du$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a_t^2=e^{-B(t)}=e^{-B(s)}e^{-(B(t)-B(s))}=a_s^2\\,a_{t|s}^2,$$</div>\n开方得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-B(t)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式是后续“离散化与连续化对应”（第 8 节）与“与 DDPM 对应”（第 11 节）的代数基础：离散 DDPM 的累积乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=\\prod_{k=1}^n(1-\\beta_k)$</span> 正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\sum_k\\beta_k}$</span> 的一阶近似。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-主定理-边缘分布的闭式表达\">主定理：边缘分布的闭式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-主定理-边缘分布的闭式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2（VP 边缘分布）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘分布为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}\\big(a_t\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0],\\ a_t^2\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+b_t^2 I_d\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分三步。</p>\n<p>第一步（条件分布）：由第 3 节转移核，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t\\mid x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}\\big(a_t x_0,\\ b_t^2 I_d\\big).$$</div>\n这一步只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a_t x_0+b_t\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的标准高斯性、独立性。</p>\n<p>第二步（均值）：由 (A2) 与 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[x_t]=\\mathbb{E}[a_t x_0+b_t\\varepsilon]=a_t\\mathbb{E}[x_0]+b_t\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon]=a_t\\mathbb{E}[x_0].$$</div>\n交换期望与线性组合无需额外条件；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon]=0$</span> 由标准高斯性给出。</p>\n<p>第三步（协方差）：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=\\mathbb{E}\\big[(x_t-\\mathbb{E}x_t)(x_t-\\mathbb{E}x_t)^\\top\\big].$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\mathbb{E}x_t=a_t(x_0-\\mathbb{E}x_0)+b_t\\varepsilon$</span>，展开得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=a_t^2\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+b_t^2 I_d+a_t b_t\\big(\\mathbb{E}[(x_0-\\mathbb{E}x_0)\\varepsilon^\\top]+\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon(x_0-\\mathbb{E}x_0)^\\top]\\big).$$</div>\n由 (A3) 独立性，交叉项为零。于是协方差公式成立。高斯性由“高斯随机向量经仿射变换仍为高斯”得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 的仿射函数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 高斯的假设下联合高斯；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 非高斯，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 一般不是高斯，但均值与协方差公式仍成立，因为只用了一二阶矩。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 3（与第 3 节的区别）</strong> 第 3 节的转移核是条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t|0}$</span>，其协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2 I_d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关；定理 2 是边缘分布，协方差含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t^2\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)$</span>。二者不可混用：采样时若从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 抽样，须先抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\Phi_0$</span> 再按 canonical 形式加噪；若从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t|0}$</span> 抽样，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 固定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推论-二阶矩恒等式与信噪比的边缘表达\">推论：二阶矩恒等式与信噪比的边缘表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推论-二阶矩恒等式与信噪比的边缘表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 4（二阶矩恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\,d.$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2=d$</span>（即初值各向同性且二阶矩匹配标准高斯），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^2=d$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 2 的协方差公式取迹：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=a_t^2\\,\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+b_t^2 d.$$</div>\n又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^2=\\|\\mathbb{E}x_t\\|^2+\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}x_0=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathbb{E}x_t\\|^2=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2$</span>（因均值为零）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t^2=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 得恒等式。一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}x_0\\ne0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathbb{E}x_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\|\\mathbb{E}x_0\\|^2$</span>，与迹合并仍得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)d$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2=\\|\\mathbb{E}x_0\\|^2+\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（信噪比的边缘表达）</strong> 在定理 2 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，且按第 6 节定义的信噪比\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$$</div>\n与边缘分布无关，只由调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 决定；它是“信号方差与噪声方差之比”的代数量，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 变化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}x_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=I_d$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\bar\\alpha_t I_d+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>。信噪比公式由 canonical 形式直接读出：信号项方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，噪声项方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，比值即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5 说明一个常被误解的事实：VP 在标准高斯初值下边缘分布不随时间变化，但条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t|0}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化；生成动力学依赖的是条件分布与得分，而非边缘分布本身。这一点在第 6 节时间重参数化中会再次用到。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-具体例子-一维标准正态初值的闭式验证\">具体例子：一维标准正态初值的闭式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-具体例子-一维标准正态初值的闭式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)=\\beta t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\beta t}$</span>。由定理 2，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}\\big(0,\\ e^{-\\beta t}+(1-e^{-\\beta t})\\big)=\\mathcal{N}(0,1).$$</div>\n直接验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=e^{-\\beta t/2}x_0+\\sqrt{1-e^{-\\beta t}}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，两项独立、方差分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\beta t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{-\\beta t}$</span>，和方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，均值零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>。若改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}\\big(e^{-\\beta t/2}\\mu,\\ e^{-\\beta t}\\sigma^2+1-e^{-\\beta t}\\big),$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，即 VP 的极限分布为标准高斯，与初值无关。这一收敛性是反向 SDE 章（第 15 节接口）中“从标准高斯初始化反向过程”的依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-代码-闭式边缘的矩验证\">代码：闭式边缘的矩验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-代码-闭式边缘的矩验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=4$</span> 上按 canonical 形式采样，验证定理 2 的均值与协方差公式、推论 4 的二阶矩恒等式，并断言标准高斯初值下边缘方差保持为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd = 4\nN = 200_000\nT = 1.0\nbeta = 2.0\n\ndef alpha_bar(t, beta=beta):\n    return np.exp(-beta * t)\n\n# 非零均值、非单位协方差的初值\nmu0 = np.array([1.0, -0.5, 0.0, 2.0])\nA0 = np.array([[1.0, 0.2, 0.0, 0.0],\n               [0.2, 0.5, 0.0, 0.0],\n               [0.0, 0.0, 2.0, 0.1],\n               [0.0, 0.0, 0.1, 0.3]])\nL0 = np.linalg.cholesky(A0)\n\nt = 0.7\nab = alpha_bar(t)\na = np.sqrt(ab)\nb = np.sqrt(1.0 - ab)\n\nx0 = mu0 + rng.standard_normal((N, d)) @ L0.T\neps = rng.standard_normal((N, d))\nxt = a * x0 + b * eps\n\n# 定理 2 的预测\npred_mean = a * mu0\npred_cov = ab * A0 + (1.0 - ab) * np.eye(d)\n\nemp_mean = xt.mean(axis=0)\nemp_cov = np.cov(xt, rowvar=False)\n\nassert np.allclose(emp_mean, pred_mean, atol=2e-2), (emp_mean, pred_mean)\nassert np.allclose(emp_cov, pred_cov, atol=5e-2), (emp_cov, pred_cov)\n\n# 推论 4 的二阶矩恒等式\nlhs = np.mean(np.sum(xt**2, axis=1))\nrhs = ab * np.mean(np.sum(x0**2, axis=1)) + (1.0 - ab) * d\nassert np.allclose(lhs, rhs, atol=2e-2), (lhs, rhs)\n\n# 标准高斯初值：边缘方差保持为 I_d\nx0s = rng.standard_normal((N, d))\nxts = a * x0s + b * rng.standard_normal((N, d))\nassert np.allclose(np.cov(xts, rowvar=False), np.eye(d), atol=5e-2)\n\nprint(&quot;xt shape:&quot;, xt.shape)\nprint(&quot;empirical mean:&quot;, emp_mean)\nprint(&quot;predicted mean:&quot;, pred_mean)\nprint(&quot;empirical cov diag:&quot;, np.diag(emp_cov))\nprint(&quot;predicted cov diag:&quot;, np.diag(pred_cov))\nprint(&quot;second-moment identity lhs/rhs:&quot;, lhs, rhs)\nprint(&quot;standard-Gaussian edge cov ≈ I_d: OK&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>xt shape: (200000, 4)</code>；经验均值与预测均值在容差内一致；经验协方差对角与预测对角一致；二阶矩恒等式左右两端在容差内相等；标准高斯初值下边缘协方差接近单位阵。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推论-边缘分布的时间单调性与极限行为\">推论：边缘分布的时间单调性与极限行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推论-边缘分布的时间单调性与极限行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（协方差的时间单调性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上几乎处处成立，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span>，协方差矩阵满足 Loewner 序\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)\\preceq \\mathrm{Cov}(x_s),$$</div>\n等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=I_d$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_s^t\\beta_u\\,du=0$</span>。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)\\succeq I_d$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)\\preceq I_d$</span>，则单调不减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0:=\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)$</span>。由定理 2，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=\\bar\\alpha_t\\Sigma_0+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le t$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta:=\\bar\\alpha_s-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_s\\big(1-a_{t|s}^2\\big)\\ge0$</span>（由命题 1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;0$</span>）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_s)-\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)=\\Delta\\,(\\Sigma_0-I_d).$$</div>\n由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\ge0$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0-I_d\\succeq0$</span> 则差矩阵半正定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t)\\preceq\\mathrm{Cov}(x_s)$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0-I_d\\preceq0$</span> 则反向。等号情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_s^t\\beta_u du=0$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;0$</span> 几乎处处，这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=t$</span> 或测度零区间）；或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0=I_d$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题澄清了一个易混淆点：VP 的“方差保持”并非指任意初值下边缘协方差恒定，而是指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0=I_d$</span> 这一特定初值下协方差恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span>（推论 5）。对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0$</span>，协方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span> 之间作凸插值，插值系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，方向由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0-I_d$</span> 的符号决定。这与 VE 的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 恒单调不减（见第 5 节）形成结构性对照。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（极限分布）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_u\\,du\\to\\infty$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 不 integrable 于无穷），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\mathcal{N}\\big(0,I_d\\big)\\quad(t\\to\\infty),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 表示依分布收敛；收敛在 Wasserstein-2 距离下成立，且收敛速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 控制：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\Phi_t,\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d))\\le \\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\big(\\|\\mathbb{E}x_0\\|+\\|\\Sigma_0^{1/2}-I_d\\|_F\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}(m_t,\\Sigma_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=a_t\\mathbb{E}x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\bar\\alpha_t\\Sigma_0+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t\\to0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t\\to I_d$</span>。两个高斯分布之间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离有闭式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2\\big(\\mathcal{N}(m_1,\\Sigma_1),\\mathcal{N}(m_2,\\Sigma_2)\\big)=\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2+\\mathrm{tr}\\big(\\Sigma_1+\\Sigma_2-2(\\Sigma_1^{1/2}\\Sigma_2\\Sigma_1^{1/2})^{1/2}\\big).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(m_1,\\Sigma_1)=(m_t,\\Sigma_t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(m_2,\\Sigma_2)=(0,I_d)$</span>。均值项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t^2\\|\\mathbb{E}x_0\\|^2$</span>。协方差项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=I_d-\\bar\\alpha_t(I_d-\\Sigma_0)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D:=I_d-\\Sigma_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{1/2}\\Sigma_2\\Sigma_t^{1/2}=\\Sigma_t$</span>，故该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(I_d+\\Sigma_t-2\\Sigma_t^{1/2})=\\|\\Sigma_t^{1/2}-I_d\\|_F^2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{1/2}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性（矩阵平方根在正定锥上局部 Lipschitz，常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0$</span> 的最小特征值控制），存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\Sigma_0)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Sigma_t^{1/2}-I_d\\|_F\\le C(\\Sigma_0)\\bar\\alpha_t\\|D\\|_F$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2\\le \\bar\\alpha_t^2\\|\\mathbb{E}x_0\\|^2+C^2\\bar\\alpha_t^2\\|D\\|_F^2$</span>，开方即得所述上界（吸收常数）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论是反向 SDE 章（第 15 节接口）中“以标准高斯为终端分布初始化反向过程”的定量依据：终端分布与标准高斯的偏差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}$</span> 的速率衰减，故只要调度使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 足够小，反向过程的初始化误差可控。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-得分函数的边缘表达\">得分函数的边缘表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-得分函数的边缘表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（VP 得分与边缘分布的关系）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x_t\\sim\\Phi_t}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。则 VP 前向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 下的得分函数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\Sigma_t^{-1}(x-m_t),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=a_t\\mathbb{E}x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span> 正定（由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2&gt;0$</span> 保证）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 2，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为高斯时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为高斯，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=(2\\pi)^{-d/2}(\\det\\Sigma_t)^{-1/2}\\exp\\big(-\\tfrac12(x-m_t)^\\top\\Sigma_t^{-1}(x-m_t)\\big)$</span>。直接求梯度：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\Sigma_t^{-1}(x-m_t).$$</div>\n对非高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 一般非高斯，上式不成立；此时得分由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的显式密度决定，需借助 Tweedie 公式与转移核表达（见第 3 节与反向 SDE 章）。命题 8 的适用范围明确限定为高斯初值，这是本节唯一给出得分闭式的情形。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 9（与 Tweedie 公式的区别）</strong> 命题 8 是“边缘得分”，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>；而第 3 节的 Tweedie 公式给出的是“条件得分”<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_{t|0}(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-a_t x_0)/b_t^2$</span>。二者关系为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\nabla\\log p_{t|0}(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,\\big|\\,x_t=x\\big],$$</div>\n即边缘得分是条件得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0|t}$</span> 下的后验期望。该恒等式对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 分布成立，是得分匹配（第 6 节与反向 SDE 章）的出发点；本节不展开其证明，只指出命题 8 是它在高斯初值下的闭式特例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-恒等式-边缘协方差与得分协方差的一致性\">恒等式：边缘协方差与得分协方差的一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-恒等式-边缘协方差与得分协方差的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10（得分协方差的恒等式）</strong> 在命题 8 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{x_t\\sim\\Phi_t}\\big[\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2\\big]=d,$$</div>\n且该量不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=I_d$</span>。由命题 8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-x$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^2=\\mathrm{tr}(I_d)=d.$$</div>\n不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式是一个可检验的数值不变量：在标准高斯初值下，VP 前向过程任意时刻的边缘得分范数平方的期望恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。它与推论 4 的二阶矩恒等式互为对偶（得分范数平方即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|^2$</span> 在高斯情形下的重写），可作为第 10 节调度反例的对照基准：若调度使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 数值上溢出或下溢，该恒等式在浮点运算中会失效，从而暴露实现错误。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-具体例子-非高斯初值下的边缘非高斯性\">具体例子：非高斯初值下的边缘非高斯性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-具体例子-非高斯初值下的边缘非高斯性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 服从两点分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(x_0=+1)=\\mathbb{P}(x_0=-1)=1/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta$</span>。由定理 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}x_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 成立——尽管 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 非高斯。这说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=I_d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}x_0=0$</span> 时，边缘分布恰为标准高斯，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的高阶矩无关。原因在于 canonical 形式中噪声项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 的方差恰好补足信号项方差到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，而信号项的均值与协方差已由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的一二阶矩完全确定。</p>\n<p>反之，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(x_0=+2)=\\mathbb{P}(x_0=-2)=1/2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,4\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\mathcal{N}(0,1+3\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，但有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时方差大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这验证了命题 6 的单调性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0=4&gt;1$</span>，故协方差关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递减至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p>两个例子共同说明：VP 边缘分布的高斯性只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的一二阶矩是否与标准高斯匹配，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 本身的分布形状；这是“方差保持”在分布层面的精确含义，也是第 5 节 VE 边缘分布（无此性质，因噪声项方差无上界）对照的要点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-与第-3-节转移核的合成一致性\">与第 3 节转移核的合成一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-与第-3-节转移核的合成一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11（半群性质）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，VP 转移核满足合成律：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span> 与任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int p_{t|s}(x_t\\mid x_s)\\,f(x_t)\\,dx_t=\\mathbb{E}\\big[f(x_t)\\mid x_s\\big],$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t|0}=p_{t|s}\\circ p_{s|0}$</span> 在如下意义下成立：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=a_{s|0}x_0+b_{s|0}\\varepsilon_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a_{t|s}x_s+b_{t|s}\\varepsilon_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_1,\\varepsilon_2$</span> 独立标准高斯，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t\\overset{d}{=}a_{t|0}x_0+b_{t|0}\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为标准高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{t|0}=a_{s|0}a_{t|s}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t|0}^2=b_{s|0}^2a_{t|s}^2+b_{t|s}^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式是条件期望的定义。第二式：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{t|0}=a_{s|0}a_{t|s}$</span>。方差方面，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b_{t|0}^2=1-a_{t|0}^2=1-a_{s|0}^2a_{t|s}^2=(1-a_{s|0}^2)+a_{s|0}^2(1-a_{t|s}^2)=b_{s|0}^2+a_{s|0}^2b_{t|s}^2.$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a_{t|s}(a_{s|0}x_0+b_{s|0}\\varepsilon_1)+b_{t|s}\\varepsilon_2=a_{t|0}x_0+a_{t|s}b_{s|0}\\varepsilon_1+b_{t|s}\\varepsilon_2$</span>。两个独立高斯项的方差之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{t|s}^2b_{s|0}^2+b_{t|s}^2=b_{t|0}^2$</span>，故其和与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t|0}\\varepsilon$</span> 同分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题是第 8 节“离散化与连续化对应”的代数核心：离散 DDPM 的逐步加噪 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=\\sqrt{1-\\beta_n}x_{n-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_n}\\varepsilon_n$</span> 正是上述合成律在有限步上的迭代，累积系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=\\prod_{k=1}^n(1-\\beta_k)$</span> 与连续时间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\int\\beta}$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_k\\approx e^{-\\beta_k}$</span> 对应。命题 11 保证了这种对应在分布层面是精确的，而非仅在一阶矩上近似。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-数值稳定性-bar-alpha_t-的计算\">数值稳定性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-数值稳定性-bar-alpha_t-的计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12（对数域计算的稳定性）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-B(t)}$</span> 的直接计算在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)$</span> 较大时下溢为零，导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。改用对数域计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=-B(t),\\qquad \\log b_t^2=\\log\\big(1-e^{-B(t)}\\big),$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)\\gg1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log b_t^2\\approx0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)\\ll1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log b_t^2\\approx\\log B(t)$</span>，二者均无下溢。该恒等式在浮点双精度下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)\\in[10^{-12},10^{3}]$</span> 保持相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由定义直接得到。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-e^{-B(t)}$</span>，取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log b_t^2=\\log(1-e^{-B(t)})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{-B(t)}=B(t)-B(t)^2/2+O(B(t)^3)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log b_t^2=\\log B(t)+O(B(t))$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-B(t)}\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-e^{-B(t)})\\to0$</span>。两种极限下对数域均无下溢，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log B(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)$</span> 极小时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span> 但以浮点可表示的对数形式存储，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2$</span> 本身在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)$</span> 极小时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)$</span> 而非零。误差界由双精度浮点的相对精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\approx2.2\\times10^{-16}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 函数的条件数估计得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12 是第 10 节“调度不当导致数值爆炸”反例的技术前提：若实现中直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)$</span> 极大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下溢为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，看似无害；但若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)$</span> 极小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 上溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2$</span> 下溢为零，噪声项消失，采样退化为恒等映射，这才是真正的数值失效。对数域计算避免了这一退化，是第 13 节代码节的标准做法。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在速率可积、初值二阶矩有限、噪声独立的假设下，VP 边缘分布由定理 2 闭式给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t=\\mathcal{N}(a_t\\mathbb{E}x_0,\\ a_t^2\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0)+b_t^2 I_d)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；它与第 3 节的条件转移核不同，是边缘化后的分布。</li>\n<li>推论 4 给出二阶矩恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)d$</span>；推论 5 指出标准高斯初值下边缘分布不随时间变化，信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 只由调度决定，为第 6 节时间重参数化与第 8 节离散化对应提供代数基础。</li>\n<li>一维与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维例子验证了闭式公式；代码以可运行方式核验了均值、协方差、二阶矩恒等式与方差保持性质，为第 5 节 VE 边缘分布的对照与第 10 节调度反例提供基准。</li>\n<li>命题 6–12 补足了协方差单调性、极限分布、得分闭式、得分协方差恒等式、非高斯初值例子、半群合成律与对数域数值稳定性；这些结果共同构成 VP 边缘分布的完整刻画，并为第 5 节 VE 边缘分布的对照、第 10 节调度反例与第 13 节代码节提供可检验的数学基准。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-VE-的闭式边缘分布\">VE 的闭式边缘分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-VE-的闭式边缘分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据随机变量，其分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 为标准高斯噪声，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t:[0,T]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 为 VE-SDE 的噪声尺度函数，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续且严格单调递增。VE-SDE 的前向过程定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}x_t=\\sqrt{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t,\\qquad x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}},$$</div>\n<p>其等价闭式表达为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>（本章 canonical claim）。本节的目标是：在上述定义与高斯转移核闭式解（前序节已证）的基础上，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的闭式表达，证明其与数据密度的卷积关系，推导可检验的恒等式（热半群恒等式与二阶矩恒等式），并给出一个具体的高斯数据例子验证公式。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，均在此处一次性定义，后文不再重复：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘密度（关于 Lebesgue 测度）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$G_\\sigma(x)$</span>：尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 的各向同性高斯核，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_\\sigma(x)=(2\\pi\\sigma^2)^{-d/2}\\exp(-\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma^2))$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ast$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的卷积算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(f\\ast g)(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}f(y)g(x-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span>：Fourier 变换，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}[f](\\xi)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}f(x)e^{-\\mathrm{i}\\langle\\xi,x\\rangle}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k(t)=\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_t\\|^{2k}]$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2k$</span> 阶矩（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（数据密度的正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|x\\|^2p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（噪声尺度的正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续、严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge t_0&gt;0$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge\\sigma_{\\min}$</span>。</p>\n<p>这两条假设在本节情境下为何成立：A1 是生成建模中对数据分布的标准可积性要求（有限二阶矩保证后文矩恒等式不发散）；A2 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 时转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{\\sigma_t}$</span> 为良定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 函数且其 Fourier 变换有界，从而使卷积与 Fourier 交换合法。注意 A2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处核退化为 Dirac 质量，故本节所有涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 的命题均限定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-1-VE-边缘密度的卷积表示\">命题 5.5.1（VE 边缘密度的卷积表示）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-1-VE-边缘密度的卷积表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘密度存在且等于数据密度与高斯核的卷积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=(p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\ast G_{\\sigma_t})(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)\\,G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y,\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 VE 闭式表达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的独立性，对任意有界 Borel 可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，利用 Fubini 定理（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon)p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)G_1(\\varepsilon)$</span> 关于乘积测度可积，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\in L^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1\\in L^1$</span>）得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(x_t)]=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(y+\\sigma_t z)\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)\\,G_1(z)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\,\\mathrm{d}z.$$</div>\n<p>作变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=y+\\sigma_t z$</span>（对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\mapsto x$</span> 为平移，Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto x$</span> 的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^d$</span>），并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1(z)=\\sigma_t^d G_{\\sigma_t}(\\sigma_t z)$</span>，上式化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(x_t)]=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(x)\\left[\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)\\,G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right]\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的任意性（取指示函数并通过单调类定理延拓），括号内即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的密度。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：命题 5.5.1 给出的是<strong>边缘</strong>密度，而非转移核。转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t|0}(x_t|x_0)=G_{\\sigma_t}(x_t-x_0)$</span> 是前序节已证的闭式解；边缘密度是转移核对数据分布的平均。二者关系恰为卷积，这一区别在后续反向 SDE 节中至关重要：反向漂移需要的是边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，而非转移核得分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-2-Fourier-域的热半群恒等式\">命题 5.5.2（Fourier 域的热半群恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-2-Fourier-域的热半群恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{F}[p_t](\\xi)=\\mathcal{F}[p_{\\mathrm{data}}](\\xi)\\cdot\\exp\\!\\left(-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.5.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\ast G_{\\sigma_t}$</span>。卷积的 Fourier 变换等于 Fourier 变换的乘积，但需验证交换积分次序的合法性。直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{F}[p_t](\\xi)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)e^{-\\mathrm{i}\\langle\\xi,x\\rangle}\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>被积函数的绝对值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 可积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\|_1\\cdot\\|G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_1&lt;\\infty$</span>），故由 Fubini 定理可交换次序。对内层关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 积分，作替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=x-y$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}G_{\\sigma_t}(u)e^{-\\mathrm{i}\\langle\\xi,u+y\\rangle}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=e^{-\\mathrm{i}\\langle\\xi,y\\rangle}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}G_{\\sigma_t}(u)e^{-\\mathrm{i}\\langle\\xi,u\\rangle}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.$$</div>\n<p>高斯核的 Fourier 变换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{\\sigma_t}$</span> 配方即得，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 保证积分收敛）。代回得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{F}[p_t](\\xi)=\\left(\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)e^{-\\mathrm{i}\\langle\\xi,y\\rangle}\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)\\exp\\!\\left(-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2\\right),$$</div>\n<p>即所述恒等式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论 5.5.3（二阶矩恒等式）</strong>：在 A1、A2 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_1(t)=\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_t\\|^2]=\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_0\\|^2]+d\\,\\sigma_t^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 与独立性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_t\\|^2]=\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_0\\|^2]+2\\sigma_t\\mathbb{E}[\\langle x_0,\\varepsilon\\rangle]+\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2].$$</div>\n<p>交叉项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon]=0$</span> 与独立性为零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2]=d$</span>。证毕。此恒等式表明 VE 的“方差爆炸”名称来源：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增长时，边缘二阶矩线性于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 发散，与 VP 的边缘二阶矩有界形成对照（后者在后续“方差保持与方差爆炸”节展开，本节不重复）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-4-得分与密度的对数梯度恒等式\">命题 5.5.4（得分与密度的对数梯度恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-4-得分与密度的对数梯度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上处处为正、连续可微。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：VE 的边缘得分满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\left(\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\,|\\,x_t=x]-x\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中条件期望按后验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0|t}(y|x)\\propto p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)$</span> 计算。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.5.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y$</span>。在积分号下求梯度，需验证 Leibniz 法则条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_i}G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)=-(x_i-y_i)\\sigma_t^{-2}G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)$</span>，其绝对值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-2}\\|x-y\\|G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)$</span> 控制，而后者关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 可积（高斯核的一阶矩有限），且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 在紧集上一致有界。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla p_t(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)\\left(-\\frac{x-y}{\\sigma_t^2}\\right)G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\left(x\\,p_t(x)-\\int y\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right).$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span>，并识别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int y\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y/p_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\,|\\,x_t=x]$</span>，即得。证毕。</p>\n<p>此恒等式是 VE 反向 SDE 漂移的闭式表达基础（接口见“与反向 SDE 章的接口”节），本节仅作为边缘分布的推论给出，不展开反向动力学。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-具体例子-高斯数据验证公式\">具体例子：高斯数据验证公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-具体例子-高斯数据验证公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,s_0^2)$</span>。由命题 5.5.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,s_0^2)\\ast\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_t^2)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2)$</span>。验证命题 5.5.2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}[p_{\\mathrm{data}}](\\xi)=\\exp(\\mathrm{i}\\mu_0\\xi-\\tfrac{1}{2}s_0^2\\xi^2)$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\sigma_t^2\\xi^2)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\mathrm{i}\\mu_0\\xi-\\tfrac{1}{2}(s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2)\\xi^2)$</span>，正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 的 Fourier 变换。验证推论 5.5.3：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_t\\|^2]=\\mu_0^2+s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_0\\|^2]+d\\sigma_t^2$</span> 一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>）。验证命题 5.5.4：后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0|t}(y|x)=\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(\\frac{s_0^2 x+\\sigma_t^2\\mu_0}{s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2},\\frac{s_0^2\\sigma_t^2}{s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2}\\right)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0|x]=\\frac{s_0^2x+\\sigma_t^2\\mu_0}{s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\left(\\frac{s_0^2x+\\sigma_t^2\\mu_0}{s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2}-x\\right)=\\frac{\\mu_0-x}{s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，与直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,s_0^2+\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 求对数梯度所得一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>VE 的边缘密度是数据密度与尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的高斯核之卷积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\ast G_{\\sigma_t}$</span>；该表示由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 与独立性经 Fubini 定理直接得到，是本节全部推论的出发点。</li>\n<li>Fourier 域热半群恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}[p_t]=\\mathcal{F}[p_{\\mathrm{data}}]\\cdot e^{-\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2/2}$</span> 与二阶矩恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_t\\|^2]=\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_0\\|^2]+d\\sigma_t^2$</span> 给出可检验的闭式预测；后者定量刻画了 VE 的方差爆炸特征，与 VP 的有界二阶矩形成对照（对照在“方差保持与方差爆炸”节展开）。</li>\n<li>边缘得分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\sigma_t^{-2}(\\mathbb{E}[x_0|x_t=x]-x)$</span> 将得分表示为后验均值与当前状态的差，除以噪声方差；它是 VE 反向 SDE 漂移的闭式基础，接口留给“与反向 SDE 章的接口”节，本节不重复反向动力学。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-5-后验密度的闭式表达与-VE-的贝叶斯结构\">命题 5.5.5（后验密度的闭式表达与 VE 的贝叶斯结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-5-后验密度的闭式表达与-VE-的贝叶斯结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上处处为正。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的后验密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{0|t}(y\\,|\\,x)=\\frac{p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)\\,G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)}{p_t(x)},\\qquad y\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,$$</div>\n<p>且该后验密度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 归一化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_{0|t}(y|x)\\,\\mathrm{d}y=1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.5.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 的联合密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立，条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t|0}(x|y)=G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)$</span>）。由贝叶斯公式，后验密度等于联合密度除以边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span>。归一化由命题 5.5.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的定义直接给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y=p_t(x)$</span>，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_{0|t}(y|x)\\,\\mathrm{d}y=p_t(x)/p_t(x)=1$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：命题 5.5.1 给出的是<strong>前向</strong>边缘（数据到噪声），命题 5.5.5 给出的是<strong>后向</strong>条件（噪声到数据）。二者不是同一对象：前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的分布，后者是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布。VE 的反向生成正是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0|t}$</span> 的后验均值（命题 5.5.4 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0|x_t=x]$</span>）出发构造漂移，因此后验密度的闭式表达是连接前向边缘与反向动力学的桥梁。注意此处不展开反向 SDE 本身，仅记录后验结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-6-边缘密度的对数凹性与平滑性继承\">命题 5.5.6（边缘密度的对数凹性与平滑性继承）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-6-边缘密度的对数凹性与平滑性继承\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 对数凹（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上凹）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 对数凹，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对数凹性在卷积下封闭。具体地，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1,x_2\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\lambda=\\lambda x_1+(1-\\lambda)x_2$</span>。由命题 5.5.1 与 Prékopa–Leindler 不等式（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=G_{\\sigma_t}$</span>，二者均对数凹，高斯核的对数凹性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log G_{\\sigma_t}(u)=-\\|u\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)-\\text{const}$</span> 直接看出），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x_\\lambda)=\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(x_\\lambda-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\ge\\left(\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)^{\\lambda}G_{\\sigma_t}(x_1-y)^{1-\\lambda}\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)\\cdots$$</div>\n<p>此处需将 Prékopa–Leindler 的乘积形式写清：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(\\lambda x_1+(1-\\lambda)x_2)\\ge p_t(x_1)^{\\lambda}\\,p_t(x_2)^{1-\\lambda},$$</div>\n<p>这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t$</span> 的凹性。平滑性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{\\sigma_t}\\in C^\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>：对任意多重指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial^\\alpha G_{\\sigma_t}$</span> 被多项式乘高斯控制，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial^\\alpha p_t=p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\ast\\partial^\\alpha G_{\\sigma_t}$</span> 良定且连续（Leibniz 法则条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial^\\alpha G_{\\sigma_t}$</span> 的可积性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\in L^\\infty$</span> 保证）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论 5.5.7（得分的有界性）</strong>：在命题 5.5.6 的假设下，若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)\\|\\le L$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&lt;\\infty$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|\\le\\frac{\\|x\\|+\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_0\\|\\,|\\,x_t=x]}{\\sigma_t^2}\\le\\frac{\\|x\\|+\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_0\\|^2]}}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.5.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\sigma_t^{-2}(\\mathbb{E}[x_0|x]-x)$</span>，取范数并用三角不等式得第一式；第二式由 Jensen 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_0\\|]\\le\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_0\\|^2]}$</span>（A1 保证二阶矩有限）得到。注意此界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|\\to\\infty$</span> 线性增长，但除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 后在高噪声区被压制，这正是 VE 得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大时数值稳定的原因之一。证毕。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-8-VE-边缘的显式积分表示与高斯数据的闭式\">命题 5.5.8（VE 边缘的显式积分表示与高斯数据的闭式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-8-VE-边缘的显式积分表示与高斯数据的闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,\\Sigma_0)$</span> 为多元高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0\\succ0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>，且得分有闭式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-(\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}(x-\\mu_0).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.5.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是两个高斯的卷积。高斯卷积的协方差相加：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,\\Sigma_0)\\ast\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>。此恒等式可由命题 5.5.2 验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}[p_{\\mathrm{data}}](\\xi)=\\exp(\\mathrm{i}\\langle\\xi,\\mu_0\\rangle-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\xi^\\top\\Sigma_0\\xi)$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\mathrm{i}\\langle\\xi,\\mu_0\\rangle-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\xi^\\top(\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)\\xi)$</span>，正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0,\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span> 的特征函数。得分由对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(x)=-\\tfrac{1}{2}(x-\\mu_0)^\\top(\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}(x-\\mu_0)+\\text{const}$</span> 求梯度直接得到。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>与命题 5.5.4 的一致性检验</strong>：对高斯数据，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0|t}(y|x)$</span> 也是高斯，其均值由线性高斯模型给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\,|\\,x_t=x]=\\mu_0+\\Sigma_0(\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}(x-\\mu_0).$$</div>\n<p>代入命题 5.5.4 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\left(\\mu_0+\\Sigma_0(\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}(x-\\mu_0)-x\\right).$$</div>\n<p>利用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0(\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}-I_d=-\\sigma_t^2(\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}$</span>（两边右乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span> 即验证），上式化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(\\Sigma_0+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}(x-\\mu_0)$</span>，与命题 5.5.8 的闭式一致。这一致性检验是本节公式自洽性的直接证据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-9-VE-边缘的熵增恒等式\">命题 5.5.9（VE 边缘的熵增恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-9-VE-边缘的熵增恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的微分熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_t)=-\\int p_t\\log p_t$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：VE 前向过程使微分熵单调不减，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}H(p_t)=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|^2\\right]\\ge0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 VE 闭式表达，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 经热半群（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/2$</span> 为时间参数）演化所得。对热方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\Delta p_t$</span>（由命题 5.5.2 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导并逆 Fourier 变换得到，交换求导与逆变换由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}[p_t]$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的一致可微性与高斯衰减保证），熵的时间导数由 de Bruijn 恒等式给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}H(p_t)=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t(x)\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>推导要点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}H(p_t)=-\\int\\partial_t p_t(\\log p_t+1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\int\\Delta p_t(\\log p_t+1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>，分部积分（边界通量消失，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 及其梯度在无穷远处高斯衰减）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\int\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nabla\\log p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\int p_t\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。被积函数非负，故熵单调不减。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此恒等式表明 VE 的噪声注入严格增加熵（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 且得分非零），这与 VP 的熵增结构形式相同但时间参数不同（VP 的对应恒等式在“信噪比与时间重参数化”节给出）。本节仅记录 VE 侧，不展开对照。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-10-VE-边缘密度的-L-2-收敛速率\">命题 5.5.10（VE 边缘密度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛速率）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-10-VE-边缘密度的-L-2-收敛速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\in L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t-G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_{L^2}\\le\\|p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\|_{L^2}$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t-G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_{L^2}\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.5.2 与 Plancherel 定理，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p_t-G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_{L^2}^2=(2\\pi)^{-d}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\left|\\mathcal{F}[p_{\\mathrm{data}}](\\xi)-1\\right|^2e^{-\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\xi.$$</div>\n<p>被积函数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4e^{-\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2}$</span> 控制（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{F}[p_{\\mathrm{data}}]|\\le\\|p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\|_1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{F}[p_{\\mathrm{data}}]-1|\\le2$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{-\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\xi=(\\pi/\\sigma_t^2)^{d/2}\\to0$</span>。由 Dominated Convergence 定理（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4e^{-\\sigma_t^2\\|\\xi\\|^2}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 可积且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致有界于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>），积分趋于零。第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t-G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_{L^2}\\le\\|p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\|_{L^2}\\|G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_{L^2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_{L^2}\\le1$</span>（高斯核的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增大而减小）得到。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题说明 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span> 时边缘趋于标准高斯（尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>），这是 VE 反向采样从纯高斯初始化出发的理论依据。收敛速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-d/2}$</span> 控制，具体常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 的 Fourier 谱在原点附近的行为；本节不展开速率优化，留待“噪声调度的选择”节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-11-VE-边缘的分数匹配恒等式\">命题 5.5.11（VE 边缘的分数匹配恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-11-VE-边缘的分数匹配恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 处处为正且连续可微。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对任意平方可积的向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\|s(x)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|^2\\right]=\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\|s(x)\\|^2\\right]+2\\,\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\nabla\\cdot s(x)\\right]+\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|^2\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 为散度，且假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\|\\nabla\\cdot s\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\|s\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：展开平方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\|s-\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2\\right]=\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\|s\\|^2]-2\\,\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\langle s,\\nabla\\log p_t\\rangle]+\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2].$$</div>\n<p>交叉项由分部积分（边界通量消失，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 高斯衰减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 平方可积）化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\langle s,\\nabla\\log p_t\\rangle]=\\int\\langle s,\\nabla p_t\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\int p_t\\,\\nabla\\cdot s\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\nabla\\cdot s].$$</div>\n<p>代回即得所述恒等式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此恒等式是 VE 显式分数匹配目标的理论基础：右端只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 的期望，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的显式值（除最后一项为常数，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 无关）。本节仅记录恒等式本身，不展开训练算法；它与“与 DDPM 的对应”节的去噪分数匹配目标形式一致，但时间参数化为连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-12-VE-边缘的尺度不变性\">命题 5.5.12（VE 边缘的尺度不变性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-12-VE-边缘的尺度不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 关于原点对称（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)=p_{\\mathrm{data}}(-y)$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于原点对称，且得分满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(-x)=-\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对称性由卷积保持：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(-x)=\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)G_{\\sigma_t}(-x-y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y$</span>，作替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\mapsto-y$</span> 并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{\\sigma_t}$</span> 的偶性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(-x)=p_t(x)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(-x)=\\log p_t(x)$</span> 两边求梯度并用链式法则得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\log p_t(-x)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>，即所述。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此对称性在 VE 的反向采样中给出一个可检验的不变量：若初始噪声关于原点对称，则反向轨迹的分布也应保持该对称性。本节仅作为边缘分布的推论记录，不展开轨迹层面的论证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-13-VE-边缘的混合表示\">命题 5.5.13（VE 边缘的混合表示）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-13-VE-边缘的混合表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 为有限混合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\pi_k\\,\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_k,\\Sigma_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\pi_k=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_k\\succ0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 仍为有限高斯混合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\pi_k\\,\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(x;\\mu_k,\\Sigma_k+\\sigma_t^2 I_d\\right),$$</div>\n<p>且其得分由后验责任加权给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\gamma_k(x)\\,\\left[-(\\Sigma_k+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}(x-\\mu_k)\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k(x)=\\dfrac{\\pi_k\\,\\mathcal{N}(x;\\mu_k,\\Sigma_k+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)}{\\sum_{j}\\pi_j\\,\\mathcal{N}(x;\\mu_j,\\Sigma_j+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)}$</span> 为后验责任。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.5.1 与卷积对线性组合的分配律，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\sum_k\\pi_k(\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_k,\\Sigma_k)\\ast G_{\\sigma_t})$</span>，而每个分量由命题 5.5.8 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_k,\\Sigma_k+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>。得分由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t=\\nabla p_t/p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t=\\sum_k\\pi_k\\nabla\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_k,\\Sigma_k+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span> 直接计算，分量梯度由命题 5.5.8 给出，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 后即得责任加权形式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>与命题 5.5.4 的一致性</strong>：对混合数据，后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0|x_t=x]=\\sum_k\\gamma_k(x)\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0|x_t=x,\\text{分量 }k]$</span>，而每个分量的后验均值由线性高斯模型给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_k+\\Sigma_k(\\Sigma_k+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}(x-\\mu_k)$</span>。代入命题 5.5.4 并利用命题 5.5.8 中的恒等式，逐分量化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t^2(\\Sigma_k+\\sigma_t^2 I_d)^{-1}(x-\\mu_k)$</span>，再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 并加权即得所述得分。这一致性再次验证了命题 5.5.4 与命题 5.5.8 的相容性。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：混合表示说明 VE 的边缘密度在数据为混合时保持混合结构，且每个分量的协方差被同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span> 加性膨胀。这一结构在“与 DDPM 的对应”节中与离散 DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 缩放形成对照：VE 只加性膨胀协方差而不缩放均值，VP 则同时缩放均值与协方差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-14-VE-边缘密度的-L-1-稳定性\">命题 5.5.14（VE 边缘密度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 稳定性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-14-VE-边缘密度的-L-1-稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}},q_{\\mathrm{data}}\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为两个数据密度。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\ast G_{\\sigma_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=q_{\\mathrm{data}}\\ast G_{\\sigma_t}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p_t-q_t\\|_{L^1}\\le\\|p_{\\mathrm{data}}-q_{\\mathrm{data}}\\|_{L^1}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.5.1 与卷积的线性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p_t-q_t\\|_{L^1}=\\|(p_{\\mathrm{data}}-q_{\\mathrm{data}})\\ast G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_{L^1}\\le\\|p_{\\mathrm{data}}-q_{\\mathrm{data}}\\|_{L^1}\\|G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_{L^1}=\\|p_{\\mathrm{data}}-q_{\\mathrm{data}}\\|_{L^1},$$</div>\n<p>其中不等式为 Young 卷积不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1\\ast L^1\\to L^1$</span> 的范数不超过范数之积），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|G_{\\sigma_t}\\|_{L^1}=1$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此稳定性说明 VE 前向过程是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 压缩的：两个不同数据分布在任意时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 的边缘分布之 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 距离不超过初始距离。这一压缩性是 VE 反向采样数值稳定性的理论依据之一（前向压缩意味着反向需要扩张，扩张的数值风险在“反例：调度不当导致数值爆炸”节讨论）。本节仅记录不等式，不展开数值分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-15-VE-边缘得分的时间导数恒等式\">命题 5.5.15（VE 边缘得分的时间导数恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-15-VE-边缘得分的时间导数恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 处处为正且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|^2\\right]=-2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\|\\nabla^2\\log p_t(x)\\|_F^2\\right]\\le0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_F$</span> 为 Frobenius 范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2\\log p_t$</span> 为对数密度的 Hessian。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。由热方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t s_t=\\nabla(\\partial_t\\log p_t)=\\nabla(\\partial_t p_t/p_t)=\\nabla(\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\Delta p_t/p_t)$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t/p_t=\\Delta\\log p_t+\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\Delta\\log p_t=\\nabla\\cdot\\nabla^2\\log p_t$</span>（Hessian 的散度），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t s_t=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\left(\\nabla\\cdot\\nabla^2\\log p_t+\\nabla\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2\\right).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\|s_t\\|^2]$</span> 求导，需交换求导与积分：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t\\|^2p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的导数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\|x\\|^2+1)e^{-\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)}$</span> 控制（由命题 5.5.7 的得分界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的高斯衰减），故 Leibniz 法则适用。计算得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\|s_t\\|^2]=\\int\\left(2\\langle s_t,\\partial_t s_t\\rangle p_t+\\|s_t\\|^2\\partial_t p_t\\right)\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>第一项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_t,\\nabla\\cdot\\nabla^2\\log p_t\\rangle$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_t,\\nabla\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2\\rangle$</span> 分别分部积分，第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t\\|^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 分部积分，三项合并后交叉项抵消，仅剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\int p_t\\|\\nabla^2\\log p_t\\|_F^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。被积函数非负，故时间导数非正。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此恒等式表明 VE 前向过程使得分的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 范数单调衰减——噪声越大，得分越“平”，这与命题 5.5.7 的得分界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增大而收紧一致。它是 VE 反向采样中得分估计误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而减小这一经验现象的理论对应；本节仅记录恒等式，不展开误差分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-16-VE-边缘密度的显式梯度流表示\">命题 5.5.16（VE 边缘密度的显式梯度流表示）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-16-VE-边缘密度的显式梯度流表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 处处为正且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}[\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：VE 前向过程等价于在 Wasserstein 空间中的熵梯度流，其速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot\\left(p_t\\,(-\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log p_t)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由热方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 与恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t=\\nabla\\cdot(\\nabla p_t)=\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\log p_t)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\log p_t)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(-\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log p_t))$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此表示说明 VE 的漂移场为零、扩散系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 的 SDE，其 Fokker–Planck 方程恰为热方程，而热方程是熵泛函在 Wasserstein-2 度量下的梯度流。速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 指向熵增方向（与命题 5.5.9 的熵增恒等式一致）。本节仅记录此表示，不展开 Wasserstein 几何；与 Flow 的接口留待“与 Flow 的接口”节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-17-VE-边缘的尺度重参数化不变性\">命题 5.5.17（VE 边缘的尺度重参数化不变性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-17-VE-边缘的尺度重参数化不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 严格递增。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：定义重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\sigma_t^2/2$</span>，则 VE 边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的函数满足标准热方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_\\tau p=\\Delta p,\\qquad p\\big|_{\\tau=0}=p_{\\mathrm{data}},$$</div>\n<p>且其解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,\\tau)=(p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\ast G_{\\sqrt{2\\tau}})(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\partial_\\tau p\\cdot\\dot\\sigma_t^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\tau/\\mathrm{d}t=\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 已由命题 5.5.2 给出），代入热方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau p=\\Delta p$</span>。初始条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>。解的形式由命题 5.5.1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{2\\tau}$</span> 直接得到。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此重参数化说明 VE 的边缘分布在时间变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\sigma_t^2/2$</span> 下是标准热半群，与具体调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 无关——调度只影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的映射，不影响边缘密度的函数形式。这一观察是“信噪比与时间重参数化”节讨论 SNR 重参数化的前置事实；本节仅记录不变性，不展开 SNR。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-5-18-VE-边缘密度的显式积分核\">命题 5.5.18（VE 边缘密度的显式积分核）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-5-18-VE-边缘密度的显式积分核\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)^{-d/2}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\|x-y\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\right)\\mathrm{d}y,$$</div>\n<p>且该积分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 一致收敛，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：积分表示即命题 5.5.1 的显式写出。一致收敛性：被积函数的绝对值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)^{-d/2}e^{-\\|x-y\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)}$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 可积且积分值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\|p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\|_1(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)^{-d/2}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关。平滑性：对任意多重指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial^\\alpha_x$</span> 作用于被积函数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)\\partial^\\alpha G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)$</span>，其绝对值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(y)C_\\alpha\\sigma_t^{-|\\alpha|}(1+\\|x-y\\|^{|\\alpha|})G_{\\sigma_t}(x-y)$</span> 控制，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 可积且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部一致有界，故由 Leibniz 法则可在积分号下求任意阶导数。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题是命题 5.5.6 平滑性部分的显式版本，也是命题 5.5.10 与命题 5.5.14 中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^p$</span> 估计的出发点。本节至此完成了 VE 边缘分布的闭式表达、矩恒等式、得分恒等式、熵增、收敛性、稳定性、时间导数与重参数化不变性的完整推导链；反向动力学与调度选择留待后续节。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-信噪比与时间重参数化\">信噪比与时间重参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-信噪比与时间重参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in C([0,T];(0,\\infty))$</span> 为 VP 的前向速率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\in C^1([0,T];(0,\\infty))$</span> 为 VE 的噪声尺度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_0$</span> 为数据分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立。记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n本节引入的新符号仅一个：时间重参数化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\tau(t)$</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续、严格单调，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(T)=\\infty$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span> 时取极限意义）。所有命题的假设逐条列出；本节不涉及反向过程，故不需要漂移的 Lipschitz 条件。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（VP 正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续且取正值，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 严格递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（VE 正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>、严格递增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（数据矩）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。此条仅用于推论 5.6.3 的均方计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-定义-5-6-1-信噪比\">定义 5.6.1（信噪比）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-定义-5-6-1-信噪比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对 VP 与 VE 分别定义信噪比为确定性边缘分布中信号分量方差与噪声分量方差之比：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：信噪比是边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的标量泛函，只依赖调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sigma_t)$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>；它与“得分范数”<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|$</span> 不同，后者依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 且是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数。它也与“ Fisher 信息”不同：后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 对参数的敏感度。SNR 的单调递减性（命题 5.6.2）是时间重参数化的合法性来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-6-2-SNR-的单调性与极限\">命题 5.6.2（SNR 的单调性与极限）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-6-2-SNR-的单调性与极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 A1、A2 下：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span> 上严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(T)=\\bar\\alpha_T/(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span> 上严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(T)=1/\\sigma_T^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。(i) 由 A1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s ds}$</span> 严格递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=u/(1-u)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-u)^2&gt;0$</span>，故复合后关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\beta_s ds\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u/(1-u)\\to+\\infty$</span>。端点值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 直接代入。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由 A2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 严格递增且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 严格递减；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键点</strong>：两条 SNR 都从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 单调降到有限值，因此映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 可逆，这是重参数化的前提。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-定理-5-6-3-时间重参数化的等价性\">定理 5.6.3（时间重参数化的等价性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-定理-5-6-3-时间重参数化的等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 A1、A2 成立，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上（VP）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge c t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上（VE）。定义重参数化时间\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad\n\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\log\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}},\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 的严格递增连续双射（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 取极限），且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的其它函数形式；即若两条调度在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处给出相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 值，则它们在该时刻的边缘分布相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。先证双射性。VP：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\log\\bar\\alpha_t-\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。由 A1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 严格递减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 严格递增），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 严格递增。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\to+\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}\\to+\\infty$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(T)=\\log(\\bar\\alpha_T/(1-\\bar\\alpha_T))&lt;\\infty$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]\\to[\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(T),\\infty)$</span> 的双射（把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>）。VE：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=-2\\log\\sigma_t$</span>，由 A2 严格递减的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 给出严格递增的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span> 给出有限端点。双射性得证。</p>\n<p>再证边缘分布只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>。VP 的边缘分布（前序节已证）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\int p_0(x_0)\\,\\mathcal N\\!\\left(x;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I\\right)dx_0.$$</div>\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\log(u/(1-u))$</span>，反解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=e^{\\tau}/(1+e^{\\tau})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-u=1/(1+e^{\\tau})$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{e^{\\tau/2}}{\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}},\\qquad\n\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}}.$$</div>\n这两个系数都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的函数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>。VE 的边缘分布为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\int p_0(x_0)\\,\\mathcal N\\!\\left(x;x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I\\right)dx_0,$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=e^{-\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：定理 5.6.3 的假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge ct$</span> 仅用于保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在端点处的极限行为良好；若去掉，双射性可能失效（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 会使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(0)$</span> 有限），此时重参数化仍可定义但端点对应关系改变。该边界情形归入第 10 节反例节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推论-5-6-4-SNR-与重参数化时间的恒等关系\">推论 5.6.4（SNR 与重参数化时间的恒等关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推论-5-6-4-SNR-与重参数化时间的恒等关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在定理 5.6.3 的假设下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t),\\qquad\n\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t).$$</div>\n且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=e^{\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=e^{\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。直接由定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\log(\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\log(1/\\sigma_t^2)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span>。取指数即得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验性</strong>：推论给出一个恒等式，可在代码节用 <code>assert</code> 验证：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<code>log(snr_vp(t))</code> 与 <code>tau_vp(t)</code> 之差应在浮点误差内为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-6-5-VP-与-VE-在重参数化下的系数对应\">命题 5.6.5（VP 与 VE 在重参数化下的系数对应）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-6-5-VP-与-VE-在重参数化下的系数对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 A1、A2 成立，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{\\mathrm{VP}},t_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t_{\\mathrm{VP}})=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t_{\\mathrm{VE}})=:\\tau$</span>。则在该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}}=\\frac{e^{\\tau/2}}{\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}},\\quad\n\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}},\\quad\n\\sigma_{t_{\\mathrm{VE}}}=e^{-\\tau/2}.$$</div>\n从而 VP 的边缘分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处等价于“信号系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span>、噪声系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span>”的高斯卷积，VE 的边缘分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处等价于“信号系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、噪声系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}$</span>”的高斯卷积；两者相差一个整体缩放因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span>：将 VE 的边缘分布变量乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span> 后，其信号系数变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\tau/2}$</span>、噪声系数变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与 VP 的系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时渐近一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一组等式由定理 5.6.3 证明中的反解直接得到。第二组由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=e^{-\\tau}$</span> 开方得到。缩放论断：VE 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=x_0+\\sigma\\varepsilon$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}x=\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}x_0+e^{-\\tau/2}\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}\\to e^{\\tau/2}$</span>，故信号系数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\tau/2}$</span>、噪声系数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}\\to e^{\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}\\cdot\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}=e^{\\tau/2}$</span> 一致（在缩放后的坐标下）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：该命题说明 VP 与 VE 不是两种本质不同的扩散，而是在不同坐标缩放下的同一族高斯卷积；差异仅在信号系数的归一化方式。这为第 7 节“方差保持与方差爆炸”的讨论提供代数基础，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-例-5-6-6-线性调度下的显式计算\">例 5.6.6（线性调度下的显式计算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-例-5-6-6-线性调度下的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta_0$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=e^{-t}/(1-e^{-t})=1/(e^{t}-1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\log(1/(e^{t}-1))=-\\log(e^{t}-1)$</span>。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=e^{-1}\\approx0.3679$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(1)=e^{-1}/(1-e^{-1})\\approx0.5819$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(1)=\\log0.5819\\approx-0.5416$</span>。取 VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=1/t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=-2\\log t$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(1)=-0.5416$</span>，解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=e^{0.2708}\\approx1.311&gt;T$</span>，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 内无对应点；这说明两条调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 值域不同，重参数化等价只在共同值域上成立。此例同时验证了推论 5.6.4 的恒等式在数值上的正确性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-6-7-重参数化下的得分变换\">命题 5.6.7（重参数化下的得分变换）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-6-7-重参数化下的得分变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在定理 5.6.3 的假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span> 为 VP 边缘得分。则在重参数化时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)$</span> 下，得分满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\tilde s_\\tau\\!\\left(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\right),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_\\tau$</span> 是标准化变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处的得分。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}z)=\\tilde s_\\tau(z)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。VP 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x_0+\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的边缘是噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\tau=\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t}=e^{-\\tau/2}$</span> 的 VE 型卷积（由命题 5.6.5）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})^{-d}\\tilde p_\\tau(x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span> 取对数梯度：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})^{-1}\\,\\nabla_z\\log\\tilde p_\\tau(z)\\big|_{z=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\tilde s_\\tau\\!\\left(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\right).$$</div>\n但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau$</span> 的噪声尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\tau=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，其得分与标准化得分的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_\\tau(z)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}z)$</span>（由 VE 边缘的直接求导）。代入即得第一式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>用途</strong>：该命题是第 15 节“与反向 SDE 章的接口”的代数准备；本节只建立恒等式，不讨论反向动力学。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-6-8-重参数化时间的逆映射与调度等价类\">命题 5.6.8（重参数化时间的逆映射与调度等价类）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-6-8-重参数化时间的逆映射与调度等价类\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在定理 5.6.3 的假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}},\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 的值域分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(T),\\infty)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(T),\\infty)$</span>。定义逆映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$t_{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\tau)=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}^{-1}(\\tau),\\qquad t_{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\tau)=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}^{-1}(\\tau),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(T),\\infty)$</span> 上取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span>。则：</p>\n<p>(i) 两条调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下给出相同边缘分布的充要条件是它们在公共值域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\max\\{\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(T),\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(T)\\},\\infty)$</span> 上取值相同，即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在该区间内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\tau)$</span> 处的边缘分布经命题 5.6.5 的缩放后一致；</p>\n<p>(ii) 所有满足 A1 的 VP 调度构成一个等价类，其不变量正是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto p_\\tau$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下的边缘分布族）；两条 VP 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t,\\beta'_t$</span> 给出相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto p_\\tau$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\tau'_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t')$</span> 对某个重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'=\\phi(t)$</span> 成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]\\to(0,T']$</span> 的严格递增连续双射。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。(i) 由定理 5.6.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)$</span>），故在公共值域上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 相同则边缘分布相同（VP 与 VE 之间差一个整体缩放，见命题 5.6.5）。反之，若边缘分布在某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处相同，则定理 5.6.3 的系数表达式迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_{\\mathrm{VE}}}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}=e^{\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=e^{-\\tau/2}$</span>，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下的唯一系数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 值必相同。</p>\n<p>(ii) 必要性：若两条 VP 调度给出相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto p_\\tau$</span>，则由 (i) 它们在各自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 值处系数相同，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{\\tau}/(1+e^{\\tau})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha'_{t'}=e^{\\tau}/(1+e^{\\tau})$</span> 对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha'_{t'}$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(t)=t'$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha'_{\\phi(t)}=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；由 A1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 严格递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 是严格递增连续双射。充分性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha'_{\\phi(t)}=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'_{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\phi(t))=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)$</span>，由定理 5.6.3 边缘分布相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 5.6.8 的 (ii) 说明 VP 调度的“形状”不影响边缘分布族，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下的系数曲线影响；这为第 9 节“噪声调度的选择”提供判据：两条调度若通过重参数化等价，则它们在生成动力学上不可区分，选择只影响数值积分的时间网格，不影响连续时间极限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推论-5-6-9-SNR-的导数与对数导数恒等式\">推论 5.6.9（SNR 的导数与对数导数恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推论-5-6-9-SNR-的导数与对数导数恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 A1、A2 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>：</p>\n<p>(i) VP：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=-\\dfrac{\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) VE：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=-\\dfrac{2\\sigma'_t}{\\sigma_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\log\\bar\\alpha_t-\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。由 A1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 可微（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 连续），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=-\\beta_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta_t-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)+\\bar\\alpha_t\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}=-2\\log\\sigma_t$</span>，由 A2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 性直接求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\sigma'_t/\\sigma_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>用途</strong>：该推论把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的时间导数与调度参数直接联系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}}{dt}=-\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}}{dt}=-2\\sigma'_t/\\sigma_t$</span>。这是第 8 节“离散化与连续化的对应”中时间网格设计的关键量；本节只建立恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-6-10-重参数化下的转移核密度变换\">命题 5.6.10（重参数化下的转移核密度变换）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-6-10-重参数化下的转移核密度变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 为 VP 转移核。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)$</span> 坐标下，定义标准化变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则条件密度满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x\\mid x_0)\\,dx=\\tilde p_\\tau(z\\mid x_0)\\,dz,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau(z\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(z;x_0,e^{-\\tau}I\\right)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dz=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})^{-d}dx$</span>。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid x_0)=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})^{-d}\\,\\tilde p_\\tau(x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mid x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。VP 转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x_0+\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>。由命题 5.6.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t}=e^{-\\tau/2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x_0+e^{-\\tau/2}\\varepsilon$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau(z\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(z;x_0,e^{-\\tau}I)$</span>。变量替换的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})^{-d}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x\\mid x_0)dx=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})^{-d}\\tilde p_\\tau(x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mid x_0)\\cdot(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})^{d}dz=\\tilde p_\\tau(z\\mid x_0)dz$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键点</strong>：该命题把 VP 的条件密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下化为 VE 型条件密度，噪声尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}$</span>；这是命题 5.6.7 得分变换的概率密度版本，两者互为对偶（一个作用于密度、一个作用于对数梯度）。证明中变量替换的 Jacobian 必须显式写出，否则密度变换的常数因子会丢失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-例-5-6-11-余弦调度下的-tau-曲线与端点行为\">例 5.6.11（余弦调度下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 曲线与端点行为）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-例-5-6-11-余弦调度下的-tau-曲线与端点行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 VP 的余弦调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{t}{T}\\right)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=\\frac{\\pi}{T}\\tan\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\right)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0=0$</span>，不满足 A1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge c$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\log(\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=\\log\\cot^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\right)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2\\to+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}\\to+\\infty$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2(\\pi/2)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(T)=-\\infty$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 的值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-\\infty,+\\infty)$</span>，而非定理 5.6.3 要求的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(T),\\infty)$</span>。</p>\n<p>验证推论 5.6.9：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}}{dt}=-\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=-\\frac{\\pi}{T}\\tan(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})/\\sin^2(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})=-\\frac{\\pi}{T}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sin(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})\\cos(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})}=-\\frac{2\\pi}{T\\sin(\\frac{\\pi t}{T})}$</span>。直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\log\\cot^2$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\cot^2=2\\cdot\\frac{-\\csc^2(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2T}}{\\cot(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})}=-\\frac{\\pi}{T}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sin(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})\\cos(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})}$</span>，与推论一致。</p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：余弦调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0=0$</span>，破坏了定理 5.6.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge c$</span> 假设，导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(T)=-\\infty$</span> 而非有限端点。此时重参数化仍可定义（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-\\infty,+\\infty)$</span> 的双射），但端点对应关系改变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=-\\infty$</span>，而非定理 5.6.3 中的有限值。该边界情形归入第 10 节反例节处理；本节只指出假设失效的具体后果，不展开修正。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-6-12-tau-坐标下的得分范数恒等式\">命题 5.6.12（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下的得分范数恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-6-12-tau-坐标下的得分范数恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在定理 5.6.3 与命题 5.6.7 的假设下，对 VP 边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 与标准化得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_\\tau$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s_t(x)\\|^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\|\\tilde s_\\tau(z)\\|^2,\\qquad z=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t\\|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的具体形式。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 5.6.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\tilde s_\\tau(z)$</span>。取欧氏范数平方：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(x)\\|^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\tilde s_\\tau(z)\\|^2$</span>。由定理 5.6.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=1/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=e^{\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span> 也只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，故右端只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>用途</strong>：该恒等式是第 15 节“与反向 SDE 章的接口”中得分范数估计的代数准备；本节只建立恒等式，不讨论反向 SDE 的漂移项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-6-13-重参数化下的期望恒等式\">命题 5.6.13（重参数化下的期望恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-6-13-重参数化下的期望恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 A3 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立。对 VP 边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\,d.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0=\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2=\\frac{e^{\\tau}}{1+e^{\\tau}}\\,m_0+\\frac{1}{1+e^{\\tau}}\\,d.$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>。由独立性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 各分量独立标准正态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\varepsilon_i^2=1$</span>，共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 项）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{\\tau}/(1+e^{\\tau})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1/(1+e^{\\tau})$</span> 即得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-6-14-tau-坐标下-VE-的得分恒等式\">命题 5.6.14（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下 VE 的得分恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-6-14-tau-坐标下-VE-的得分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=\\int p_0(x_0)\\,\\mathcal N(x;x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I)\\,dx_0$</span> 为 VE 边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)$</span> 坐标下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x$</span>（VE 无信号缩放），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=e^{\\tau/2}\\,\\tilde s^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\tau(x),\\qquad\n\\|\\tilde s^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\tau(x)\\|^2=e^{-\\tau}\\,\\|s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\tau$</span> 是噪声尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}$</span> 的标准化 VE 边缘得分。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。VE 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=e^{-\\tau}$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau(x)=\\int p_0(x_0)\\,\\mathcal N(x;x_0,e^{-\\tau}I)\\,dx_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\tilde p_\\tau$</span>（同一函数，仅参数不同）。取对数梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=\\nabla_x\\log\\tilde p_\\tau(x)=\\tilde s^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\tau(x)$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau$</span> 的噪声尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 的噪声尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=e^{-\\tau/2}$</span>，两者数值相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\tilde s^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\tau$</span> 在函数层面恒等。要得到显式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\tau/2}$</span> 因子，需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\tau$</span> 定义为对标准化变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x/\\sigma_t$</span> 的得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\tau(z)=\\nabla_z\\log\\tilde p_\\tau(\\sigma_t z)$</span>。由链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=\\sigma_t^{-1}\\tilde s^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\tau(x/\\sigma_t)=e^{\\tau/2}\\tilde s^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\tau(e^{\\tau/2}x)$</span>。取范数平方即得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：该命题与命题 5.6.7 的 VP 版本形成对照：VP 的得分变换含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 因子（因信号被缩放），VE 的得分变换含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\tau/2}$</span> 因子（因噪声被缩放而信号不缩放）。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时都趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，对应高噪声极限下得分趋于零的直觉。本节只建立恒等式，不讨论该极限的收敛速率。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推论-5-6-15-VP-与-VE-得分在-tau-坐标下的关系\">推论 5.6.15（VP 与 VE 得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推论-5-6-15-VP-与-VE-得分在-tau-坐标下的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在定理 5.6.3 的假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在两条调度的公共值域内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}^{-1}(\\tau)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VE}}^{-1}(\\tau)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}\\;s_{t_{\\mathrm{VE}}}^{\\mathrm{VE}}\\!\\left(\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}\\,x\\right).$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>。由命题 5.6.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}}}\\tilde s_\\tau(x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_\\tau$</span> 是噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}$</span> 的标准化得分。由命题 5.6.14，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{t_{\\mathrm{VE}}}^{\\mathrm{VE}}(y)=e^{\\tau/2}\\tilde s_\\tau(e^{\\tau/2}y)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_\\tau(z)=e^{-\\tau/2}s_{t_{\\mathrm{VE}}}^{\\mathrm{VE}}(e^{-\\tau/2}z)$</span>。代入 VP 表达式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=\\frac{e^{-\\tau/2}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}}}\\;s_{t_{\\mathrm{VE}}}^{\\mathrm{VE}}\\!\\left(\\frac{e^{-\\tau/2}x}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}}}\\right).$$</div>\n由命题 5.6.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}}=e^{\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}}=1/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span>。故系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}=e^{-\\tau/2}\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span>，自变量缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}=e^{-\\tau/2}\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}/e^{\\tau/2}=\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}/e^{\\tau}$</span>。整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}\\,s^{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}x/e^{\\tau})$</span>。再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}x$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x/e^{\\tau}=y/(e^{\\tau}\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}})$</span>，与目标式差一个因子。逐项复核：目标式右端自变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}x$</span>，而推导给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}x/e^{\\tau}$</span>，两者相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau}$</span>。这说明命题 5.6.14 的标准化约定与命题 5.6.7 的约定在变量缩放的基准上不一致：前者以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x/\\sigma_t$</span> 为标准化变量，后者以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 为标准化变量。统一约定后，关系式应为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{t_{\\mathrm{VP}}}^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}\\;s_{t_{\\mathrm{VE}}}^{\\mathrm{VE}}\\!\\left(\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}\\,x\\right)\\cdot e^{-\\tau}.$$</div>\n即多一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau}$</span> 因子。该因子来自两条调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下信号系数的差异（VP 信号系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span>，VE 信号系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于零，与高噪声极限下 VP 得分被信号缩放压低的直觉一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：本推论的价值不在于关系式本身（它含一个约定依赖的因子），而在于揭示一个事实：VP 与 VE 的得分不能仅靠 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标直接等同，必须同时追踪信号系数的缩放。这一事实是第 7 节“方差保持与方差爆炸”中讨论两种参数化不可互换性的代数根源；本节只指出该事实，不展开第 7 节的内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-6-16-重参数化时间下的时间网格误差界\">命题 5.6.16（重参数化时间下的时间网格误差界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-6-16-重参数化时间下的时间网格误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\bar\\alpha_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>。取等距时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\Delta=T$</span>。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下，相邻网格点的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 增量为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta\\tau_k=\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t_{k+1})-\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t_k)=\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\frac{\\beta_s}{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,ds,$$</div>\n且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(\\bar\\alpha_{\\min},L_\\beta,T)$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\Delta\\tau_k-\\Delta\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_{t_k}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\right|\\le C\\Delta^2.$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>。由推论 5.6.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}}{dt}=\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。右端函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 Lipschitz：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\max}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\max}=\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 时下界退化，需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\bar\\alpha_{\\min}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge\\Delta$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近单独处理，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 连续性给出局部有界）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\bar\\alpha_{\\min}$</span> 的区间上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_g\\le L_\\beta/\\bar\\alpha_{\\min}+\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty L_\\beta/\\bar\\alpha_{\\min}^2$</span>。对积分用中点公式误差估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g(s)ds=\\Delta g(t_k)+\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g'(s)(s-t_k)(s-t_{k+1})\\,ds$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 处 Taylor 展开并积分余项），余项绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\frac{1}{2}L_g\\Delta^2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=L_g/2$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>用途</strong>：该命题给出离散化误差的显式上界，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下的网格误差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，且常数只依赖调度的 Lipschitz 常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的下界。这是第 8 节“离散化与连续化的对应”中误差分析的代数准备；本节只建立误差界，不讨论离散采样算法的收敛性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-例-5-6-17-线性调度下-Delta-tau_k-的显式计算与误差验证\">例 5.6.17（线性调度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_k$</span> 的显式计算与误差验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-例-5-6-17-线性调度下-Delta-tau_k-的显式计算与误差验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta_0$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-t}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\beta_0/(1-e^{-t})=1/(1-e^{-t})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge\\Delta$</span> 上由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(t)=-e^{-t}/(1-e^{-t})^2$</span> 的绝对值上界给出。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=10$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_k=\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}-\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(0)$</span> 发散，命题 5.6.16 的误差界不适用（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\min}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，下界退化）；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k\\ge0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\ge e^{-1}\\approx0.3679$</span>，误差界成立。数值验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_5=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_6=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_5=\\log\\frac{e^{-0.6}}{1-e^{-0.6}}-\\log\\frac{e^{-0.5}}{1-e^{-0.5}}\\approx\\log(0.5488/0.3935)-\\log(0.6065/0.4512)\\approx\\log1.3947-\\log1.3442\\approx0.0369$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta g(t_5)=0.1\\cdot1/(1-e^{-0.5})\\approx0.1\\cdot2.5415=0.2542$</span>，两者相差甚远。原因：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的增量，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta g(t_k)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 处的值乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，两者量纲不同；命题 5.6.16 的误差界比较的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta g(t_k)$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t_k)$</span> 本身随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 变化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_k$</span> 是积分而非乘积。正确的比较应是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\cdot g(t_k)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 缓变时的近似；本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.5,0.6]$</span> 上从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.5415$</span> 变到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.2161$</span>，变化率约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3.25$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\cdot g$</span> 的近似误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot3.25\\cdot0.01\\approx0.016$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_5$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0369$</span> 减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta g(t_5)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2542$</span> 不符。逐项复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_5$</span> 应等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{0.5}^{0.6}g(s)ds$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(0.5)=2.5415$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(0.6)=2.2161$</span>，积分约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2.5415+2.2161)/2\\cdot0.1=0.2379$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta g(t_5)=0.2542$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0163$</span>，符合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 误差界。前述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_5\\approx0.0369$</span> 的数值应更正为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(0.5488/0.3935)=\\log1.3947\\approx0.3327$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(0.6065/0.4512)=\\log1.3442\\approx0.2959$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0368$</span>，但这与积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2379$</span> 不符。错误在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-t}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\log(e^{-t}/(1-e^{-t}))=-t-\\log(1-e^{-t})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(0.6)-\\tau_{\\mathrm{VP}}(0.5)=(-0.6-\\log0.4512)-(-0.5-\\log0.3935)=-0.1-(\\log0.4512-\\log0.3935)=-0.1-\\log1.1467=-0.1-0.1369=-0.2369$</span>。绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2369$</span>，与积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2379$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.001$</span>，符合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。前述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0369$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 差值的错误符号导致。修正后验证通过。</p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(0)$</span> 发散，命题 5.6.16 的误差界不适用；这对应第 10 节反例节中“调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处退化导致网格误差界失效”的情形。本节只指出该边界，不展开修正。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 是仅依赖调度的标量泛函：VP 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，VE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；两者均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span> 上严格递减，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 降到有限端点值（命题 5.6.2）。</li>\n<li>时间重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 把两条调度统一到同一坐标：VP 的系数变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span>，VE 的系数变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}$</span>；边缘分布只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的具体函数形式（定理 5.6.3、推论 5.6.4、命题 5.6.5）。</li>\n<li>在重参数化坐标下，VP 得分与标准化得分满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}z)=\\tilde s_\\tau(z)$</span>，该恒等式是后续反向 SDE 与 Flow 接口的代数基础（命题 5.6.7）。</li>\n<li>信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 是仅依赖调度的标量泛函：VP 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，VE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；两者均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span> 上严格递减，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 降到有限端点值（命题 5.6.2），其对数导数与调度参数直接联系（推论 5.6.9）。</li>\n<li>时间重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 把两条调度统一到同一坐标：VP 的系数变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\tau/2}/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1+e^{\\tau}}$</span>，VE 的系数变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau/2}$</span>；边缘分布与转移核只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的具体函数形式（定理 5.6.3、命题 5.6.5、命题 5.6.10），且所有 VP 调度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 曲线构成等价类（命题 5.6.8）。</li>\n<li>在重参数化坐标下，VP 得分与标准化得分满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}z)=\\tilde s_\\tau(z)$</span> 及其范数版本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(x)\\|^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\tilde s_\\tau(z)\\|^2$</span>，均方范数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2=\\frac{e^{\\tau}}{1+e^{\\tau}}m_0+\\frac{1}{1+e^{\\tau}}d$</span>；这些恒等式是后续反向 SDE、Flow 接口与离散化节的代数基础（命题 5.6.7、命题 5.6.12、命题 5.6.13）。</li>\n<li>在重参数化坐标下，VP 得分与标准化得分满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}z)=\\tilde s_\\tau(z)$</span> 及其范数版本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(x)\\|^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\tilde s_\\tau(z)\\|^2$</span>，均方范数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2=\\frac{e^{\\tau}}{1+e^{\\tau}}m_0+\\frac{1}{1+e^{\\tau}}d$</span>；VP 与 VE 得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下的关系含约定依赖的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\tau}$</span> 因子（推论 5.6.15），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 坐标下的时间网格误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>（命题 5.6.16）；这些恒等式是后续反向 SDE、Flow 接口与离散化节的代数基础（命题 5.6.7、命题 5.6.12、命题 5.6.13、命题 5.6.14）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-方差保持与方差爆炸\">方差保持与方差爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-方差保持与方差爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s$</span> 为 VP 的非负速率函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_sds}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为 VE 的非负噪声尺度函数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为状态维度。本节新引入两个记号并在此定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t):=\\operatorname{Var}(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 表示 VP 在给定初值下的条件协方差（标量矩阵，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 倍的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t):=\\operatorname{Var}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>。两记号仅在本节用于对比两类扩散的方差行为，不改变 canonical claims 中的边缘分布表达式。</p>\n<p>假设 (A1)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_sds&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微、单调不增。假设 (A2)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续、单调不减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&lt;\\infty$</span>。假设 (A3)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 有有限二阶矩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。假设 (A4)：本节所有期望与求导均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 的联合分布下进行，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的表达式由前序节闭式解给出，故可测性自动成立。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：在同一时间轴上比较 VP 与 VE 的条件方差与边缘方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的演化，给出二者“方差保持”与“方差爆炸”命名的精确数学内容，并证明一个将两类扩散联系起来的恒等式。区别在于：VP 保持总方差有界（前向过程边缘方差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），VE 使总方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 增长（趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span>）；二者并非“哪个更好”，而是两种不同的方差预算分配，其信噪比衰减速率不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-定义-两类方差行为\">定义：两类方差行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-定义-两类方差行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（条件方差与边缘方差）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 VP 记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t):=1-\\bar\\alpha_t,\\qquad V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t):=\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2,$$</div>\n对 VE 记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t):=\\sigma_t^2,\\qquad V_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t):=\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2.$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时的条件方差标量（乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为边缘二阶矩。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（VP 的边缘方差有界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+d\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由前序节 VP 闭式解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 的期望。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\perp\\varepsilon$</span> 得交叉项期望为零：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2.$$</div>\n再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（VP 方差保持的精确含义）</strong> 在命题 1 条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2=d$</span>（即初值各向同性单位二阶矩），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=d$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立；一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\to\\infty}V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=d$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 代入命题 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t d+d(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=d$</span>。极限情形由 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 单调不增且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\infty\\beta_sds=\\infty$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}\\to d$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这说明“方差保持”并非指条件方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 保持常数（它从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），而是指边缘总二阶矩在前向过程中被约束在初值量级，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 发散。这是与 VE 的本质区别。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（VE 的边缘方差爆炸）</strong> 在 (A2)–(A3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+d\\,\\sigma_t^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 VE 闭式解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\perp\\varepsilon$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+d\\sigma_t^2.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)\\to\\infty$</span>，且条件方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\sigma_t^2\\to\\infty$</span>。此时信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-2}$</span> 衰减（见下节恒等式），而 VP 的 SNR 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 衰减。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-主定理-两类扩散的方差预算恒等式\">主定理：两类扩散的方差预算恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-主定理-两类扩散的方差预算恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（VP–VE 方差预算恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，VP 与 VE 的条件方差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\frac{v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)}{1+v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)}\\quad\\text{当}\\quad \\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n换言之，若取 VE 噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 VP 的条件方差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/(1+\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，且两过程的信噪比相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1+\\sigma_t^2=1+\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{1}{\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{1+\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t}{1/\\bar\\alpha_t}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t=v_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t).$$</div>\n信噪比：VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2/(d\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 在单位二阶矩初值下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，二者一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（方差比的单调性）</strong> 在定理 1 的参数对应下，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)/v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=1/(1+\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 单调不减）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 单调不减由 (A2)，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1+\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 单调不增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 1 的数学内容：VP 与 VE 并非两套独立理论，而是在方差预算上互为重参数化。VP 把总方差固定在初值量级，把“噪声预算” <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>；VE 把条件方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 无界放大。二者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 一一对应（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 上），此时边缘分布的高斯性与 SNR 衰减完全一致，仅总方差预算不同。这解释了为何两类 SDE 的反向采样在合适调度下可互相转化，也说明“方差保持/爆炸”是预算选择而非概率结构的差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-具体例子-线性调度下的闭式对比\">具体例子：线性调度下的闭式对比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-具体例子-线性调度下的闭式对比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta_0$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=1-e^{-t}$</span>。对应 VE 尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-e^{-t})/e^{-t}=e^{t}-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=e^{t}-1$</span>。验证定理 1：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{v_{\\mathrm{VE}}}{1+v_{\\mathrm{VE}}}=\\frac{e^{t}-1}{e^{t}}=1-e^{-t}=v_{\\mathrm{VP}}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VE}}=0$</span>，二者均无噪声；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}=1-e^{-1}\\approx0.632$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VE}}=e-1\\approx1.718$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.632/1.718\\approx0.368=1/e$</span>，与推论 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1+\\sigma_1^2)=1/e$</span> 一致。此例说明：同一 SNR 轨迹下，VE 的条件方差可比 VP 大约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e$</span> 倍，边缘二阶矩则相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(e-1)$</span> 量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-代码验证-闭式方差与恒等式\">代码验证：闭式方差与恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-代码验证-闭式方差与恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=4$</span>、线性调度下采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，验证命题 1、命题 2 与定理 1 的数值一致性，含 assert 与形状打印。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nd = 4\nN = 200000\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# 初值：单位二阶矩各向同性\nx0 = rng.standard_normal((N, d))\nassert np.allclose(np.mean(np.sum(x0**2, axis=1)), d, rtol=0.02)\n\nt = 1.0\nbeta0 = 1.0\nalpha_bar = np.exp(-beta0 * t)          # VP: \\bar\\alpha_t = e^{-t}\nv_vp = 1.0 - alpha_bar                  # VP 条件方差标量\nsigma2 = (1.0 - alpha_bar) / alpha_bar  # 对应 VE 尺度\nv_ve = sigma2\n\neps = rng.standard_normal((N, d))\nx_vp = np.sqrt(alpha_bar) * x0 + np.sqrt(v_vp) * eps\nx_ve = x0 + np.sqrt(v_ve) * eps\n\n# 命题 1：VP 边缘二阶矩\nV_vp_emp = np.mean(np.sum(x_vp**2, axis=1))\nV_vp_th = alpha_bar * d + d * v_vp\nassert np.allclose(V_vp_emp, V_vp_th, rtol=0.02), (V_vp_emp, V_vp_th)\n\n# 命题 2：VE 边缘二阶矩\nV_ve_emp = np.mean(np.sum(x_ve**2, axis=1))\nV_ve_th = d + d * v_ve\nassert np.allclose(V_ve_emp, V_ve_th, rtol=0.02), (V_ve_emp, V_ve_th)\n\n# 定理 1：条件方差恒等式\nassert np.isclose(v_vp, v_ve / (1.0 + v_ve)), (v_vp, v_ve / (1.0 + v_ve))\n\nprint(&quot;x_vp shape:&quot;, x_vp.shape, &quot;x_ve shape:&quot;, x_ve.shape)\nprint(&quot;V_vp empirical/theory:&quot;, V_vp_emp, V_vp_th)\nprint(&quot;V_ve empirical/theory:&quot;, V_ve_emp, V_ve_th)\nprint(&quot;v_vp, v_ve/(1+v_ve):&quot;, v_vp, v_ve / (1.0 + v_ve))\n# 预期：形状 (200000, 4)；V_vp ≈ 4.0；V_ve ≈ 4*(1+e-1)=4e≈10.87；\n# v_vp≈0.632；v_ve/(1+v_ve)≈0.632\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>x_vp shape: (200000, 4)</code>，<code>V_vp empirical/theory</code> 均约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4.0$</span>，<code>V_ve empirical/theory</code> 均约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10.87$</span>，最后一行两数均约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.632$</span>。所有 assert 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-与信噪比及时间重参数化的接口\">与信噪比及时间重参数化的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-与信噪比及时间重参数化的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>（VP）。由定理 1，在对应参数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=1/\\sigma_t^2=\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)$</span>（单位二阶矩初值）。因此“方差保持 vs 方差爆炸”不改变 SNR 的时间轨迹，只改变总方差预算；时间重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 对两类扩散给出同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴，这为后续节“离散化与连续化的对应”中统一 DDPM 与连续 SDE 提供了接口：离散 DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 序列对应 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，其方差预算固定；若改用 VE 参数化，则需同步重标定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>，否则反向 SDE 的漂移量级会随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 放大，这正是后续“调度不当导致数值爆炸”节要处理的问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-方差比的精确界与极限行为\">方差比的精确界与极限行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-方差比的精确界与极限行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 1 给出了参数对应下的方差比恒等式。本节进一步刻画：在任意调度（不限于对应参数）下，VP 与 VE 的条件方差比如何被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 双向控制，从而说明“方差保持”与“方差爆炸”不是绝对属性，而是相对于初值二阶矩与噪声预算的比值属性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（方差比的双向界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t):=v_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)/v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\le r(t)\\le \\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\quad\\text{当}\\quad \\sigma_t^2\\ge 1-\\bar\\alpha_t,$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)&gt;1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 是精确等式而非不等式；命题中的“界”来自对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 的放缩：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\le1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)\\le1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)\\ge0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)\\le1$</span>，此时 VP 条件方差不超过 VE 条件方差；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)&gt;1$</span>，VP 条件方差更大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（方差爆炸的判据）</strong> 在命题 3 条件下，VE 相对 VP 的条件方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时刻“爆炸”当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;1/\\bar\\alpha_t-1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)&lt;\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)$</span>（单位二阶矩初值）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\iff r(t)&lt;1\\iff v_{\\mathrm{VE}}&gt;v_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span>。在单位二阶矩初值下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}=1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 两边取倒数并乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2&lt;\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把“爆炸”从模糊的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 很大”精确化为与 VP 噪声预算的可比关系：只有当 VE 的噪声尺度超过 VP 在同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下的噪声预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时，VE 的条件方差才严格大于 VP。这解释了为何在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较小时（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 很小），VE 即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 不大也可能已“爆炸”；而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大时（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），VE 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;1$</span> 才爆炸。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-边缘分布的高斯性与二阶矩的充分性\">边缘分布的高斯性与二阶矩的充分性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-边缘分布的高斯性与二阶矩的充分性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出两类扩散的闭式边缘分布均为高斯。本节补充一个可检验的恒等式：边缘分布的高斯性由条件高斯性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布卷积决定，而二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}},V_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 完全刻画了高斯边缘的协方差，故命题 1、命题 2 的标量公式足以确定整个边缘分布（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 各向同性时）。这一事实是后续“代码：调度对密度的影响”节中密度比较的理论依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（各向同性初值下的边缘协方差）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\kappa I_d)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}\\sim\\mathcal N\\big(0,\\,(\\kappa\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\big),\\qquad x_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}\\sim\\mathcal N\\big(0,\\,(\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2)I_d\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 VP 闭式解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立且均为高斯，其线性组合为高斯，协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\kappa I_d+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span>。VE 同理：协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa I_d+\\sigma_t^2I_d$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（协方差迹与命题 1、2 的一致性）</strong> 在命题 4 条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}\\operatorname{Cov}(x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}})=d(\\kappa\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}\\operatorname{Cov}(x_t^{\\mathrm{VE}})=d(\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2)=V_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取迹即得，与命题 1、2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2=d\\kappa$</span> 代入一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：命题 1、2 的标量二阶矩公式不是独立假设，而是高斯边缘协方差迹的直接结果；因此在本节所有比较中，只需比较标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 即可比较整个边缘分布（在各向同性情形下），无需逐坐标展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-时间重参数化下的方差单调性\">时间重参数化下的方差单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-时间重参数化下的方差单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节定义了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>。本节证明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴上，VP 与 VE 的条件方差均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的单调函数，且二者的复合给出定理 1 的另一种表述。这为后续“离散化与连续化的对应”节中“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 为统一时间轴”的做法提供严格依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴上的方差表达）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 严格单调递减（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>），记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\frac{1}{1+e^{\\lambda}},\\qquad v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=e^{-\\lambda}\\quad(\\text{对应参数下}).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=e^{\\lambda}=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{\\lambda}/(1+e^{\\lambda})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1/(1+e^{\\lambda})=v_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span>。对应参数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t=1/e^{\\lambda}=e^{-\\lambda}=v_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴的方差比恒等式）</strong> 在命题 5 条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\lambda)=v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\lambda)/(1+v_{\\mathrm{VE}}(\\lambda))$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 单调递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 单调递减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VE}}=e^{-\\lambda}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda}/(1+e^{-\\lambda})=1/(1+e^{\\lambda})=v_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span>。单调性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\lambda}$</span> 单调递增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda}$</span> 单调递减直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 与推论 6 的数学内容：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴把两类扩散的条件方差统一为同一参数的函数，VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 是 logistic 型饱和函数（上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 是指数型无界函数。二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to-\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span>）时均趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to+\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span>）时分别趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>。这正是“方差保持”与“方差爆炸”在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴上的精确图像：同一 SNR 衰减轨迹下，VP 的方差预算饱和，VE 的方差预算发散。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-与反向-SDE-漂移量级的接口\">与反向 SDE 漂移量级的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-与反向-SDE-漂移量级的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个与后续“与反向 SDE 章的接口”节直接相关的量级结论：反向 SDE 的漂移项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，其量级由边缘协方差之逆控制；因此 VP 与 VE 的边缘协方差差异直接转化为反向漂移的量级差异。本节只陈述量级关系，不展开反向 SDE 的推导（留待后续节）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（得分量级与方差预算）</strong> 在命题 4 条件下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为高斯边缘密度，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|\\le\\|x\\|/\\lambda_{\\min}(\\Sigma_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span> 为命题 4 给出的协方差矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}$</span> 为其最小特征值。对 VP，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}=\\kappa\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\min(\\kappa,1)$</span>；对 VE，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}=\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 增长。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac12 x^\\top\\Sigma_t^{-1}x+\\text{const}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\Sigma_t^{-1}x$</span>，取范数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Sigma_t^{-1}x\\|\\le\\|x\\|/\\lambda_{\\min}(\\Sigma_t)$</span>。VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}$</span> 由命题 4 的标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 给出，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，该标量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 之间，故下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(\\kappa,1)$</span>。VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}=\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2$</span> 直接随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 增长。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（VE 得分量级的衰减）</strong> 在命题 6 条件下，VE 的得分范数上界按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 衰减，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；VP 的得分范数上界不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 发散，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max(1/\\kappa,1)$</span> 控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 6，VE 上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|/(\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2)\\to0$</span>；VP 上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|/\\min(\\kappa,1)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与后续“调度不当导致数值爆炸”节形成对照：VE 的得分量级随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 衰减，看似“安全”，但其反向 SDE 的漂移还含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 相关的扩散系数与时间导数项，量级并不由得分单独决定；VP 的得分量级有界，但其反向漂移含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 因子，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 调度不当（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 过大），同样会导致数值不稳定。因此“方差保持 vs 方差爆炸”只刻画前向过程的方差预算，不直接等价于反向过程的数值稳定性；后者需结合漂移与扩散系数的联合量级分析，这正是后续节的任务。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-方差预算的加性分解与时间导数恒等式\">方差预算的加性分解与时间导数恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-方差预算的加性分解与时间导数恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序命题给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 的闭式表达，但未刻画二者随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的瞬时变化率。本节补足这一环节：证明两个恒等式，将方差的时间导数分解为“信号衰减项”与“噪声注入项”，并说明两类扩散的导数结构差异正是“保持”与“爆炸”的微分形式。这些恒等式在后续“离散化与连续化的对应”节中用于验证 Euler 离散的局部截断误差量级。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（VP 边缘二阶矩的时间导数）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 连续，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t\\big(\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2-d\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+d(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_sds}$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\bar\\alpha_t=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 逐项求导（有限和，无需交换积分与极限）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}V_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2\\frac{d\\bar\\alpha_t}{dt}-d\\frac{d\\bar\\alpha_t}{dt}=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t d=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t(\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2-d).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9（VP 方差的单调方向）</strong> 在命题 8 条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&gt;d$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 单调递减；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;d$</span>，则单调递增；若相等，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}\\equiv d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，导数符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2-d)$</span> 决定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出“方差保持”的微分刻画：VP 的边缘二阶矩并非恒定，而是以速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 收敛；当且仅当初值二阶矩恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 时，导数恒为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 严格保持。这与命题 1 的极限陈述互补：命题 1 说 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}\\to d$</span>，推论 9 说收敛方向由初值相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的位置决定，收敛速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（VE 边缘二阶矩的时间导数）</strong> 在 (A2)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}V_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=2d\\,\\sigma_t\\,\\dot\\sigma_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t=\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+d\\sigma_t^2$</span>。第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关，第二项求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2d\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11（VE 方差的单调方向）</strong> 在命题 10 条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 单调不减当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t\\ge0$</span>，即 (A2) 的单调不减假设；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，则严格递增且导数无上界（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t$</span> 不衰减时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge0$</span>，导数符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t$</span> 决定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对比命题 8 与命题 10：VP 的导数含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 指数衰减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>），故方差变化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时趋于停滞，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 饱和于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>；VE 的导数含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增长（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增长时），故方差变化持续加速，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 无界。这就是“保持”与“爆炸”在微分层面的精确区别：前者导数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 压制，后者导数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 放大。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 12（导数比的界）</strong> 在命题 8、10 条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2=d$</span>（VP 导数恒零），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V'_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)|/V'_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'_{\\mathrm{VE}}&gt;0$</span>）；一般地\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{|V'_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)|}{V'_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t|\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2-d|}{2d\\,\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t}\\quad(\\text{当 }V'_{\\mathrm{VE}}&gt;0).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接取命题 8、10 的导数绝对值之比。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：在对应参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 通过链式法则关联，比值可进一步化简为仅含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的表达式；但本节不展开该化简，因其属于“时间重参数化”的细节，留待后续节在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴上统一处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-二阶矩之外的分布差异-峰度恒等式\">二阶矩之外的分布差异：峰度恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-二阶矩之外的分布差异-峰度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1、2 只比较了二阶矩。本节补一个可检验的高阶恒等式，说明两类扩散的边缘分布在四阶矩上也有闭式差异，从而排除“仅二阶矩相同即分布相同”的误读。该恒等式在后续“代码：调度对密度的影响”节中用于断言密度比较不能只看方差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13（四阶矩的闭式）</strong> 在命题 4 条件下（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\kappa I_d)$</span>），记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_4(t):=\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^4$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_4^{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=(\\kappa\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2\\,(d^2+2d),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_4^{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=(\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2)^2\\,(d^2+2d).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为零均值高斯，协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=c_tI_d$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2$</span>。对零均值高斯向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x\\|^4=c_t^2\\mathbb E\\|z\\|^4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|z\\|^4=d^2+2d$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E z_i^4=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E z_i^2z_j^2=1$</span> 求和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\cdot3+d(d-1)\\cdot1=d^2+2d$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_4=c_t^2(d^2+2d)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 14（四阶矩比与二阶矩比的关系）</strong> 在命题 13 条件下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_2(t)=v_{\\mathrm{VP}}/v_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span>（对应参数下），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{M_4^{\\mathrm{VP}}}{M_4^{\\mathrm{VE}}}=\\left(\\frac{\\kappa\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2}\\right)^2.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span> 且取对应参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时，该比值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取命题 13 两式之比，平方项相除。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span> 时，VP 协方差标量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span>；VE 协方差标量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t=1/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；比值平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 14 给出一个尖锐的检验：在单位二阶矩初值与对应参数下，VP 的四阶矩恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d^2+2d$</span>（因协方差标量恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），而 VE 的四阶矩按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{-2}$</span> 增长。因此即便二阶矩在对应参数下通过定理 1 关联，四阶矩仍相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span> 因子；两类扩散的边缘分布不是同一分布的不同参数化，而是协方差标量不同的高斯分布，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时重合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，二者均为初值分布）。这一事实排除了“VP 与 VE 在对应参数下分布相同”的错误直觉，也说明为何反向采样时不能仅凭 SNR 匹配就互换两类 SDE 的漂移项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-数值可检验的恒等式汇总\">数值可检验的恒等式汇总<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-数值可检验的恒等式汇总\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个汇总命题，把前述可检验恒等式并列，供代码节直接断言。该命题不引入新假设，仅整理已证结论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15（本节恒等式清单）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 及命题 4 的各向同性条件下，下列恒等式成立：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{(i) } V_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+d(1-\\bar\\alpha_t);\\quad \\text{(ii) } V_{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+d\\sigma_t^2;$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{(iii) } v_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\frac{v_{\\mathrm{VE}}}{1+v_{\\mathrm{VE}}}\\ \\text{当}\\ \\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t};\\quad \\text{(iv) } v_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\frac{1}{1+e^{\\lambda}},\\ v_{\\mathrm{VE}}=e^{-\\lambda};$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{(v) } \\frac{d}{dt}V_{\\mathrm{VP}}=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t(\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2-d);\\quad \\text{(vi) } \\frac{d}{dt}V_{\\mathrm{VE}}=2d\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t;$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{(vii) } \\frac{M_4^{\\mathrm{VP}}}{M_4^{\\mathrm{VE}}}=\\left(\\frac{\\kappa\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2}\\right)^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i)(ii) 为命题 1、2；(iii) 为定理 1；(iv) 为命题 5；(v)(vi) 为命题 8、10；(vii) 为推论 14。各条已在对应命题中证明，此处仅并列。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15 的作用是把本节所有闭式结论压缩为七条可直接数值断言的等式，避免后续代码节重复推导。其中 (iii) 与 (iv) 是参数对应下的恒等式，(i)(ii)(v)(vi)(vii) 对任意满足假设的调度成立。读者可在代码中以随机采样验证 (i)(ii)(vii)，以解析代入验证 (iii)(iv)(v)(vi)。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-边界情形-bar-alpha_t-to0-与-sigma_t-to-infty-的极限交换\">边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限交换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-边界情形-bar-alpha_t-to0-与-sigma_t-to-infty-的极限交换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节以两个极限陈述收尾，明确“保持”与“爆炸”在端点处的行为，并指出极限交换的合法性依据，为后续“反例：调度不当导致数值爆炸”节提供对照基准。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16（端点极限）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\infty\\beta_sds=\\infty$</span>（故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{t\\to\\infty}V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=d,\\qquad \\lim_{t\\to\\infty}\\frac{V_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)}{d\\sigma_t^2}=1.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\to d$</span>。第二式由命题 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VE}}/(d\\sigma_t^2)=\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2/(d\\sigma_t^2)+1\\to1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>）。两极限均为有限项相加，无需交换积分与极限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2$</span> 的有界性由 (A3) 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16 的数学内容：VP 的边缘二阶矩在无穷时间极限下收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，与初值二阶矩无关（只要有限）；VE 的边缘二阶矩在无穷时间极限下由噪声项主导，初值项相对可忽略。这正是“保持”与“爆炸”的端点图像：前者遗忘初值二阶矩、饱和于噪声预算上限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>；后者遗忘初值二阶矩、发散于噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>。二者在“遗忘初值”这一点上一致，区别仅在遗忘后的归宿是常数还是无穷。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17（极限下的得分量级）</strong> 在命题 16 与命题 6 条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\to\\infty}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)\\|\\le\\|x\\|/\\min(\\kappa,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\to\\infty}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)\\|=0$</span>（对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 6 的上界与命题 16 的协方差极限：VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}$</span> 极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(\\kappa,1)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时标量趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 取小者），VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}=\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2\\to\\infty$</span>，故上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|/(\\kappa+\\sigma_t^2)\\to0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 17 与推论 7 一致，但补充了端点处的精确归宿：VP 的得分上界在无穷时间不衰减到零，而被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(\\kappa,1)$</span> 锁定；VE 的得分上界趋于零。这一差异在反向 SDE 数值实现中表现为：VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时得分项贡献微弱，漂移主要由扩散系数的时间导数项主导；VP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时得分项仍有非零量级，漂移由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与得分共同决定。后续“与反向 SDE 章的接口”节将据此讨论两类 SDE 的漂移量级平衡条件。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>VP 的“方差保持”精确指边缘二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+d(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 有界并于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，而非条件方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为常数；VE 的条件方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与边缘二阶矩均随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 无界增长。</li>\n<li>定理 1 给出两类扩散的方差预算恒等式：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}=v_{\\mathrm{VE}}/(1+v_{\\mathrm{VE}})$</span> 且 SNR 轨迹相同，说明二者是同一概率结构在不同总方差预算下的重参数化。</li>\n<li>该恒等式将 VP 与 VE 的闭式解、SNR 与时间重参数化统一到同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 轴，为后续离散化对应、调度选择与反向 SDE 的数值稳定性分析提供精确接口。</li>\n<li>定理 1 给出两类扩散的方差预算恒等式：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{VP}}=v_{\\mathrm{VE}}/(1+v_{\\mathrm{VE}})$</span> 且 SNR 轨迹相同，说明二者是同一概率结构在不同总方差预算下的重参数化；命题 3 与推论 4 进一步把“爆炸”精确化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的可比判据。</li>\n<li>命题 5 与推论 6 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 轴上把 VP 的方差写成 logistic 饱和函数、VE 写成指数无界函数，命题 6 与推论 7 则把方差预算差异转化为得分量级差异，为后续离散化对应、调度选择与反向 SDE 数值稳定性分析提供精确接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-离散化与连续化的对应\">离散化与连续化的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散化与连续化的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号，不引入新的概率对象，仅引入离散时间网格与数值格式所需的记号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连续时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>。时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\dots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n:=t_{n+1}-t_n$</span>，最大步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta:=\\max_n\\Delta_n$</span>。</li>\n<li>VP 连续时间过程：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\ge 0$</span> 连续。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 以简化书写，但 canonical 符号仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>VE 连续时间过程：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 连续、非负、严格递增于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>。</li>\n<li>离散 DDPM 前向链：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{n+1}\\mid x_n)=\\mathcal N\\!\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_{n}}\\,x_n,\\ \\beta^{\\mathrm d}_{n}I\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\in(0,1)$</span> 为离散调度系数。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n:=\\prod_{k=0}^{n-1}(1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k)$</span>，则离散边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\varepsilon$</span>。</li>\n<li>维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。所有范数为欧氏范数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：在显式假设下，证明当网格加密 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to 0$</span> 且离散调度按特定方式收敛到连续速率时，离散 DDPM 的边缘分布弱收敛到 VP 连续时间边缘分布；并给出 VE 情形下 Euler 型离散格式的对应恒等式。所有交换极限的论证均引用 Dominated Convergence 或 Scheffé 引理，并逐条验证条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散-DDPM-到-VP-SDE-的边缘收敛\">离散 DDPM 到 VP-SDE 的边缘收敛<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散-DDPM-到-VP-SDE-的边缘收敛\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（离散边缘的闭式表达）</strong><br>\n假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\in(0,1)$</span> 对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为确定性向量或与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\,\\varepsilon_n,\\qquad \\varepsilon_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d),\\ \\varepsilon_n\\perp x_0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=x_0$</span>，平凡。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n+1}=\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\,x_n+\\sqrt{\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\,\\xi_n\n=\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\varepsilon_n\\big)+\\sqrt{\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\xi_n,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span>。合并两个独立高斯项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{(1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n)(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n)}\\,\\varepsilon_n+\\sqrt{\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\,\\xi_n\n\\overset{d}{=}\\sqrt{(1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n)(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n)+\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\;\\varepsilon_{n+1}\n=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n+1}}\\,\\varepsilon_{n+1},$$</div>\n<p>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n)(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n)+\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=1-(1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n)\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n+1}$</span>。方差相加的等式由独立性保证，分布相等由高斯分布对独立卷积封闭保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.2（离散到连续的边缘弱收敛）</strong><br>\n假设：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续；(ii) 离散调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\beta_s\\,ds+o(\\Delta_n)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n o(\\Delta_n)\\to 0$</span>；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span>；(iv) <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 固定或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且与全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立。则对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，沿网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n\\to t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_n\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 表示依分布收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 8.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}x_0,\\ (1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n)I_d\\big)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 固定时）。需证两参数收敛：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\prod_{k=0}^{n-1}(1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}=\\bar\\alpha_t.$$</div>\n<p>取对数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\log(1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k)$</span>。由假设 (ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k=\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\beta_sds+o(\\Delta_k)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k\\to0$</span> 一致（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 连续有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k\\le\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty\\Delta_k$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[0,1/2]$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log(1-u)+u|\\le u^2$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\log\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n+\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k\\Big|\n\\le\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k)^2\n\\le\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty^2\\Delta\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\Delta_k\n=\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty^2\\Delta\\,t\\ \\longrightarrow\\ 0.$$</div>\n<p>又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k=\\int_0^{t_n}\\beta_sds+\\sum_k o(\\Delta_k)\\to\\int_0^t\\beta_sds$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n\\to-\\int_0^t\\beta_sds$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n\\to\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。于是均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}x_0\\to\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n)I_d\\to(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span>。高斯分布由均值与协方差唯一确定，且对参数连续依赖（特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(i\\langle u,m\\rangle-\\tfrac12u^\\top\\Sigma u)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(m,\\Sigma)$</span> 连续，由 Dominated Convergence 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 积分可得弱收敛）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.3（信噪比的离散—连续一致性）</strong><br>\n在命题 8.2 假设下，离散信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_n:=\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n/(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_n\\to\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n\\to\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 及函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto u/(1-u)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[0,1)$</span> 连续，直接得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-VE-的-Euler-离散与连续极限\">VE 的 Euler 离散与连续极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-VE-的-Euler-离散与连续极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>VE 连续过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 不含漂移，其前向“离散化”不是 DDPM 链，而是直接对噪声尺度采样。若强行写 Euler 格式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}=x_n+(\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}-\\sigma_{t_n})\\xi_n$</span>，则需验证其边缘与连续边缘一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.4（VE Euler 格式的精确边缘）</strong><br>\n假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 连续、非负、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_n$</span> 独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}=x_n+(\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}-\\sigma_{t_n})\\xi_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 给定。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_n=x_0+\\sigma_{t_n}\\varepsilon_n,\\qquad \\varepsilon_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d),\\ \\varepsilon_n\\perp x_0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_0}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=x_0$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n+1}=x_0+\\sigma_{t_n}\\varepsilon_n+(\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}-\\sigma_{t_n})\\xi_n\n=x_0+\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}\\varepsilon_{n+1},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}\\varepsilon_n+(\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}-\\sigma_{t_n})\\xi_n$</span> 是两个独立中心高斯的和，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}^2+(\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}-\\sigma_{t_n})^2$</span>。这<strong>不等于</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}^2$</span>，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}(\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}-\\sigma_{t_n})=0$</span>。因此上述 Euler 格式<strong>不</strong>保持 VE 边缘。正确的离散化应直接取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=x_0+\\sigma_{t_n}\\varepsilon$</span>，即噪声尺度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}$</span> 采样，而非增量叠加。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.5</strong> 命题 8.4 的证明暴露了一个常见错误：把 VE 写成加性噪声的 Euler 链会引入方差偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}^2+(\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}-\\sigma_{t_n})^2-\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}^2=-2\\sigma_{t_n}(\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}-\\sigma_{t_n})&lt;0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 递增）。VE 的正确离散对应是“重参数化采样”而非“增量链”。这与 VP 情形形成对照：VP 的 DDPM 链因每步做方差收缩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}$</span>，恰好使方差相加为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n+1}$</span>，从而与连续边缘一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-时间重参数化的对应\">时间重参数化的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-时间重参数化的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t:=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>。离散化对应要求离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n:=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_n$</span> 与连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 在网格上一致到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的离散—连续误差界）</strong><br>\n假设同命题 8.2，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\lambda_n-\\lambda_{t_n}|\\le C_\\beta\\,\\Delta,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\beta$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 8.2 证明中的估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n-\\log\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}|\\le\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty^2\\Delta t_n+o(1)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}$</span> 的差同阶。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto\\log u-\\log(1-u)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\bar\\alpha_{\\min},1-\\delta]$</span> 上 Lipschitz，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 保证。合并得界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.7（VP 与 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下的统一）</strong><br>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下，VP 边缘写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\lambda=\\sqrt{\\mathrm{sigmoid}(\\lambda)}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{\\mathrm{sigmoid}(-\\lambda)}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，VE 边缘在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=e^{-\\lambda/2}$</span> 时写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\lambda=x_0+e^{-\\lambda/2}\\varepsilon$</span>。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to\\infty$</span> 时均趋于纯噪声，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to-\\infty$</span> 时均趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>；但 VP 的系数有界，VE 的噪声系数无界。这一区别是第 7 节“方差保持与方差爆炸”的定量表述，本节只确认离散化不破坏该结构。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\mathrm{sigmoid}(\\lambda)$</span> 得 VP 表达式；VE 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1/\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=e^{-\\lambda}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=e^{-\\lambda/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-一个可检验的数值恒等式\">一个可检验的数值恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-一个可检验的数值恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8.8（离散 VP 的方差恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设同命题 8.1。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_n-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}x_0\\|^2=1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_n\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n)d$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 8.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}x_0=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\varepsilon_n$</span>，取期望即得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_n\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n)\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_n\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_n\\|^2=d$</span> 得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式是代码节验证离散采样正确性的判据：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，样本二阶矩应等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n\\|x_0\\|^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n)d$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef vp_discrete_moments(x0, betas):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;Return bar_alpha_n and predicted E||x_n||^2 for discrete VP chain.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    x0 = np.asarray(x0, dtype=float)\n    d = x0.size\n    bar = 1.0\n    out = []\n    for b in betas:\n        bar *= (1.0 - b)\n        pred = bar * np.sum(x0**2) + (1.0 - bar) * d\n        out.append((bar, pred))\n    return out\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd = 8\nx0 = rng.normal(size=d)\nbetas = np.linspace(1e-4, 0.05, 50)\npreds = vp_discrete_moments(x0, betas)\n\n# Monte Carlo check at final step\nbar_final, pred_final = preds[-1]\nN = 200000\neps = rng.normal(size=(N, d))\nx_final = np.sqrt(bar_final) * x0 + np.sqrt(1.0 - bar_final) * eps\nemp = np.mean(np.sum(x_final**2, axis=1))\nassert abs(emp - pred_final) / pred_final &lt; 0.01, (emp, pred_final)\nprint(&quot;shape x_final:&quot;, x_final.shape)\nprint(&quot;bar_alpha_final:&quot;, bar_final)\nprint(&quot;predicted E||x||^2:&quot;, pred_final)\nprint(&quot;empirical E||x||^2:&quot;, emp)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>x_final</code> 形状 <code>(200000, 8)</code>，<code>bar_alpha_final</code> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\sum\\beta}$</span> 量级，预测与经验二阶矩相对误差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\%$</span>，<code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散反向链的连续化-从-DDPM-采样到反向-SDE\">离散反向链的连续化：从 DDPM 采样到反向 SDE<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散反向链的连续化-从-DDPM-采样到反向-SDE\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序小节只处理了前向边缘的离散—连续对应。本节还需说明：反向采样链在网格加密时收敛到反向 SDE，这是“离散化与连续化对应”的另一半。设前向离散链由命题 8.1 给出，反向链定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(x_n\\mid x_{n+1})=\\mathcal N\\!\\big(\\mu_\\theta(x_{n+1},n),\\ \\Sigma_n\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n=\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n:=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 为后验方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 为参数化均值。本节不讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的得分参数化（那属于反向 SDE 章），只建立<strong>给定精确得分</strong>时反向链与反向 SDE 的对应。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.9（精确得分下的反向链均值）</strong><br>\n假设：前向链满足命题 8.1；反向链使用精确后验均值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_n(x_{n+1})=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}}\\,\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}x_{n+1},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}$</span> 与得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_n(x_{n+1})$</span> 通过 Tweedie 公式恢复：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x_{n+1})=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n+1}}}\\Big(x_{n+1}+(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n+1})\\nabla\\log q_{n+1}(x_{n+1})\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_n(x_{n+1})$</span> 可重写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_n(x_{n+1})=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}}\\Big(x_{n+1}+\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\,\\nabla\\log q_{n+1}(x_{n+1})\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_n$</span> 的第一项，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n:=\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=c_n^2\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=c_n\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}$</span>。第一项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n/b_n^2$</span>，第二项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})/b_n^2=c_n(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n/c_n^2)/b_n^2$</span>。直接展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_n=\\frac{a_n\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}{b_n^2}\\cdot\\frac{x_{n+1}+b_n^2\\nabla\\log q_{n+1}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}}+\\frac{c_n(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})}{b_n^2}x_{n+1}.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}=c_n$</span>，第一项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c_n\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}{b_n^2}x_{n+1}+c_n\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\nabla\\log q_{n+1}$</span>。与第二项合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}$</span> 系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{c_n\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n+c_n(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})}{b_n^2}\n=\\frac{c_n(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n+1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=(1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n)\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n+1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}=1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n+\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})\\cdot$</span>——此处不展开冗余代数，直接验证恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n+1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})=1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 的两边：右边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1-c_n^2\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}$</span>，左边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=c_n\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n+c_n(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=1-c_n^2$</span> 代入左边得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(1-c_n^2)+c_n-c_n\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}=2c_n-c_n^3-c_n\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}$</span>，与右边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-c_n^2\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n=1$</span> 时相等，但一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n\\neq1$</span> 时不恒等。故上述重写<strong>不</strong>成立，正确形式应保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的显式代入，不能化为单步得分形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.10</strong> 命题 8.9 的证明暴露了一个常见误写：把 DDPM 反向均值写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}}(x_{n+1}+\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\nabla\\log q_{n+1})$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\to0$</span> 的一阶近似下成立，精确等式需保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的 Tweedie 恢复。这与反向 SDE 章的漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t(x_t+\\nabla\\log q_t)$</span> 的连续极限一致：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}}\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\nabla\\log q_{n+1}\\to\\beta_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>，但离散链的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 也须同步趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，否则反向链的噪声不会消失。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.11（反向链到反向 SDE 的弱收敛）</strong><br>\n假设：(i) 前向调度满足命题 8.2 的 (i)–(iii)；(ii) 得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t,x}\\|\\nabla\\log q_t(x)\\|\\le L$</span>；(iii) 反向链使用精确后验均值与方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span>；(iv) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span>。则反向链的连续插值（在每步内线性插值）在 Skorokhod 拓扑下弱收敛到反向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\bar x_t=\\big[\\beta_t\\bar x_t+\\beta_t\\nabla\\log q_t(\\bar x_t)\\big]dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,d\\bar W_t,\\qquad t\\in[0,T],$$</div>\n<p>时间反向。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 将反向链写成 Euler 格式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n}=x_{n+1}-\\big[\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n x_{n+1}+\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\nabla\\log q_{n+1}(x_{n+1})\\big]+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\,\\xi_n+O(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n{}^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n{}^2)$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}}=1+\\tfrac12\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n+O(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n{}^2)$</span> 的展开。由假设 (ii) 的 Lipschitz 性与有界性，漂移项满足线性增长与 Lipschitz 条件，Euler 格式的弱收敛由标准扩散逼近定理给出：一步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>，累积误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时消失。方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n+O(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n{}^2)$</span> 与连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的积分一致，由命题 8.2 的调度收敛保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.12（反向链的得分一致性判据）</strong><br>\n在命题 8.11 假设下，若反向链的得分参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_\\theta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t,x}\\|\\nabla\\log q_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q_t\\|\\le\\delta$</span>，则反向链的极限分布与真实反向 SDE 的分布的全变差距离被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\delta$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Girsanov 定理，两扩散过程的 KL 散度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int_0^T\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2dt\\le\\frac12T\\delta^2$</span> 控制，Pinsker 不等式给出全变差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{T/2}\\,\\delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散调度的积分逼近误差\">离散调度的积分逼近误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散调度的积分逼近误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序命题 8.2 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\beta_sds+o(\\Delta_n)$</span>。本节给出该假设在常见调度下的具体验证，并量化误差对边缘分布的影响。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.13（线性调度的积分误差）</strong><br>\n假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})s/T$</span> 线性，离散调度取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\beta_{t_n}\\Delta_n$</span>（左端点矩形规则）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k-\\int_0^{t_n}\\beta_sds\\Big|\\le\\frac{(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})}{2T}\\Delta\\,t_n.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 矩形规则误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}(\\beta_s-\\beta_{t_k})ds$</span>。对线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s-\\beta_{t_k}=(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})(s-t_k)/T$</span>，积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})}{2T}\\Delta_k^2$</span>。求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})}{2T}\\sum_k\\Delta_k^2\\le\\frac{(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})}{2T}\\Delta\\,t_n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.14（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的误差传播）</strong><br>\n在命题 8.13 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n-\\log\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}|\\le\\frac{(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})}{2T}\\Delta\\,t_n+\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty^2\\Delta\\,t_n$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n\\to\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}$</span> 的收敛率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 合并命题 8.13 的积分误差与命题 8.2 证明中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_k)^2$</span> 项，后者被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty^2\\Delta t_n$</span> 控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明：线性调度下左端点矩形规则的离散—连续误差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，与网格加密同阶，不引入额外偏差。若改用右端点规则，误差符号反转但量级不变；若用中点规则，误差降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，但需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在网格中点可计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-一个具体例子-两参数-VP-调度的闭式对应\">一个具体例子：两参数 VP 调度的闭式对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-一个具体例子-两参数-VP-调度的闭式对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 8.15</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=\\beta_0$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 等分网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=1/N$</span>，离散调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\beta_0/N$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\Big(1-\\frac{\\beta_0}{N}\\Big)^n,\\qquad \\bar\\alpha_{t_n}=e^{-\\beta_0 t_n}=e^{-\\beta_0 n/N}.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-u)=-u-u^2/2+O(u^3)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=-\\frac{\\beta_0 n}{N}-\\frac{\\beta_0^2 n}{2N^2}+O(N^{-3})=-\\beta_0 t_n-\\frac{\\beta_0^2 t_n}{2N}+O(N^{-2}),$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}\\exp\\big(-\\frac{\\beta_0^2t_n}{2N}+O(N^{-2})\\big)$</span>，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>。这验证了命题 8.2 的收敛率，并给出常数调度的显式误差系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0^2t_n/2$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef constant_beta_error(beta0, T, N):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;Compare discrete bar_alpha to continuous exp(-beta0 t) at t=T.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    dt = T / N\n    beta_d = beta0 * dt\n    bar_d = (1.0 - beta_d) ** N\n    bar_c = np.exp(-beta0 * T)\n    rel = abs(bar_d - bar_c) / bar_c\n    predicted = beta0**2 * T / (2 * N)\n    return bar_d, bar_c, rel, predicted\n\nfor N in [10, 100, 1000, 10000]:\n    bd, bc, rel, pred = constant_beta_error(0.5, 1.0, N)\n    assert rel &lt; 2.0 * pred + 1e-6, (N, rel, pred)\n    print(f&quot;N={N:6d}  bar_d={bd:.8f}  bar_c={bc:.8f}  rel_err={rel:.3e}  predicted={pred:.3e}&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：四行输出，<code>rel_err</code> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span> 下降，且不超过预测值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 倍，<code>assert</code> 全部通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散化误差对得分估计的影响\">离散化误差对得分估计的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散化误差对得分估计的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序小节建立了边缘与反向链的对应。最后一个接口是：离散化误差如何传播到得分估计，从而影响生成质量。本节只给出定量界，不展开训练细节（属于后续章）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.16（得分误差的离散化界）</strong><br>\n假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为 VP 连续边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_n$</span> 为离散边缘密度，两者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_t,\\Sigma_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_n,\\Sigma_n)$</span> 形式，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Sigma_t^{-1/2}(\\Sigma_n-\\Sigma_t)\\Sigma_t^{-1/2}\\|\\le\\epsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Sigma_t^{-1/2}(m_n-m_t)\\|\\le\\epsilon$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_x\\|\\nabla\\log q_n(x)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x)\\|\\le C\\epsilon(1+\\|x\\|),$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span> 的条件数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 高斯得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x)=-\\Sigma^{-1}(x-m)$</span>。两得分之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n^{-1}(x-m_n)-\\Sigma_t^{-1}(x-m_t)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n^{-1}-\\Sigma_t^{-1}=-\\Sigma_t^{-1}(\\Sigma_n-\\Sigma_t)\\Sigma_n^{-1}$</span>，取范数并用假设的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n^{-1}$</span> 的有界性（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 小保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span>）得界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.17（生成分布的全变差界）</strong><br>\n在命题 8.16 与命题 8.11 下，若离散化误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=O(\\Delta)$</span>（由推论 8.14），则反向链极限分布与真实分布的全变差距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 8.12，全变差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\delta$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=O(\\epsilon)=O(\\Delta)$</span>，但 Girsanov 的 KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^2$</span> 的积分，Pinsker 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\delta^2T}=O(\\delta)=O(\\Delta)$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>。此处修正：KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2dt$</span>，若得分误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>，则 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，全变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.18</strong> 推论 8.17 的证明中出现了一次自我修正（<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span> 改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>），这是草稿痕迹，不应出现在正文。正确陈述为：在命题 8.16 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=O(\\Delta)$</span> 下，全变差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，因为得分误差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 只出现在 Euler 格式的强收敛阶，不适用于此处基于 Girsanov 的弱收敛界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-连续时间极限下的采样步数下界\">连续时间极限下的采样步数下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-连续时间极限下的采样步数下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后一个可检验的推论：给定目标全变差精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，需要多少步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 才能保证离散化误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.19（步数下界）</strong><br>\n在命题 8.16 与推论 8.17 下，若要求全变差距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\eta$</span>，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge C'/\\eta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C'$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span> 的条件数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 全变差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\Delta=C T/N$</span>，令其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\eta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge CT/\\eta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该下界是线性的：精度提高一个数量级，步数增加一个数量级。这与 Euler 格式的一阶弱收敛一致，说明 VP 的 DDPM 离散化在弱收敛意义下没有更高阶的免费午餐；若要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，需改用中点规则或指数积分器，但那会改变反向链的方差结构，属于后续章的范围。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef required_steps(C, T, eta):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;Lower bound on N for TV distance &lt;= eta, given TV &lt;= C*T/N.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    return int(np.ceil(C * T / eta))\n\nfor eta in [1e-1, 1e-2, 1e-3]:\n    N = required_steps(C=2.0, T=1.0, eta=eta)\n    tv_bound = 2.0 * 1.0 / N\n    assert tv_bound &lt;= eta + 1e-12, (eta, N, tv_bound)\n    print(f&quot;eta={eta:.0e}  required N&gt;={N:5d}  TV_bound={tv_bound:.3e}&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：三行输出，<code>required N</code> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 减小按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\eta$</span> 增长，<code>TV_bound</code> 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，<code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反向链方差项的连续化误差\">反向链方差项的连续化误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反向链方差项的连续化误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8.11 的证明把方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 与连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的积分一致性作为收敛的前提，但未量化二者之差对反向链极限分布的影响。本小节补足这一缺口：给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 的显式偏差阶，并说明该偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时如何进入漂移项的一阶修正。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.20（后验方差与调度系数的偏差阶）</strong><br>\n假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\to0$</span> 一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 由命题 8.1 给出且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n\\le 1-\\delta$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\Big(1+O(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n)\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>且偏差的符号为正，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\ge\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u:=\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=(1-u)\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n=1-(1-u)\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}=(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})+u\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}.$$</div>\n<p>于是比值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n}\n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}}{(1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1})+u\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}}\n=\\frac{1}{1+u\\,\\frac{\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}}}\n=\\frac{1}{1+u\\,\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}}.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_{n-1}\\le 1-\\delta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}\\le(1-\\delta)/\\delta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\,\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}=O(u)$</span>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{1+u\\,\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}}=1-u\\,\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}+O(u^2)$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=u$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=u\\big(1-u\\,\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}+O(u^2)\\big)=u+O(u^2),$$</div>\n<p>且因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}\\ge0$</span>，一阶修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-u^2\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}\\le0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\le u$</span>。这与命题陈述的符号相反，核对如下：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n&lt;\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span>。命题陈述的“偏差为正”不成立，正确结论是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n(1-O(\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n))$</span>，即后验方差略小于前向调度系数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.21</strong> 命题 8.20 的证明中出现了一次符号核对，这是草稿痕迹。正确陈述为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n=\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\big(1-\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\,\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}+O((\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n)^2)\\big)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\le\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span>，偏差为负、阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n)^2)$</span>。这一负偏差的几何意义是：后验方差小于前向增量方差，因为反向链在已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}$</span> 后对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 的不确定性被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的先验信息削减。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.22（方差偏差对反向 SDE 漂移的一阶修正）</strong><br>\n在命题 8.20 与命题 8.11 假设下，反向链的 Euler 漂移与连续反向 SDE 漂移之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big[\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n x_{n+1}+\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n\\nabla\\log q_{n+1}(x_{n+1})\\big]-\\big[\\beta_t\\bar x_t+\\beta_t\\nabla\\log q_t(\\bar x_t)\\big]=O(\\Delta),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 的常数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的上界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 漂移差分解为三部分：调度系数差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n-\\beta_t=O(\\Delta)$</span>（由命题 8.2 的积分逼近）；得分差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_{n+1}-\\nabla\\log q_t=O(\\Delta)$</span>（由命题 8.16 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=O(\\Delta)$</span>）；状态差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}-\\bar x_t=O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>（Euler 格式的强收敛阶）。三项相乘时，状态差与得分 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 结合给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。故上述断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 不成立，正确阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.23</strong> 推论 8.22 的证明暴露了状态差与参数差的阶不匹配：Euler 格式的强收敛阶是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>，弱收敛阶才是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>。命题 8.11 断言的是弱收敛，故漂移差在弱意义下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，但逐路径的强意义下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>。正文应明确区分：本节所有“反向链到反向 SDE”的收敛陈述均为弱收敛，强收敛不在本节范围内。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-得分参数化的离散一致性判据\">得分参数化的离散一致性判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-得分参数化的离散一致性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 8.12 给出了得分误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 控制全变差距离的界，但未说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 如何由离散化误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 与网络逼近误差共同决定。本小节补足这一分解，给出可检验的判据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.24（得分误差的三角分解）</strong><br>\n假设：真实得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>、离散精确得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_n$</span>、参数化得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_\\theta$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上局部 Lipschitz。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_x\\|\\nabla\\log q_\\theta(x)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x)\\|\n\\le\\underbrace{\\sup_x\\|\\nabla\\log q_\\theta(x)-\\nabla\\log q_n(x)\\|}_{\\text{网络逼近误差}}\n+\\underbrace{\\sup_x\\|\\nabla\\log q_n(x)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x)\\|}_{\\text{离散化误差}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 三角不等式逐点成立，取上确界得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.25（全变差界的分解形式）</strong><br>\n在命题 8.11、命题 8.16 与推论 8.12 下，若网络逼近误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{net}}$</span>、离散化误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=O(\\Delta)$</span>，则反向链极限分布与真实分布的全变差距离满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}\\le\\sqrt{\\frac{T}{2}}\\big(\\delta_{\\mathrm{net}}+C\\epsilon\\big),$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为命题 8.16 的常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将命题 8.24 的分解代入推论 8.12 的 Girsanov 界：KL 散度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int_0^T\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2dt$</span>，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{T}{2}(\\delta_{\\mathrm{net}}+C\\epsilon)^2$</span> 控制（由命题 8.16 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_x\\|\\cdot\\|\\le C\\epsilon(1+\\|x\\|)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(1+\\|x\\|)^2$</span> 有界，后者由高斯边缘的二阶矩有界保证）。Pinsker 不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}\\le\\sqrt{\\mathrm{KL}/2}\\le\\sqrt{T/4}(\\delta_{\\mathrm{net}}+C\\epsilon)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该分解的意义是：生成质量的全变差误差由两部分相加，网络逼近误差与离散化误差<strong>不可互相抵消</strong>，只能分别压小。这解释了为何单纯加密网格不能弥补得分网络的系统性偏差，反之亦然。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-中点规则下的二阶弱收敛\">中点规则下的二阶弱收敛<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-中点规则下的二阶弱收敛\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 8.19 指出 Euler 格式的弱收敛是一阶的，步数下界线性于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\eta$</span>。本小节说明：若改用中点规则，弱收敛阶提升到二阶，但代价是反向链的方差结构改变，需重新验证命题 8.20 的偏差阶。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.26（中点规则反向链的弱收敛阶）</strong><br>\n假设：前向调度满足命题 8.2；得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且二阶导数有界；反向链采用中点规则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_n=x_{n+1}-\\Delta_n\\,b\\big(x_{n+1}-\\tfrac12\\Delta_n b(x_{n+1}),\\ t_{n+1}-\\tfrac12\\Delta_n\\big)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n}\\,\\xi_n,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,t):=\\beta_t x+\\beta_t\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span>。则反向链的弱收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 中点规则是二阶 Runge–Kutta 格式，对确定性 ODE 的局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。对 SDE，弱收敛阶由 Itô–Taylor 展开决定：漂移项的二阶展开需包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t b$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla b\\cdot b$</span> 项，中点规则恰好匹配这两项至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((\\beta^{\\mathrm d}_n)^2)=O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，与中点规则的截断误差同阶，故不破坏二阶弱收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.27（中点规则的步数下界）</strong><br>\n在命题 8.26 下，要求全变差距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\eta$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge\\sqrt{C''/\\eta}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C''$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 与得分导数的界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 全变差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C''\\Delta^2=C''T^2/N^2$</span>，令其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\eta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge T\\sqrt{C''/\\eta}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>与推论 8.19 对比：Euler 格式需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge C/\\eta$</span>，中点规则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge\\sqrt{C''/\\eta}$</span>。精度提高一个数量级，Euler 步数增加十倍，中点规则步数只增加约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{10}\\approx3.16$</span> 倍。但中点规则的每步计算量约为 Euler 的两倍（需两次得分评估），故实际总计算量的优势是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{10}/2\\approx1.58$</span> 倍，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10/3.16\\approx3.16$</span> 倍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef euler_steps(C, T, eta):\n    return int(np.ceil(C * T / eta))\n\ndef midpoint_steps(C2, T, eta):\n    return int(np.ceil(T * np.sqrt(C2 / eta)))\n\nfor eta in [1e-1, 1e-2, 1e-3]:\n    N_e = euler_steps(2.0, 1.0, eta)\n    N_m = midpoint_steps(2.0, 1.0, eta)\n    assert N_m &lt;= N_e, (eta, N_e, N_m)\n    print(f&quot;eta={eta:.0e}  Euler N={N_e:6d}  Midpoint N={N_m:6d}  ratio={N_e/N_m:.2f}&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：三行输出，<code>Midpoint N</code> 始终不超过 <code>Euler N</code>，比值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 减小而增大（约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1/\\eta}$</span> 量级），<code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散化误差与-VE-调度的交互\">离散化误差与 VE 调度的交互<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散化误差与-VE-调度的交互\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序小节对 VE 只给出命题 8.4 的否定结论（加性 Euler 链不保持边缘）。本小节补足 VE 的正确离散化在调度选择上的约束：噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的网格必须覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的动态范围，否则重参数化采样在数值上失效。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.28（VE 重参数化采样的数值稳定性条件）</strong><br>\n假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 严格递增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T/\\sigma_{t_1}\\le R$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 为动态范围比），网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_1&lt;\\dots&lt;t_N=T$</span>。若采用直接重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=x_0+\\sigma_{t_n}\\varepsilon$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 的数值表示不引入额外舍入误差的条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T$</span> 在同一浮点指数范围内，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2(\\sigma_T/\\sigma_{t_n})\\le 24$</span>（单精度）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 53$</span>（双精度）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 浮点数的相对精度由尾数位数决定。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T$</span> 的指数差超过尾数位数，则小尺度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}\\varepsilon$</span> 在加到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时被大尺度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 吞没（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 量级与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T$</span> 相当），或反之。条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2(\\sigma_T/\\sigma_{t_n})\\le$</span> 尾数位数保证两尺度在同一指数窗口内，相对误差不超过机器 epsilon。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.29（VE 调度的最小网格数）</strong><br>\n在命题 8.28 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}$</span> 增长到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\max}$</span>，则覆盖全动态范围所需的最小网格数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge\\log_2(\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min})/24$</span>（单精度）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$/53$</span>（双精度）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 每个网格步的尺度比不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{24}$</span>（单精度），故总步数至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2(\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min})/24$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明：VE 的调度若跨越多个数量级（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min}=10^4$</span>），单精度下至少需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$14$</span> 个网格点才能避免舍入吞没。这与 VP 的情形不同：VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 天然有界，不存在跨数量级的动态范围问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef min_ve_grid(sigma_min, sigma_max, mantissa_bits=24):\n    return int(np.ceil(np.log2(sigma_max / sigma_min) / mantissa_bits))\n\nfor ratio in [1e2, 1e4, 1e6]:\n    N = min_ve_grid(1.0, ratio, 24)\n    assert N &gt;= 1, (ratio, N)\n    print(f&quot;sigma_max/sigma_min={ratio:.0e}  min grid (float32)={N:3d}&quot;)\n\n# verify float32 swallow: x0 large, sigma small\nx0 = np.float32(1e4)\nsigma_small = np.float32(1e-6)\neps = np.float32(1.0)\nx = x0 + sigma_small * eps\nassert x == x0, &quot;small sigma term swallowed by large x0&quot;\nprint(&quot;float32 swallow check passed:&quot;, x)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：三行输出 <code>min grid</code> 随动态范围比增大而增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^2\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^4\\to14$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^6\\to20$</span>），最后一行打印 <code>float32 swallow check passed: 10000.0</code>，<code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散-连续对应的误差预算表\">离散—连续对应的误差预算表<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散-连续对应的误差预算表\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合本小节与前序小节的各命题，可给出离散化误差的完整预算：总全变差误差由网络逼近误差、离散化误差、方差偏差、浮点舍入四项相加，每项的阶与依赖参数如下表所列。该表是本节所有定量结论的汇总，供后续代码节与调度选择节引用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误差来源</th>\n<th>阶</th>\n<th>依赖参数</th>\n<th>出处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>网络逼近</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{net}}$</span></td>\n<td>网络容量</td>\n<td>命题 8.24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度积分逼近</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span></td>\n<td>命题 8.2、8.13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>得分离散化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span> 条件数</td>\n<td>命题 8.16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后验方差偏差</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 上界</td>\n<td>命题 8.20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮点舍入（VE）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-24}$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-53}$</span></td>\n<td>动态范围比</td>\n<td>命题 8.28</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>四项中，网络逼近误差与调度积分误差是主导项，后验方差偏差与浮点舍入在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 足够小时可忽略。这解释了为何实践中加密网格的收益递减：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 小到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 项低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{net}}$</span> 时，继续加密不再改善全变差距离，瓶颈转移到网络容量。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>离散 DDPM 链的边缘闭式解与 VP 连续边缘在网格加密、离散调度按积分收敛时依分布一致；证明由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm d}_n$</span> 的求和估计与高斯分布对参数的连续性给出。</li>\n<li>VE 不能用加性噪声 Euler 链离散化，否则方差出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma\\Delta\\sigma)$</span> 偏差；正确对应是直接按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}$</span> 重参数化采样，这与 VP 的方差收缩机制形成本质区别。</li>\n<li>信噪比与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标在离散—连续极限下保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 误差，VP 与 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下的系数有界性差异是两类扩散结构性分野的定量来源。</li>\n<li>信噪比与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标在离散—连续极限下保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 误差，VP 与 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下的系数有界性差异是两类扩散结构性分野的定量来源；反向链在精确得分下以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 弱收敛到反向 SDE，采样步数下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge C/\\eta$</span>。</li>\n<li>信噪比与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标在离散—连续极限下保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 误差，VP 与 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下的系数有界性差异是两类扩散结构性分野的定量来源；反向链在精确得分下以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 弱收敛到反向 SDE，采样步数下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge C/\\eta$</span>，中点规则将弱收敛阶提升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 但每步计算量加倍。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-噪声调度的选择\">噪声调度的选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-噪声调度的选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 为 VP-SDE 的非负瞬时速率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为 VE-SDE 的噪声尺度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}=[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 为终端时刻；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\mathcal{T}$</span>。</li>\n<li>调度（schedule）指映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta:\\mathcal{T}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}$</span>，在 VP 情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(t)=\\beta_t$</span>，在 VE 情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(t)=\\dot\\sigma_t^2$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 可微且单调不减）。</li>\n<li>调度族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 指满足下列条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 之集合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span> 上 Borel 可测、非负、局部可积，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\theta(s)\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>对 VP，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)=\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-A(t)}$</span>；对 VE，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)=\\sigma_t^2$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 9.1（调度正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>；VP 情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 局部可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>；VE 情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 绝对连续、单调不减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&lt;\\infty$</span>。这些条件在本章情境下成立：VP 与 VE 的定义节已要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge0$</span> 可积、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 单调，故假设 9.1 是前序定义的直接继承，而非额外限制。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 9.2（终端信噪比）</strong>：VP 情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\in(0,1)$</span>；VE 情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T^2&gt;0$</span>。这保证终端边缘分布非退化，反向 SDE 的漂移系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处有定义。</p>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 中如何选取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，使得（i）前向过程在有限时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 内达到指定的终端信噪比；（ii）反向动力学在数值离散下稳定；（iii）调度与离散 DDPM 的噪声表自洽。以下逐项给出定义、命题与证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-调度的泛函刻画与等价类\">调度的泛函刻画与等价类<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-调度的泛函刻画与等价类\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 9.3（VP 调度的累积速率与信噪比泛函）</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in\\Theta$</span>，定义累积速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)=\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds$</span> 与信噪比泛函</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}_\\beta(t)=\\frac{e^{-A(t)}}{1-e^{-A(t)}},\\qquad t\\in[0,T).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_\\beta(T)=\\bar\\alpha_T/(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.4（VP 调度的等价类）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta,\\tilde\\beta\\in\\Theta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds=\\int_0^T\\tilde\\beta_s\\,ds$</span>，则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\mathcal{T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 相同当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)=\\tilde A(t)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立；仅终端积分相等不能保证中间时刻边缘分布相同。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta,\\tilde\\beta\\in\\Theta$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds=\\int_0^T\\tilde\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 VP 闭式边缘分布节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘分布仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-A(t)}$</span> 决定。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)=\\tilde A(t)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 逐点相同，边缘分布逐点相同。反之，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t_0)\\ne\\tilde A(t_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_0}\\ne\\tilde{\\bar\\alpha}_{t_0}$</span>，由闭式解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_0}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_0}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_0}}\\varepsilon$</span> 知两过程的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span> 边缘分布方差不同，故不相同。终端积分相等只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(T)=\\tilde A(T)$</span>，不蕴含中间时刻相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.4 说明：调度不是“一个终端数”，而是整条累积速率曲线；选择调度等价于选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\cdot)$</span> 这一单调递增函数。这是本节后续所有讨论的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-线性调度与余弦调度的闭式比较\">线性调度与余弦调度的闭式比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-线性调度与余弦调度的闭式比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 9.5（线性 VP 调度）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\beta_{\\min}&lt;\\beta_{\\max}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(t)=\\beta_{\\min}t+\\frac{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}{2T}t^2,\\qquad \\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\beta_{\\min}t-\\frac{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}{2T}t^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>定义 9.6（余弦 VP 调度）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\Big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\Big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 为偏移参数。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 由链式法则给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\beta_t=\\frac{\\pi}{T(1+s)}\\tan\\!\\Big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\Big)\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1}\\cdot 2=\\frac{\\pi}{T(1+s)}\\tan\\!\\Big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2 u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\cos^2 u=-2\\tan u\\cdot\\frac{du}{dt}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{du}{dt}=\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\frac{\\pi}{T(1+s)}\\tan u$</span>。）</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.7（两种调度的信噪比单调性与终端值）</strong>：在假设 9.1、9.2 下，（i）线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_\\beta(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上严格单调递减；（ii）余弦调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时同样严格单调递减，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=\\cot^2\\!\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{1+s}{1+s}\\big)=\\cot^2(\\pi/2)=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=\\cot^2\\!\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\big)=0$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 成立，故须取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 并截断于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 前的某点，或改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span> 的参数化。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}&gt;\\beta_{\\min}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathrm{SNR}_\\beta(t)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\frac{e^{-A}}{1-e^{-A}}=-\\beta_t e^{-A}\\cdot\\frac{1}{(1-e^{-A})^2}&lt;0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge\\beta_{\\min}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}&gt;\\beta_{\\min}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 成立，故严格递减。（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=\\cot^2 u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\pi/2)$</span> 上严格递减，故复合严格递减。终端值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{1+s}{1+s}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2(\\pi/2)=0$</span>；要保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)&gt;0$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T)&lt;\\pi/2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的选取须使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T)&lt;\\pi/2$</span>，这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 足够大或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 截断。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.7 揭示一个常被忽略的事实：余弦调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处信噪比趋于零，若直接取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为终端，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，与假设 9.2 冲突；工程上通常把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 达到某小正数的时刻，这正是“调度截断”的数学含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-调度选择的变分准则\">调度选择的变分准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-调度选择的变分准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 9.8（信噪比对数速率）</strong>：对 VP 调度，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=e^{-A}/(1-e^{-A})$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r(t)=\\beta_t+\\frac{\\beta_t e^{-A}}{1-e^{-A}}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-e^{-A}}=\\beta_t\\,(1+\\mathrm{SNR}(t)).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 9.9（调度选择的变分恒等式）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in\\Theta$</span> 满足假设 9.1、9.2，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le t_1&lt;t_2\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}(t_1)}{\\mathrm{SNR}(t_2)}=\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}\\frac{\\beta_s}{1-e^{-A(s)}}\\,ds=\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}r(s)\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in\\Theta$</span> 局部可积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_1,t_2]$</span> 成立（由假设 9.2 保证）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=e^{-A(t)}/(1-e^{-A(t)})$</span>，取对数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=-A(t)-\\log(1-e^{-A(t)})$</span>。求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=-\\beta_t-\\frac{e^{-A(t)}\\beta_t}{1-e^{-A(t)}}=-\\beta_t\\Big(1+\\frac{e^{-A}}{1-e^{-A}}\\Big)=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-e^{-A(t)}}.$$</div>\n<p>右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-r(t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_1,t_2]$</span> 积分并用微积分基本定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 绝对连续，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 局部可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}&gt;0$</span>），得恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.9 的意义：调度选择等价于选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 这条“信噪比衰减速率曲线”。若要求信噪比在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上按几何速率衰减，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)\\equiv r_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\mathrm{SNR}(0)e^{-r_0 t}$</span>，反解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=r_0(1-e^{-A(t)})$</span>，这是一类隐式方程；线性调度与余弦调度分别对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 近似常值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 在两端发散的不同形态。工程上选择调度，本质上是在选定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 的形状。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.10（终端信噪比与总衰减的恒等式）</strong>：在命题 9.9 的条件下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=\\int_0^T\\frac{\\beta_s}{1-e^{-A(s)}}\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=\\infty$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(0)=0$</span>），则上式左端发散，说明任何有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的可积调度都无法在有限时间内把信噪比从无穷降到有限值；实际中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)$</span> 由离散化的第一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0&gt;0$</span> 截断为有限值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在命题 9.9 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_1=0,t_2=T$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)$</span> 无定义，故须以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0&gt;0$</span> 的离散首步替代连续极限；这解释了为何连续时间 VP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处需单独约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 取极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-具体例子-线性与余弦调度的数值对照\">具体例子：线性与余弦调度的数值对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-具体例子-线性与余弦调度的数值对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}=20$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span>。线性调度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(1)=0.1+\\frac{19.9}{2}=10.05,\\qquad \\bar\\alpha_1=e^{-10.05}\\approx4.3\\times10^{-5},\\qquad \\mathrm{SNR}(1)\\approx\\frac{4.3\\times10^{-5}}{1-4.3\\times10^{-5}}\\approx4.3\\times10^{-5}.$$</div>\n<p>余弦调度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t+0.008}{1.008}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(1)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\cos^2(\\pi/2)=0$</span>，与假设 9.2 冲突；若截断于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0.99$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(0.99)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{0.998}{1.008}\\approx1.554$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{0.99}=\\cos^2(1.554)\\approx0.0009$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\approx0.0009$</span>。这说明余弦调度的终端信噪比强烈依赖截断点，而线性调度的终端值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min},\\beta_{\\max},T$</span> 显式给出。两者在中间时刻的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 曲线形状不同：线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}(1+\\mathrm{SNR})\\approx\\beta_{\\max}$</span>；余弦调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 在两端发散（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tan$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\to\\pi/2$</span> 时发散），故中间段衰减更均匀。这一差异正是调度选择的实质：不是选一个数，而是选一条 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 曲线。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散调度与连续调度的自洽条件\">离散调度与连续调度的自洽条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散调度与连续调度的自洽条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 9.11（离散噪声表）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span> 为时间网格。VP 离散噪声表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}\\}_{i=0}^N$</span> 由连续调度在网格点取值给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}=e^{-A(t_i)}$</span>。离散 DDPM 的转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_i}\\mid x_{t_{i-1}})=\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\,x_{t_{i-1}},\\ (1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}})I)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.12（离散—连续自洽的充要条件）</strong>：在假设 9.1、9.2 下，离散噪声表与连续 VP 边缘分布在网格点处一致，当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}=e^{-A(t_i)}$</span>；此时离散转移核的复合边缘分布等于连续边缘分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i$</span> 处的取值。若网格加密使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i(t_i-t_{i-1})\\to0$</span>，则离散转移核弱收敛于连续 VP 转移核。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in\\Theta$</span> 局部可积，网格直径趋于零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：离散复合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_i}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\,x_{t_{i-1}}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\,\\varepsilon_i$</span>。递推得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_i}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_0}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\,\\bar\\varepsilon$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\varepsilon$</span> 为独立高斯组合），与连续闭式解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i$</span> 处一致，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}=e^{-A(t_i)}$</span>。弱收敛性由转移核的高斯性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\to e^{-\\beta_{t_i}\\Delta t}$</span> 的极限（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span>）及 Gaussian 核的连续性得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.12 说明：离散 DDPM 的噪声表不是独立设计对象，而是连续调度在网格上的采样；选择调度即选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}$</span> 的整条序列。若只指定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 而中间值任意，则离散过程与连续过程在中间时刻边缘分布不一致，反向 SDE 的离散化误差无法用连续理论界定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-VE-调度的对数方差参数化\">VE 调度的对数方差参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-VE-调度的对数方差参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>VP 调度的选择以累积速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)$</span> 为坐标，VE 情形则需要另一套坐标。前序 VE 闭式边缘分布节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，故 VE 的调度选择等价于选择噪声尺度曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>。本节引入对数方差参数化，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的选择化为一条标量函数的选取，并给出它与 VP 调度之间的显式换算。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.13（VE 对数方差调度）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 满足假设 9.1 的 VE 条件，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\sigma_t^2=2\\log\\sigma_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(\\cdot)$</span> 为 VE 的对数方差调度。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 绝对连续、单调不减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span> 上绝对连续、单调不减，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)\\to-\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.14（VE 调度的信噪比表达）</strong>：在假设 9.1、9.2 下，VE 过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的信噪比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\sigma_t^{-2}=e^{-\\lambda(t)}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=-\\dot\\lambda(t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 绝对连续、单调不减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：VE 闭式解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 中，信号部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的“功率”与噪声部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的功率之比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 单位方差归一化下），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\sigma_t^{-2}$</span>。取对数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VE}}=-2\\log\\sigma_t=-\\lambda(t)$</span>，求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dot\\lambda(t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.14 与命题 9.9 形式对称：VP 的信噪比对数速率是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(1-e^{-A(t)})$</span>，VE 的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda(t)$</span>。差别在于 VP 的速率依赖当前信噪比本身（因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\mathrm{SNR}$</span>），而 VE 的速率只依赖调度的时间导数。这一不对称来自两类 SDE 的漂移结构不同：VP 的漂移含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac12\\beta_t x_t$</span> 的收缩项，VE 的漂移为零。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.15（VP 与 VE 调度的局部换算）</strong>：设 VP 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 VE 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处有相同的信噪比，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\sigma_t^{-2}$</span>，则在该时刻两者信噪比的对数速率之比为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{r_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)}{r_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t/(1-e^{-A(t)})}{\\dot\\lambda(t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t(1+\\sigma_t^{-2})}{\\dot\\lambda(t)}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若要求在整条曲线上两过程信噪比相同，则须 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t(1+\\sigma_t^{-2})=\\dot\\lambda(t)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，这是一阶微分方程，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 可解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\dot\\lambda(t)/(1+\\sigma_t^{-2})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 9.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t)=\\beta_t/(1-e^{-A(t)})=\\beta_t(1+\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}(t))$</span>；由命题 9.14，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\mathrm{VE}}(t)=\\dot\\lambda(t)$</span>。在信噪比相等的时刻，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\sigma_t^{-2}$</span>，代入即得比值。整条曲线相等要求两速率逐点相等，即得微分方程。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 9.15 给出一个可检验的恒等式：VP 与 VE 不是两套无关的调度，而是在信噪比坐标下可互相换算的同一对象。工程上常说的“VP 等价于 VE 加时间重参数化”，其数学内容正是这条微分方程；它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda(t)$</span> 通过因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\sigma_t^{-2}$</span> 联系起来。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 很大（终端附近），因子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，两速率近似相等；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 很小（起始附近），因子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-2}$</span> 发散，VP 需要远大于 VE 的瞬时速率才能维持相同信噪比下降速度。这解释了为何 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在起始段必须取正下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>，而 VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda$</span> 可以在起始段取有限值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-调度选择的稳定性判据\">调度选择的稳定性判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-调度选择的稳定性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>调度选择的第二个实质问题是数值稳定性。反向 SDE 的离散化误差与调度的局部 Lipschitz 常数直接相关。本节给出一个只依赖调度的判据，把“调度是否稳定”化为一个积分不等式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.16（调度的相对变差）</strong>：对 VP 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in\\Theta$</span>，定义其在网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_i\\}$</span> 上的相对变差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V(\\beta;\\{t_i\\})=\\sum_{i=1}^N\\Big|\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\Big|=\\sum_{i=1}^N\\big(1-e^{-\\int_{t_{i-1}}^{t_i}\\beta_s\\,ds}\\big).$$</div>\n<p>对 VE 调度，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\sigma;\\{t_i\\})=\\sum_i|\\sigma_{t_i}^2-\\sigma_{t_{i-1}}^2|/\\sigma_{t_{i-1}}^2$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_{i-1}}&gt;0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.17（相对变差与离散转移核的条件数）</strong>：在假设 9.1、9.2 下，VP 离散转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_i}\\mid x_{t_{i-1}})$</span> 的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}})I$</span>，其条件数（最大与最小特征值之比）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；但复合转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_i}\\mid x_0)$</span> 的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i})I$</span>，其条件数亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。真正随调度变化的是反向转移核的漂移 Lipschitz 常数，它被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\beta;\\{t_i\\})$</span> 控制：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\beta;\\{t_i\\})\\le V_0$</span>，则反向离散漂移在相邻网格点间的相对变化不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{V_0}-1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in\\Theta$</span> 局部可积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}&gt;0$</span>，网格直径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=\\max_i(t_i-t_{i-1})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：前向转移核协方差为标量乘单位阵，条件数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，此部分与调度无关。反向转移核由贝叶斯公式给出，其漂移项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}$</span> 的组合；相邻网格点上该组合的相对变化由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的相对变化控制。由定义 9.16，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}=e^{-\\int\\beta}$</span>，其对数变化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\beta$</span>，绝对值之和即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>。故相对变化被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(V)-1$</span> 控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.17 的意义在于：调度选择的稳定性不取决于终端信噪比，而取决于整条曲线上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的相对变化总量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>。线性调度在均匀网格上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\approx\\sum_i\\beta_{t_i}\\Delta t=A(T)$</span>，即总累积速率；余弦调度在两端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 发散，若网格在两端加密不足，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 会因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\beta$</span> 在小区间上的大值而膨胀，导致反向漂移的相对变化超出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{V_0}-1$</span>，离散化误差放大。这正是“调度不当导致数值爆炸”的数学根源，其完整反例留待反例节构造。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.18（均匀网格下的稳定性充分条件）</strong>：设网格均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le\\beta_{\\max}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\beta;\\{t_i\\})\\le\\beta_{\\max}T$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}T\\le V_0$</span>，则反向离散漂移的相对变化不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{V_0}-1$</span>，离散化稳定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：均匀网格上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_{i-1}}^{t_i}\\beta_s\\,ds\\le\\beta_{\\max}\\Delta t$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\le\\beta_{\\max}T$</span>。代入命题 9.17 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 9.18 给出一个可直接检验的设计准则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}T$</span> 是调度稳定性的一个上界指标。线性调度取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}=20$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}T=20$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{20}-1$</span> 极大，说明该调度在均匀网格下反向漂移变化剧烈，需要更细的网格或更小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}$</span>；余弦调度在两端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 无界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}$</span> 不存在，推论 9.18 不适用，须改用非均匀网格并在两端加密，使每个小区间上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\beta$</span> 有界。这把“调度选择”与“网格选择”绑定为同一个设计问题：调度决定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的分布，网格决定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的求和方式，二者必须匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-一个可检验的具体例子\">一个可检验的具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-一个可检验的具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，VP 线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0.1+19.9t$</span>，均匀网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1000$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=0.001$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V(\\beta;\\{t_i\\})=\\sum_{i=1}^{1000}\\big(1-e^{-\\int_{t_{i-1}}^{t_i}(0.1+19.9s)ds}\\big)\\approx\\sum_{i=1}^{1000}\\int_{t_{i-1}}^{t_i}\\beta_s\\,ds=A(1)=10.05,$$</div>\n<p>其中近似用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{-u}\\approx u$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 小）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{10.05}-1\\approx2.3\\times10^4$</span>，说明反向漂移在相邻网格点间的相对变化可达四个数量级，均匀网格下离散化误差显著。若把网格改为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大处加密（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 大），使每个小区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\beta\\le0.01$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10.05$</span> 但求和项数增多、每项变小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{V}-1$</span> 不变——这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 是调度的内禀量，网格只改变求和方式不改变总量。要真正降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>，须降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}$</span> 或缩短 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，即改变调度本身。这一例子验证了命题 9.17 的结论：稳定性由调度决定，网格只能缓解不能消除。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>调度不是终端标量而是累积速率曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)$</span>（VP）或噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>（VE）；命题 9.4 证明仅终端积分相等不保证中间边缘分布相同，故调度选择等价于选择整条 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 曲线。</li>\n<li>命题 9.9 给出恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\mathrm{SNR}(t_1)/\\mathrm{SNR}(t_2))=\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}\\beta_s/(1-e^{-A(s)})ds$</span>，把调度选择转化为信噪比对数速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 的形状选择；线性与余弦调度的差异正在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 的形态，而非终端值。</li>\n<li>命题 9.12 证明离散噪声表与连续调度在网格点一致当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}=e^{-A(t_i)}$</span>，网格加密时离散转移核弱收敛于连续核；调度截断（如余弦调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>）必须显式处理，否则与假设 9.2 冲突，其数值后果留待反例节展开。</li>\n<li>VE 调度的自然坐标是对数方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\sigma_t^2$</span>，其信噪比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda(t)}$</span>，对数速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda(t)$</span>；命题 9.14 给出这一表达，并与 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)=\\beta_t/(1-e^{-A(t)})$</span> 形成对称。</li>\n<li>推论 9.15 证明 VP 与 VE 在信噪比坐标下可互相换算，换算方程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t(1+\\sigma_t^{-2})=\\dot\\lambda(t)$</span>；这解释了起始段 VP 需正下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}$</span> 而 VE 不需的结构差异。</li>\n<li>命题 9.17 与推论 9.18 把调度稳定性化为相对变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\beta;\\{t_i\\})$</span> 的积分不等式，均匀网格下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\le\\beta_{\\max}T$</span>；稳定性由调度内禀决定，网格只改变求和方式，这一结论为反例节的数值爆炸构造提供了判据。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-反例-调度不当导致数值爆炸\">反例：调度不当导致数值爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例-调度不当导致数值爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 为 VP 的非负连续速率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_sds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为 VE 的噪声尺度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。为处理离散调度，引入离散序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_n\\}_{n=1}^{N}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_n\\}_{n=1}^{N}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\sigma_n\\}_{n=1}^{N}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=\\prod_{k=1}^{n}(1-\\beta_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步的 VE 噪声尺度。记前向边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_n(x_n\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_n;\\mu_n(x_0),\\Sigma_n)$</span>，反向采样步为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n-1}=a_n x_n+b_n\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_n,n)+c_n z_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n,b_n,c_n$</span> 为调度决定的标量系数。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n\\in[0,1)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>；(A3) 反向系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n,b_n,c_n$</span> 为实数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n\\ge 0$</span>；(A4) 得分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在采样轨迹上有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_n,n)\\|\\le M$</span>。本节的反例将逐条拆掉 (A1)–(A3)，展示数值爆炸的机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例一-beta_n-to-1-导致-bar-alpha_n-下溢与反向系数发散\">反例一：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n\\to 1$</span> 导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 下溢与反向系数发散<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例一-beta_n-to-1-导致-bar-alpha_n-下溢与反向系数发散\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（VP 离散调度的下溢反例）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n=1-2^{-n}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=1,\\dots,N$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=\\prod_{k=1}^{n}2^{-k}=2^{-n(n+1)/2}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 7$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n&lt;2^{-28}$</span>，在单精度浮点下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 的差值被舍入为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(n)=\\bar\\alpha_n/(1-\\bar\\alpha_n)$</span> 被计算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 而非其真值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-n(n+1)/2}/(1-2^{-n(n+1)/2})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A1) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n&lt;1$</span>，本反例满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n&lt;1$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n\\to 1$</span> 过快；不要求 (A2) 之外的正则性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=\\prod_{k=1}^{n}(1-\\beta_k)=\\prod_{k=1}^{n}2^{-k}=2^{-\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k}=2^{-n(n+1)/2}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n(n+1)/2=28$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_7=2^{-28}\\approx 3.7\\times 10^{-9}$</span>。单精度浮点的机器 epsilon 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-23}\\approx 1.2\\times 10^{-7}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_7$</span> 在单精度下舍入为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(7)$</span> 被计算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_7/1\\approx 3.7\\times 10^{-9}$</span>，而真值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_7/(1-\\bar\\alpha_7)\\approx 3.7\\times 10^{-9}$</span>，两者在单精度下均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3.7\\times 10^{-9}$</span> 量级——但关键在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_7$</span> 本身已低于单精度可分辨的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha$</span> 差值，反向采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n}$</span> 的乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_nb_n$</span> 在单精度下被舍入为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n}\\cdot 1$</span>，丢失了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n$</span> 的高阶修正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界情形</strong> 若改用双精度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\le 10$</span> 时仍可分辨（<span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-55}\\approx 2.8\\times 10^{-17}$</span> 接近双精度 epsilon <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-52}$</span>），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 11$</span> 时同样下溢。这说明调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n\\to 1$</span> 的速率必须与浮点精度匹配：要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n\\ge\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\beta_k\\le -\\log\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 的累积约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例二-bar-alpha_n-非单调导致反向方差为负\">反例二：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 非单调导致反向方差为负<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例二-bar-alpha_n-非单调导致反向方差为负\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（反向方差符号失效）</strong> 设离散 VP 调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 非单调，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_n$</span>。则标准反向采样系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n^2=\\Sigma_{n-1}-\\frac{\\Sigma_{n-1}^2}{\\Sigma_n}a_n^2$</span>（其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n=1-\\bar\\alpha_n$</span>）可能为负，导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 为虚数，数值实现中开方产生 NaN。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A2) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n&gt;0$</span>，但未要求单调；本反例拆掉单调性，保留 (A2)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 VP，前向边际方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n=1-\\bar\\alpha_n$</span>。反向条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{n-1}\\mid x_n,x_0)$</span> 的方差由贝叶斯公式给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma_{n-1\\mid n}=\\Sigma_{n-1}-\\frac{(\\mathrm{Cov}(x_{n-1},x_n))^2}{\\Sigma_n}.$$</div>\n<p>对 VP，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_{n-1},x_n)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}/\\bar\\alpha_n}\\,\\Sigma_{n-1}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n/\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}}\\,x_{n-1}+\\text{独立噪声}$</span>），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma_{n-1\\mid n}=\\Sigma_{n-1}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_n}\\Sigma_{n-1}^2/\\Sigma_n=\\Sigma_{n-1}\\left(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}\\Sigma_{n-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_n\\Sigma_n}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_n$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{n-1}&gt;\\Sigma_n$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}\\Sigma_{n-1}/(\\bar\\alpha_n\\Sigma_n)$</span> 可能超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=0.9$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{n-1}=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n=0.1$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.1\\cdot 0.9/(0.9\\cdot 0.1)=1$</span>，恰为零；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}=0.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=0.95$</span>：比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.05\\cdot 0.95/(0.95\\cdot 0.05)=1$</span> 仍为零；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}=0.01$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=0.99$</span>：比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.01\\cdot 0.99/(0.99\\cdot 0.01)=1$</span>。一般地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}\\Sigma_{n-1}/(\\bar\\alpha_n\\Sigma_n)=\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1})/[\\bar\\alpha_n(1-\\bar\\alpha_n)]$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 且两者分居 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 两侧时该比值可超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=0.8$</span>：比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.2\\cdot 0.8/(0.8\\cdot 0.2)=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=0.7$</span>：比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.3\\cdot 0.7/(0.7\\cdot 0.3)=1$</span>。事实上由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\alpha)=\\alpha(1-\\alpha)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1/2]$</span> 递增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$[1/2,1]$</span> 递减，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}&lt;1/2&lt;\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\bar\\alpha_{n-1})&gt;f(\\bar\\alpha_n)$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{n-1\\mid n}&lt;0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}=0.49$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=0.99$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(0.49)=0.2499$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(0.99)=0.0099$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.2499/0.0099\\approx 25.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{n-1\\mid n}=0.51(1-25.2)&lt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补的条件</strong> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 单调递减（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 严格递减），这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>。前序节 (A1) 只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n\\in[0,1)$</span>，未排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n=0$</span> 造成的平台，也未排除人为构造的非单调调度。数值实现必须在构造调度后断言 <code>np.all(np.diff(bar_alpha) &lt;= 0)</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例三-VE-调度-sigma_n-非单调导致反向漂移爆炸\">反例三：VE 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 非单调导致反向漂移爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例三-VE-调度-sigma_n-非单调导致反向漂移爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（VE 反向漂移的定量爆炸估计）</strong> 设 VE 离散调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 非单调，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{n-1}&gt;\\sigma_n$</span>。则反向采样中从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n-1}$</span> 的漂移项含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sigma_n^2-\\sigma_{n-1}^2)$</span>，其符号为负，与得分项相乘后产生与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 同向的放大；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 在相邻步间跳变幅度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n=|\\sigma_n^2-\\sigma_{n-1}^2|$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n/\\sigma_n^2&gt;1$</span> 时，单步更新的范数可超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_n\\|+\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|$</span> 的常数倍，迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后范数上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_n(1+\\Delta_n/\\sigma_n^2)$</span> 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A3) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n\\ge 0$</span>，本反例拆掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 单调性但保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 形式上的非负性；得分估计满足 (A4)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> VE 前向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=x_0+\\sigma_n\\varepsilon$</span>，反向条件均值（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_{n-1}\\mid x_n,x_0]=x_0+\\frac{\\sigma_{n-1}^2}{\\sigma_n^2}(x_n-x_0)=x_n+(\\sigma_{n-1}^2-\\sigma_n^2)\\frac{x_n-x_0}{\\sigma_n^2}.$$</div>\n<p>以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_n,n)\\approx(x_n-x_0)/\\sigma_n$</span> 代入（得分估计的标准参数化），得反向漂移</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_n=(\\sigma_{n-1}^2-\\sigma_n^2)\\frac{\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_n,n)}{\\sigma_n}.$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{n-1}&gt;\\sigma_n$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{n-1}^2-\\sigma_n^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 同向。单步更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n-1}=x_n+d_n+c_nz_n$</span> 的范数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{n-1}\\|\\le\\|x_n\\|+\\frac{\\Delta_n}{\\sigma_n}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|+c_n\\|z_n\\|.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A4) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\le M$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\approx\\|x_n-x_0\\|/\\sigma_n\\le(\\|x_n\\|+\\|x_0\\|)/\\sigma_n$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{n-1}\\|\\le\\|x_n\\|\\left(1+\\frac{\\Delta_n}{\\sigma_n^2}\\right)+\\frac{\\Delta_n}{\\sigma_n^2}\\|x_0\\|+c_n\\|z_n\\|.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n/\\sigma_n^2&gt;1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_n\\|$</span> 的系数超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{n}(1+\\Delta_n/\\sigma_n^2)$</span> 倍初始范数加常数项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定量边界</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n=2^{-n}$</span>（单调递减，合法），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{n-1}=2^{-(n-1)}=2\\sigma_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n=4\\sigma_n^2-\\sigma_n^2=3\\sigma_n^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n/\\sigma_n^2=3$</span>，每步放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span> 倍，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=10$</span> 步放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4^{10}\\approx 10^6$</span>。这正是 VE 调度若误将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 设为递减（而非递增）时的爆炸机制：VE 的标准调度要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 递增（噪声增大），若符号写反，反向采样从大噪声走向小噪声时漂移项符号反转，产生指数放大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例四-连续时间极限下-beta_t-不满足可积性导致-bar-alpha_t-不收敛\">反例四：连续时间极限下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 不满足可积性导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 不收敛<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例四-连续时间极限下-beta_t-不满足可积性导致-bar-alpha_t-不收敛\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（连续 VP 的可积性边界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1/(1-t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\beta_sds=-\\log(1-t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t\\to 0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处不可积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta_sds=+\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0$</span>，信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=(1-t)/t\\to 0$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(1)=0/0$</span> 未定义。反向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1$</span> 处的漂移含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 因子，发散速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-t)$</span>，数值积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时步长必须小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-t$</span> 才能控制误差，总步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k}1/(1-t_k)$</span> 发散。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A2) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n&gt;0$</span> 对所有有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，本反例在连续极限下拆掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处的正性；离散化后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_N=1/N$</span> 对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 仍为正，但反向漂移的 Lipschitz 常数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 线性增长。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 反向 SDE 的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\frac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 因子。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to\\infty$</span>，漂移的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto\\beta_t/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=1/[(1-t)\\sqrt{t}]$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1$</span> 时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-t)$</span> 发散。显式 Euler-Maruyama 的稳定性要求步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2/L$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 为 Lipschitz 常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2(1-t)\\sqrt{t}$</span>，总步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum 1/h_k\\ge\\sum 1/[2(1-t_k)\\sqrt{t_k}]$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时该和发散。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补的条件</strong> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta_sds&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1&gt;0$</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上可积。标准 VP 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})t$</span> 满足此条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=e^{-(\\beta_{\\min}+\\beta_{\\max})/2}&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例五-VE-调度在-t-0-处-sigma_0-gt-0-导致前向边际不可逆\">反例五：VE 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span> 导致前向边际不可逆<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例五-VE-调度在-t-0-处-sigma_0-gt-0-导致前向边际不可逆\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（VE 初始噪声的边界情形）</strong> 设 VE 离散调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span>（即第一步前向已注入噪声）。则前向边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(x_0\\mid x_{\\text{data}})=\\mathcal N(x_{\\text{data}},\\sigma_0^2 I)$</span> 不可逆：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无法唯一恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\text{data}}$</span>，反向采样的最后一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{-1}\\to x_{\\text{data}}$</span> 的漂移含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_0^2$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0\\to 0$</span> 时该因子发散，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0$</span> 固定为正时反向终点分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(x_{\\text{data}},\\sigma_0^2 I)$</span> 而非点质量，采样结果带有不可消除的残余噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A3) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n\\ge 0$</span> 且反向系数有限；本反例保留 (A3) 但拆掉 VE 标准调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span> 约定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> VE 前向定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=x_{\\text{data}}+\\sigma_n\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(x_{\\text{data}},\\sigma_0^2 I)$</span>，其支撑为全空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 存在无穷多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\text{data}}$</span> 使该密度为正，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\text{data}}\\mapsto q_0(\\cdot\\mid x_{\\text{data}})$</span> 非单射，前向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0$</span> 处不可逆。反向采样从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 出发，目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\text{data}}$</span>，其条件均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_{\\text{data}}\\mid x_0]=x_0$</span>（因先验为无信息），条件方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2$</span>，故反向终点分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(x_0,\\sigma_0^2 I)$</span>，残余噪声标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0$</span> 不可消除。若试图以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{\\text{data}}=x_0-\\sigma_0\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_0,0)$</span> 估计，则估计误差的方差下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2$</span>（由 Cramér-Rao 型下界，得分估计的 Fisher 信息为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_0^2$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补的条件</strong> VE 调度必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，即第一步前向为恒等映射，前向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0$</span> 处可逆。标准 VE 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n=\\sigma_{\\min}(r^{n}-1)$</span> 型或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n=\\sigma_{\\min}\\sqrt{n}$</span> 型均以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span> 为起点。数值实现必须断言 <code>sigma[0] == 0.0</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例六-VP-与-VE-调度混用导致信噪比定义失效\">反例六：VP 与 VE 调度混用导致信噪比定义失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例六-VP-与-VE-调度混用导致信噪比定义失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（混用调度的信噪比不自洽）</strong> 设采样过程在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步使用 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 计算反向系数，而在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n+1$</span> 步使用 VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{n+1}$</span> 计算前向边际，则信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(n)=\\bar\\alpha_n/(1-\\bar\\alpha_n)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(n+1)=1/\\sigma_{n+1}^2$</span>（VE 的信噪比定义）不满足单调递减关系，反向 SDE 的漂移在两步之间不连续，数值积分产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 量级的跳变。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A2) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n&gt;0$</span>；本反例拆掉“同一调度族贯穿全过程”的隐含约定，展示混用后的不自洽。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> VP 的信噪比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\text{VP}}(n)=\\bar\\alpha_n/(1-\\bar\\alpha_n)$</span>，VE 的信噪比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\text{VE}}(n)=1/\\sigma_n^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=x_{\\text{data}}+\\sigma_n\\varepsilon$</span>，信号方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，噪声方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n^2$</span>）。两者在时间重参数化下可对应：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/(1+\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\text{VP}}(t)=1/\\sigma_t^2=\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\text{VE}}(t)$</span>。但若在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步用 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span>、第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n+1$</span> 步用 VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{n+1}$</span> 而不做此重参数化，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(n)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(n+1)$</span> 之间无保证的单调关系。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=0.9$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\text{VP}}=9$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{n+1}=0.5$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\text{VE}}=4$</span>），则信噪比从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$9$</span> 跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>，反向漂移的得分项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_{n+1}^2$</span> 量级不匹配，单步更新的方差为两步系数平方和，产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 跳变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补的条件</strong> 混用调度时必须先做时间重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/(1+\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，使两族的信噪比在同一时间轴上一致；数值实现必须断言 <code>snr</code> 序列单调递减，否则拒绝该调度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例七-beta_n-的累积和超过---log-epsilon_-text-mach-的定量估计\">反例七：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n$</span> 的累积和超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 的定量估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例七-beta_n-的累积和超过---log-epsilon_-text-mach-的定量估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（VP 下溢的定量阈值）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n$</span> 为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_N=(1-\\beta)^N$</span>，下溢条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta)^N&lt;\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;-\\log\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}/\\log(1-\\beta)$</span>。对双精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}=2^{-52}\\approx 2.2\\times 10^{-16}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}\\approx 36.7$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta)\\approx -0.105$</span>，阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;36.7/0.105\\approx 349$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=0.5$</span>，阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;36.7/0.693\\approx 53$</span>。故常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 超过阈值后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_N$</span> 下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，信噪比被计算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 而非真值。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A1) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n\\in[0,1)$</span>；本反例保留 (A1) 但给出下溢的定量边界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_N=(1-\\beta)^N$</span>，取对数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_N=N\\log(1-\\beta)$</span>，下溢条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_N&lt;\\log\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\log(1-\\beta)&lt;\\log\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta)&lt;0$</span>，除以负数翻转不等号得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;-\\log\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}/\\log(1-\\beta)$</span>。代入数值即得上述阈值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong> 标准 VP 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n$</span> 线性从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}=10^{-4}$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}=0.02$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1000$</span> 步，累积和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\beta_n\\approx N(\\beta_{\\min}+\\beta_{\\max})/2=1000\\cdot 0.01005\\approx 10.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_N\\approx e^{-10.05}\\approx 4.3\\times 10^{-5}$</span>，远高于双精度 epsilon，不下溢。这说明标准调度已满足精度约束，下溢仅出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n\\to 1$</span> 的极端调度中。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例八-反向-SDE-的漂移在-bar-alpha_t-to-0-处的发散速率\">反例八：反向 SDE 的漂移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 处的发散速率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例八-反向-SDE-的漂移在-bar-alpha_t-to-0-处的发散速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（VP 反向漂移的发散估计）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1$</span> 时趋于常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>。则反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\frac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span> 中得分项的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to\\beta_1$</span> 有界，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span> 本身含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 因子（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 偏离均值时），故漂移的 Lipschitz 常数以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 发散，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。这与反例四中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1/(1-t)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-t)$</span> 发散不同：前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的平方根倒数，后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 本身的发散。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A2) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>；本反例在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1$</span> 处拆掉正性，给出两种发散机制的区分。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> VP 边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{\\text{data}},1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x)=-(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{\\text{data}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。反向漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\frac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\nabla\\log q_t(x)=-\\frac12\\beta_t x+\\beta_t(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{\\text{data}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x f=-\\frac12\\beta_t+\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x f\\to\\frac12\\beta_t$</span>，有界。但对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\text{data}}$</span> 的依赖项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故漂移本身有界。真正的发散来自得分估计的误差放大：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，则漂移误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\delta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to\\beta_t\\delta$</span>，有界。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有界时反向漂移不发散；反例四的发散源于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 本身发散，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界澄清</strong> 反例四中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1/(1-t)$</span> 的发散是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的发散，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 的直接后果。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有界而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>，反向漂移的 Lipschitz 常数有界，数值积分稳定。这纠正了“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 必然导致数值爆炸”的误解：爆炸的必要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时发散，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 非单调。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例九-VE-调度-sigma_n-增长过快导致前向边际方差爆炸\">反例九：VE 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 增长过快导致前向边际方差爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例九-VE-调度-sigma_n-增长过快导致前向边际方差爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9（VE 前向方差的无界增长）</strong> 设 VE 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n=r^n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;1$</span>。则前向边际方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n^2=r^{2n}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 指数增长，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^{2N}&gt;\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}^{-1}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_N^2$</span> 上溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>（单精度）或产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}^{-1})$</span> 量级的数值，前向采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_N=x_{\\text{data}}+\\sigma_N\\varepsilon$</span> 的范数以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_N$</span> 增长，反向采样的初始范数同样爆炸，单步更新的相对误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_N$</span> 放大。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A3) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n\\ge 0$</span>；本反例保留 (A3) 但拆掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 增长速率的约束。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 前向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_N=x_{\\text{data}}+r^N\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_N\\|$</span> 的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\|x_{\\text{data}}\\|^2+r^{2N}d}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^{2N}d\\gg\\|x_{\\text{data}}\\|^2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_N\\|\\approx r^N\\sqrt{d}$</span>。反向采样从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_N$</span> 出发，第一步漂移含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sigma_{N-1}^2-\\sigma_N^2)/\\sigma_N^2=(r^{-2}-1)$</span>，有界；但得分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_N,N)$</span> 的输入范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^N\\sqrt{d}$</span>，若网络未做输入归一化，其输出范数随输入增长，漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto r^N$</span>，单步更新的绝对误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^N$</span> 放大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补的条件</strong> VE 调度要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_N$</span> 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{d})$</span> 量级（与数据维度匹配），且反向网络必须做输入归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_N/\\sqrt{1+\\sigma_N^2}$</span>。标准 VE 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n=\\sigma_{\\min}(r^n-1)$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_N\\approx\\sigma_{\\max}$</span> 为终点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\max}$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{d})$</span> 量级，满足此条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例十-离散与连续对应的步长条件\">反例十：离散与连续对应的步长条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例十-离散与连续对应的步长条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10（Euler-Maruyama 的稳定性步长）</strong> 设反向 SDE 的漂移 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>，扩散系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>。则显式 Euler-Maruyama 的均方稳定性要求步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2/L$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2h&gt;1$</span> 时扩散项的方差贡献超过信号项，单步更新的信噪比低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。对 VP 反向 SDE，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\approx\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span>，故稳定性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\beta_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;1/\\beta_t$</span>，后者更严格：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;1/\\beta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A2) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>；本反例给出步长与调度的联合约束。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 反向 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx=[-\\frac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\nabla\\log q_t(x)]dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}d\\bar W$</span>。漂移的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\sup_t\\|\\partial_x f\\|$</span>，由命题 8 的推导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\approx\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 不趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时）。Euler-Maruyama 更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n-1}=x_n+f(x_n,t_n)h+\\sqrt{\\beta_t h}\\,z_n$</span>，均方稳定性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1+Lh|&lt;1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2/L$</span>。扩散项方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t h$</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t h&lt;1$</span> 使单步噪声方差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。两者合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;\\min(2/L,1/\\beta_t)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 不接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/L\\approx 2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\beta_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\beta_t$</span> 比较：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\beta_t&gt;1/\\beta_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\beta_t$</span> 更严格。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong> 标准 VP 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le 0.02$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;1/0.02=50$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1000$</span> 步对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=0.001$</span>，远小于阈值，稳定。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（反例一的极端调度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步总时长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&lt;1$</span> 时无解——即极端调度下离散化本身不可行。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反例十一-得分估计误差在-mathrm-SNR-to-0-处的放大\">反例十一：得分估计误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\to 0$</span> 处的放大<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反例十一-得分估计误差在-mathrm-SNR-to-0-处的放大\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11（低信噪比区的误差放大）</strong> 设得分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的相对误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|/\\|\\varepsilon\\|\\le\\rho$</span>。则反向漂移的误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta f\\|=\\beta_t\\|\\delta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to 1$</span>，误差有界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\rho\\|\\varepsilon\\|$</span>。但在高信噪比区 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to 0$</span>，误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 放大，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.9999$</span> 时放大因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$100$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (A4) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\le M$</span>；本反例拆掉“误差均匀有界”的隐含假设，给出误差随信噪比变化的定量估计。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 反向漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\frac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（标准参数化）。误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta f=-\\beta_t\\delta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta f\\|=\\beta_t\\|\\delta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to 0$</span>，放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 发散。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补的条件</strong> 高信噪比区的得分估计必须满足绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\le\\rho\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，即误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 缩小，才能使漂移误差有界。这要求网络在高信噪比区的训练精度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 提升，是调度选择节所给训练损失加权的必要性边界。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>VP 调度要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n$</span> 的累积和受浮点精度约束（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\beta_k\\le-\\log\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span>），否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 下溢使信噪比与反向系数失真；VE 调度要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 严格递增，符号写反将导致反向漂移每步放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\Delta_n/\\sigma_n^2$</span> 倍并指数爆炸。</li>\n<li>反向条件方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{n-1\\mid n}=\\Sigma_{n-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}\\Sigma_{n-1}/[\\bar\\alpha_n\\Sigma_n])$</span> 的非负性等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 单调递减；非单调调度（含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n=0$</span> 平台）可使该方差为负，数值实现必须断言单调性。</li>\n<li>连续时间 VP 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta_sds&lt;\\infty$</span> 以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1/(1-t)$</span> 型调度使反向 SDE 的 Lipschitz 常数以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-t)$</span> 发散，显式积分步长必须小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(1-t)\\sqrt{t}$</span>，总步数发散——这是调度选择节所给条件的必要性边界。</li>\n<li>反例五至十一补足了调度不当的边界情形：VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span> 使前向不可逆、VP 与 VE 混用使信噪比不自洽、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n$</span> 累积和超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 下溢、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有界时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 不导致爆炸（纠正误解）、VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 增长过快使前向方差上溢、Euler-Maruyama 步长受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\beta_t$</span> 约束、高信噪比区得分误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 放大。</li>\n<li>数值实现的必要断言集为：<code>sigma[0]==0</code>（VE 起点）、<code>diff(bar_alpha)&lt;=0</code>（VP 单调）、<code>snr</code> 单调递减（混用重参数化）、<code>bar_alpha&gt;eps_mach</code>（下溢防护）、<code>beta*h&lt;1</code>（步长稳定）、<code>sigma_N&lt;=sqrt(d)</code>（VE 终点量级）。</li>\n<li>调度选择的必要性边界可统一表述为：VP 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 可积且累积和受精度约束、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 单调递减；VE 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 严格递增且终点量级匹配数据维度；两族混用必须先做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/(1+\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 重参数化——任一条失效即触发本节所列的数值爆炸机制。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-与-DDPM-的对应\">与 DDPM 的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-与-DDPM-的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in C([0,T];(0,\\infty))$</span> 为 VP 噪声速率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为 VE 噪声尺度函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。为处理离散 DDPM，引入如下新符号并固定含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>离散步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，步指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\in\\{0,1,\\dots,N\\}$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=1/N$</span>（无量纲时间，总时长归一化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。</li>\n<li>离散前向核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_n\\mid x_{n-1})=\\mathcal N(x_n;\\sqrt{1-\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_{n-1},\\,\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}I_d)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\in(0,1)$</span> 为离散调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 记为起始步。</li>\n<li>累积量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=1-\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\prod_{k=1}^{n}\\alpha_k^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\mathrm{d}}=1$</span>。</li>\n<li>连续时间嵌入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}:=x_n$</span>，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t_n):=N\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（离散调度正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\in(0,1)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\beta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\beta(t)-\\beta(s)|\\le L_\\beta|t-s|$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)$</span> 由分段线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)=N\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_{n-1},t_n)$</span>）给出。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（矩有限）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in L^2(\\Omega;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（可积性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有定义且连续。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：在 A1–A3 下，证明离散 DDPM 的前向边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_n\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 VP-SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span> 处的闭式边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n})I_d)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时一致逼近，并给出误差阶。这与相邻概念的区别在于：前序节给出的是连续时间 VP/VE 的闭式解，本节给出的是离散链与连续过程之间的定量桥接，而非重新推导闭式解本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散前向边缘的闭式解\">离散前向边缘的闭式解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散前向边缘的闭式解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（离散高斯边缘）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_n\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(x_n;\\;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\,x_0,\\;(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})I_d\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=1$</span> 时由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_1^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0,\\beta_1^{\\mathrm{d}}I_d)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\alpha_1^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_1^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\beta_1^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_n\\mid x_0)=\\int q(x_n\\mid x_{n-1})\\,q(x_{n-1}\\mid x_0)\\,dx_{n-1}.$$</div>\n<p>两因子均为高斯，被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp\\big(-\\tfrac12[(x_n-\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_{n-1})^\\top(\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}})^{-1}(x_n-\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_{n-1})+(x_{n-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0)^\\top(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})^{-1}(x_{n-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0)]\\big)$</span> 乘以归一化常数。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n-1}$</span> 配方：关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n-1}$</span> 的二次型系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}/\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}})+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})^{-1}$</span>，一次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}(\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}})^{-1}x_n-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})^{-1}x_0$</span>。高斯积分给出边缘分布均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0$</span>，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})=1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>。此处用到 Fubini（被积函数非负可测，且两高斯密度的乘积关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_n,x_{n-1})$</span> 可积，因两因子均为概率密度，乘积的积分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），以及高斯积分的标准恒等式。归纳完成。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（离散信噪比恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1。<strong>结论</strong>：离散信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span> 满足递推</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\frac{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\,\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}{1+\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\,\\mathrm{SNR}_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span>（命题 1 证明中的协方差恒等式），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\frac{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}=\\frac{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\,\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{1+\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\,\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})},$$</div>\n<p>右端即所述形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是可检验的：给定任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span>，逐步计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 与直接由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 计算的值应一致到机器精度（见下方代码）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-连续极限-离散链收敛到-VP-SDE-边缘\">连续极限：离散链收敛到 VP-SDE 边缘<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-连续极限-离散链收敛到-VP-SDE-边缘\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（连续极限的一致性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2、A3 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_n\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\le C\\Delta$</span> 对某常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&gt;0$</span> 成立（即步长与速率同阶）。<strong>结论</strong>：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=K(C,L_\\beta,T)$</span> 使对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}\\right|\\le K\\Delta,\\qquad \\left|\\mathrm{SNR}_n^{\\mathrm{d}}-\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)\\right|\\le K'\\Delta,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}=e^{-\\int_0^{t_n}\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K'$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_1,T]$</span> 上的下界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\prod_{k=1}^n(1-\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}=\\exp(-\\sum_{k=1}^n\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\beta_s\\,ds)$</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，由 A1 的 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t_k)=N\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\beta_s\\,ds-\\Delta\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}}\\right|=\\left|\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}(\\beta_s-\\beta(t_k))\\,ds\\right|\\le L_\\beta\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}|s-t_k|\\,ds\\le \\tfrac12 L_\\beta\\Delta^2.$$</div>\n<p>又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log(1-\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}})+\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}}|\\le (\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}})^2/(1-\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}})\\le C^2\\Delta^2/(1-C\\Delta)$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\le C\\Delta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(1-u)=u+u^2/2+\\cdots$</span> 的余项估计）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\log\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}-\\log\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}\\right|\\le \\sum_{k=1}^n\\left(\\tfrac12 L_\\beta\\Delta^2+\\frac{C^2\\Delta^2}{1-C\\Delta}\\right)\\le \\left(\\tfrac12 L_\\beta+\\frac{C^2}{1-C\\Delta}\\right)T\\Delta.$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}|=|\\exp(\\log\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})-\\exp(\\log\\bar\\alpha_{t_n})|\\le e^{\\max}|\\log\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}-\\log\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}|$</span>（中值定理，指数函数 Lipschitz 常数在紧区间上有界），第一式得证。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=\\bar\\alpha/(1-\\bar\\alpha)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\bar\\alpha_{t_1},1)$</span> 上 Lipschitz（导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha)^2$</span> 有界，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_1}&lt;1$</span>）及第一式推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（误差阶的不可改进性）</strong>：命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 阶来自 Euler 型离散对积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\beta$</span> 的逼近误差。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 为常值，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=(1-\\beta\\Delta)^n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\beta t_n}$</span> 的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-u)^n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-nu}$</span> 的标准比较），故阶不可改进为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\Delta)$</span> 除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\equiv0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-与-DDPM-训练目标的对应\">与 DDPM 训练目标的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-与-DDPM-训练目标的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DDPM 的变分目标可写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 的求和，每项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{n-1}\\mid x_n,x_0)$</span>。由命题 1，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span>，后验为高斯：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{n-1}\\mid x_n,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(x_{n-1};\\;\\mu_n(x_n,x_0),\\;\\tilde\\beta_n I_d\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n=\\frac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}$</span>。<strong>推导</strong>：由贝叶斯公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{n-1}\\mid x_n,x_0)\\propto q(x_n\\mid x_{n-1})q(x_{n-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>，两因子均为高斯（命题 1 及其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 情形），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n-1}$</span> 配方即得。此处用到 Fubini 与高斯密度的可积性，条件同命题 1。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（噪声预测参数化的等价性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2。<strong>结论</strong>：若定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_n=(x_n-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，且后验均值可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_n(x_n,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}\\left(x_n-\\frac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}\\,\\varepsilon_n\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一断言由命题 1 的线性变换直接得到（高斯分布在仿射变换下的像）。第二断言：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_n-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\varepsilon_n)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_n$</span> 的表达式，整理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 的系数即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：DDPM 中以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_n,n)$</span> 预测噪声、再反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的常用参数化，与本节闭式后验在代数上恒等；它不涉及任何近似，是恒等式而非“目标值相等推出梯度相等”的误用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-具体例子-常值调度下的数值验证\">具体例子：常值调度下的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-具体例子-常值调度下的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1000$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=10^{-4}$</span>（常值），<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_n\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{(1-10^{-4})^n},1-(1-10^{-4})^n)$</span>。由命题 2，连续极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(e^{-0.1\\,t_n},1-e^{-0.1\\,t_n})$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)=N\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=0.1$</span>）。下表给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=100,500,1000$</span> 时两均值与两方差之差的绝对值，预期均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-3}$</span> 量级（<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)=10^{-3}$</span>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}-e^{-0.1t_n}|$</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\">$|(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})-(1-e^{-0.1t_n})|$</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>100</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 4.9\\times10^{-5}$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 4.9\\times10^{-5}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>500</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 2.4\\times10^{-4}$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 2.4\\times10^{-4}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1000</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 4.8\\times10^{-4}$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 4.8\\times10^{-4}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-对应关系的边界-离散与连续不可交换之处\">对应关系的边界：离散与连续不可交换之处<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-对应关系的边界-离散与连续不可交换之处\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 的收敛是边缘分布层面的弱收敛（由命题 1 的高斯性与命题 2 的参数收敛，两高斯分布的全变差距离被参数差控制）。但反向过程的时间离散化误差不由此推出：反向 SDE 的 Euler-Maruyama 离散误差依赖漂移的 Lipschitz 常数，而该常数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\to\\infty$</span> 而发散。因此“前向边缘一致”不等于“反向采样一致”，后者需反向 SDE 章的假设。本节只主张前向边缘的对应，不越界主张反向。这一区分正是禁止把目标值相等当成梯度相等的具体落实：命题 3 是代数恒等式，命题 2 是分布逼近，二者不可互相替代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散后验的闭式推导与方差恒等式\">离散后验的闭式推导与方差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散后验的闭式推导与方差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 已给出前向边缘；DDPM 的变分目标还要求后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{n-1}\\mid x_n,x_0)$</span> 的闭式。上一小节已写出其均值与方差，此处补足推导并给出一个可检验的方差恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（后验方差恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}&lt;1$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n=\\dfrac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_n}=\\frac{1}{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n\\le\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}=0$</span> 时成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 证明中的协方差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=1-a$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=a+cb$</span>，而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_n=\\frac{ab}{a+cb}.$$</div>\n<p>直接计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_n}=\\frac{a+cb}{ab}=\\frac{1}{b}+\\frac{c}{a}=\\frac{1}{b}+\\frac{1-a}{a}=\\frac{1}{b}+\\frac{1}{a}-1.$$</div>\n<p>这与所述形式差一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>，核对如下：正确的配方来自两高斯精度相加。设前向核精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/a$</span>，先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{n-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/b$</span>，则后验精度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/a+1/b$</span> 减去由均值耦合引入的项。精确地，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n-1}$</span> 配方时二次型系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}/a+1/b=(1-a)/a+1/b=1/a+1/b-1$</span>，故后验方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n=1/(1/a+1/b-1)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_n=\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}-1}=\\frac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})-\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}=\\frac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}},$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})=\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+(1-\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}})(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span> 展开即得分子分母一致。因此正确的恒等式是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_n}=\\frac{1}{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}-1.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/b\\ge1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}\\le1$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/a&gt;1$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 1/a$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tilde\\beta_n\\ge1/\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n\\le\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>；等号要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/b=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是可数值检验的：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，用命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 直接算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n$</span>，与用精度公式算的值应一致到机器精度。下方代码断言之。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-连续时间后验与离散后验的对应\">连续时间后验与离散后验的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-连续时间后验与离散后验的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>连续 VP 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_s\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>）同样为高斯。由 VP 闭式边缘（前序节命题）与马尔可夫性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(x_s\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(x_s;\\;\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_s}{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t-\\bar\\alpha_s}{\\bar\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)\\cdot\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t},\\;\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_s(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s)(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中均值与方差的显式形式需由两高斯精度相加得到，与命题 4 同构。<strong>命题 5（连续后验的精度形式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A3 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：连续后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_{s\\mid t}^2$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\sigma_{s\\mid t}^2}=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_s(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s)}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_s}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s},$$</div>\n<p>此式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to t$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma^2\\to0$</span>，与离散情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n\\to0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\to0$</span>）一致。<strong>证明思路</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_s\\mid x_t,x_0)\\propto p(x_t\\mid x_s)p(x_s\\mid x_0)$</span> 配方，两因子分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s}x_s,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s)I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_s}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)I_d)$</span>，精度相加后减去耦合项，与命题 4 的代数结构逐项对应（把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_s$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（后验方差的单调性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 4。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 单调递增，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 单调递减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 4 的精度形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tilde\\beta_n=1/\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})-1$</span>，右端关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 递减（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 递减），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 递增；关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span> 递增，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tilde\\beta_n$</span> 递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n$</span> 递减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个工程上可用的判据：若某步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 过大，则该步后验方差偏大，反向采样在该步的随机性偏强；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 过小（即前面积累了过多噪声），则后验方差偏小，反向采样在该步几乎确定。二者共同决定 DDPM 反向链的逐步方差剖面。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-噪声预测目标与闭式后验的等价性-补足命题-3-的推导\">噪声预测目标与闭式后验的等价性（补足命题 3 的推导）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-噪声预测目标与闭式后验的等价性-补足命题-3-的推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 已给出代数恒等，此处补足其证明中省略的整理步骤，并给出一个可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3 的补足证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\varepsilon_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_n-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\varepsilon_n)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}$</span>。代入命题 4 前的后验均值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_n,$$</div>\n<p>得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\cdot\\frac{x_n-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\varepsilon_n}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_n.$$</div>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}$</span> 合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 的系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}=\\frac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}},$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用命题 1 证明中的协方差恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_n$</span> 的系数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}=-\\frac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}.$$</div>\n<p>合并即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_n=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}\\left(x_n-\\dfrac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}\\varepsilon_n\\right)$</span>，与命题 3 所述一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（噪声预测的均方误差恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2。<strong>结论</strong>：若以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_n=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_n,n)$</span> 预测噪声，则去噪目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_n-\\varepsilon_n\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_n-\\varepsilon_n\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_n-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\hat\\varepsilon_n)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_n-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\varepsilon_n)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的表达式相减，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0-x_0=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}(\\hat\\varepsilon_n-\\varepsilon_n),$$</div>\n<p>取范数平方即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：两个训练目标仅差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 有关的标量因子，故在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 时梯度方向相同（标量因子为正），但跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 求和时权重不同。这正是“目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等”的反面用法：此处目标值成比例，梯度也成比例，比例因子显式给出，故可安全互换；若比例因子依赖参数则不可。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散链的全变差界\">离散链的全变差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散链的全变差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 只给参数收敛，此处补足分布层面的定量界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（全变差界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1–A3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_n\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\le C\\Delta$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_{t\\in[t_1,T]}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\ge\\delta&gt;0$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}\\big(q(x_n\\mid x_0),\\,p(x_{t_n}\\mid x_0)\\big)\\le \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\delta}\\left(|\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}|^{1/2}+\\frac{|\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}|}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}\\right),$$</div>\n<p>右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\Delta})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：两分布均为高斯，均值分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}x_0$</span>，协方差分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})I_d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n})I_d$</span>。两高斯的全变差由 Pinsker 不等式控制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}\\le\\sqrt{\\mathrm{KL}/2}$</span>，而两同协方差方向高斯的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\|\\mu_1-\\mu_2\\|_{\\Sigma^{-1}}^2$</span>（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n})I_d$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^{-1}$</span> 的谱范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1/\\delta$</span>），加上协方差差异的 KL 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\sum_i(\\lambda_i/\\lambda_i'-1-\\log(\\lambda_i/\\lambda_i'))$</span>，对同向协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_i=1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_i'=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}$</span>，该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{d}{2}(r-1-\\log r)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n})$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log r|\\le|r-1|/\\min(r,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\to1$</span>，该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(|\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}|^2/\\delta^2)$</span>。均值项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\|\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}\\|^2\\|x_0\\|^2/\\delta$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\sqrt{a}-\\sqrt{b}|\\le|a-b|^{1/2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\in[0,1]$</span>）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(|\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}|/\\delta)$</span>。合并并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\cdot}$</span> 的凹性得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此界说明：即便参数差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，全变差仅以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\Delta})$</span> 收敛，这是高斯分布间 KL 对参数差的平方根依赖所致，不可改进为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 除非两分布协方差完全相同。工程含义：离散 DDPM 与连续 VP 的样本分布在步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Delta}$</span> 速率接近，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^3$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^4$</span> 仅将分布差缩小约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{10}$</span> 倍，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 倍。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-一个反例边界-非-Lipschitz-调度的失效\">一个反例边界：非 Lipschitz 调度的失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-一个反例边界-非-Lipschitz-调度的失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 与命题 6 均要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性（A1）。若放弃该假设，参数收敛阶可退化。<strong>构造</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=1/(n+1)$</span>（非 Lipschitz，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)=N/(n+1)$</span> 在相邻步间跳变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N/n^2)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 小时跳变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N)$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=\\prod_{k=1}^n k/(k+1)=1/(n+1)$</span>，而连续嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)=N/(\\lfloor Nt\\rfloor+1)$</span> 的积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{t_n}\\beta_s\\,ds$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}}\\Delta$</span> 的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k(\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\beta_s\\,ds-\\Delta\\beta_k^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span>，每项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\cdot\\mathrm{Lip})$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 小时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N)$</span>，故总误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}=1/(n+1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}=e^{-\\int\\beta}$</span> 可差常数倍，命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 界失效。此构造的完整分析归入本章第 10 节反例节，本节只指出 A1 不可省。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-反向链的离散-连续对应与得分匹配的代数恒等\">反向链的离散-连续对应与得分匹配的代数恒等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-反向链的离散-连续对应与得分匹配的代数恒等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前向边缘的对应（命题 1、2、6）只解决了 DDPM 的一半；DDPM 的反向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{n-1}\\mid x_n)$</span> 与连续 VP 反向 SDE 的对应需单独建立，且不能由前向对应推出。本小节给出反向链参数化与连续得分之间的显式恒等式，并说明其成立所需的假设。</p>\n<p><strong>符号补充</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_n,n)$</span> 为反向链均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_n,n)$</span> 为反向链协方差（本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_n I_d$</span>，即固定方差参数化）。记连续 VP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 处的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t):=\\nabla_x\\log p_t^\\theta(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^\\theta$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 参数化的近似边缘密度。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 B1（网络可微与增长控制）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,n)\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,n}\\|\\nabla_x\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,n)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le M$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 B2（固定方差）</strong>：反向链协方差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_n,n)=\\tilde\\beta_n I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n$</span> 由命题 4 给出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（反向均值与连续得分的恒等）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2、B1、B2 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：DDPM 反向链均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_n,n)$</span> 与连续 VP 得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_n,t_n)$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta(x_n,n)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}\\left(x_n+\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\,\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_n,n)\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}\\left(x_n+\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})\\,s_\\theta(x_n,t_n)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中第二个等号在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,n)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\,s_\\theta(x,t_n)$</span> 时成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 3 的补足证明，后验均值以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_n=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}\\big(x_n-\\frac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}\\varepsilon_n\\big)$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_n$</span> 替换为网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_n,n)$</span> 即得第一个等号（这是参数化替换，非近似）。第二个等号：连续 VP 的得分与噪声的关系由 Tweedie 恒等式给出。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的边缘化（用 Fubini，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 可积，因两高斯密度乘积可积），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)=\\mathbb E[\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)\\mid x_t]=-\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。代入第一个等号即得第二个等号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于：它把 DDPM 的反向均值写成连续得分的显式函数，且系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span> 与连续反向 SDE 的漂移系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span> 处的值相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>（由命题 2）。因此反向链的每一步是连续反向 SDE 的一个 Euler 步，但步长与系数的对应需逐项核对，不能仅凭“形式相似”断言。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（反向链的 Euler 极限）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1–A3、B1、B2，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_n\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}\\le C\\Delta$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 而只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t_n)$</span>（即网络在连续时间上定义），则反向链的均值更新</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n-1}=\\mu_\\theta(x_n,n)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_n}\\,z_n,\\qquad z_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d),$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时依分布收敛到反向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d x_t=\\big[-\\beta_t x_t-2\\beta_t\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big]\\,dt+\\sqrt{2\\beta_t}\\,d\\bar W_t$$</div>\n<p>的 Euler-Maruyama 离散，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar W$</span> 为反向时间 Wiener 过程。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>：将命题 7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 代入更新式，展开到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n-1}=x_n+\\frac{1-\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}x_n+\\frac{\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}}\\,s_\\theta(x_n,t_n)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_n}\\,z_n.$$</div>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}=1-\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}/2+O((\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}})^2)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n=\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+O((\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}})^2)$</span>（由命题 4 的精度形式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}\\to1$</span> 时的展开），第一项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}/2+O((\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}})^2)$</span>，第二项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n})+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。合并得漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}x_n/2-\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n})s_\\theta$</span>，与反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta_t x_t-2\\beta_t s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span> 处的值相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/2$</span>；后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时两漂移不一致。<strong>这说明</strong>：固定方差参数化的 DDPM 反向链在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时并不收敛到标准 VP 反向 SDE，而是收敛到一个带修正项的 SDE；标准 VP 反向 SDE 对应的是方差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n$</span> 的参数化。完整推导归入反向 SDE 章，本节只指出：反向链与连续反向 SDE 的对应不是恒等，而是依赖方差参数化的选择。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本节对“禁止把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混为一谈”的具体落实：反向链的漂移在固定方差参数化下与反向 SDE 漂移相差一个显式因子，二者不可互换；概率流 ODE 的速度又是另一对象（见与 Flow 的接口节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-得分匹配目标的离散-连续恒等\">得分匹配目标的离散-连续恒等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-得分匹配目标的离散-连续恒等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DDPM 的训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{n,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\varepsilon,n)-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 与连续得分匹配目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{t,x_t}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2$</span> 的对应需一个显式的重加权恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（离散噪声目标作为连续得分匹配的重加权）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1–A3，B1，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_1,T]$</span> 上具有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\big\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}\\varepsilon,n)-\\varepsilon\\big\\|^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})\\,\\mathbb E_{x_{t_n}}\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_{t_n},t_n)-\\nabla\\log p_{t_n}(x_{t_n})\\big\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>右端的期望关于连续 VP 边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t_n}$</span> 取。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Tweedie 恒等式（命题 7 证明中已导出）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_{t_n}(x)=-\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_{t_n}=x]/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}$</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}$</span>（命题 7 第二个等号），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|s_\\theta(x,t_n)-\\nabla\\log p_{t_n}(x)\\big\\|^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}\\big\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,n)-\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_{t_n}=x]\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\sim p_{t_n}$</span> 取期望，并用全期望公式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\cdot]=\\mathbb E_{x_{t_n}}\\mathbb E[\\cdot\\mid x_{t_n}]$</span>，条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 A2 与高斯性成立），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{x_{t_n}}\\big\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log p_{t_n}\\big\\|^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\big\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}\\varepsilon,n)-\\varepsilon\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>（命题 2 保证差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，在恒等式中作为参数替换），整理即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：DDPM 的噪声预测目标在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 时恰是连续得分匹配目标乘以标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})$</span>；跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 求和时，DDPM 的均匀加权对应连续得分匹配的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，即信噪比越低（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 越大）权重越小。这与“目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等”的纪律一致：此处目标值成比例、梯度也成比例，比例因子显式给出且为正，故可安全互换；若采用不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 加权（如重要性采样），则比例因子随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 变，梯度不再成比例，需重新推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-具体例子-反向链一步的数值核对\">具体例子：反向链一步的数值核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-具体例子-反向链一步的数值核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-对应的适用边界与本节不主张的内容\">对应的适用边界与本节不主张的内容<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-对应的适用边界与本节不主张的内容\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的对应有三条边界，须显式声明，以免被误读为“DDPM 就是 VP-SDE 的离散化”：</p>\n<p>第一，前向边缘的对应（命题 1、2、6）是分布层面的，成立条件是 A1–A3 与步长-速率同阶；它不涉及反向链，也不涉及训练动力学。</p>\n<p>第二，反向链的对应（命题 7、推论 4）依赖方差参数化（B2）。固定方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_n$</span> 的 DDPM 反向链在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时不收敛到标准 VP 反向 SDE，而方差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的参数化才收敛到标准形式；这一区别归入反向 SDE 章，本节只给出恒等式与因子，不作收敛性主张。</p>\n<p>第三，训练目标的对应（命题 8）是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 的标量重加权恒等；跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 的加权选择改变梯度比例，需单独分析。本节不主张“DDPM 训练等价于连续得分匹配”的无条件陈述，只主张命题 8 的逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 恒等及其显式因子。</p>\n<p>这三条边界共同构成本节对“与 DDPM 的对应”的精确表述：对应是逐项的、带假设的、可数值核对的恒等式与逼近，而非笼统的“等价”。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>离散 DDPM 的前向边缘由命题 1 给出闭式高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})I_d)$</span>，其信噪比满足推论 1 的递推恒等式，与连续 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 在形式上一致。</li>\n<li>在假设 A1–A3 与步长-速率同阶条件下，命题 2 证明离散累积量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 与连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}$</span> 的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，从而离散边缘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 逼近 VP-SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span> 处的闭式边缘；该阶由 Euler 型积分逼近决定，常值调度下不可改进。</li>\n<li>命题 3 表明 DDPM 的噪声预测参数化与本节闭式后验在代数上恒等；但前向边缘的对应不蕴含反向采样误差的对应，后者需反向 SDE 章的 Lipschitz 假设，本节不作主张。</li>\n<li>离散 DDPM 的后验方差由命题 4 的精度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tilde\\beta_n=1/\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}+1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}})-1$</span> 给出，推论 2 证明其关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 递增、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span> 递减，与连续 VP 后验（命题 5）代数同构。</li>\n<li>命题 3 的补足证明逐步写出噪声预测参数化与闭式后验的代数恒等，推论 3 给出噪声目标与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 目标成比例的显式因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}})/\\bar\\alpha_n^{\\mathrm{d}}$</span>，说明二者梯度成比例而非仅目标值相等。</li>\n<li>命题 6 给出离散链与连续 VP 边缘的全变差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\Delta})$</span>，其平方根依赖来自高斯 KL 对协方差参数差的二次依赖；A1 的 Lipschitz 性不可省，非 Lipschitz 调度可使参数收敛阶退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-与-Flow-的接口\">与 Flow 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-与-Flow-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号，不引入新的随机过程记号，仅补充接口所需的映射与向量场记号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 为固定终端时刻；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>。</li>\n<li>VP 前向过程：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge 0$</span> 连续。</li>\n<li>VE 前向过程：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 严格递增。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>（VP 情形）。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘密度（关于 Lebesgue 测度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 为得分函数。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}:=\\{F_t:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为一族时间依赖向量场，满足：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)\\mapsto F_t(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上连续，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t,x}\\|F_t(x)\\|\\le C(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\phi_t=F_t(\\phi_t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0=\\mathrm{id}$</span> 生成的流映射（flow map），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x_0)$</span> 是 ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 出发在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的解。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t:=(\\Phi_t)_\\#p_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 的前推密度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：高斯扩散的得分动力学（反向 SDE）与确定性 Flow（概率流 ODE 或一般 ODE 流）在何种精确意义上可以互相转换，以及转换所需的显式公式与正则性条件。区别在于：反向 SDE 是随机微分方程，其漂移含得分项且扩散系数非零；概率流 ODE 是确定性方程，二者边缘分布相同但样本轨道不同；一般 Flow 的向量场不必然等于概率流 ODE 的速度场。本节只建立接口恒等式，不重复反向 SDE 的推导（见第 15 节接口）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口定义-概率流-ODE-与一般-Flow-的区分\">接口定义：概率流 ODE 与一般 Flow 的区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口定义-概率流-ODE-与一般-Flow-的区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（概率流 ODE）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为某前向扩散在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘密度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 存在、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。称向量场</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t(x):=f_t(x)-\\tfrac12 g_t^2\\,\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$$</div>\n<p>为概率流 ODE 速度场，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t,g_t$</span> 分别为前向 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=f_t(x_t)\\,dt+g_t\\,dw_t$</span> 的漂移与扩散系数。对应 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\phi_t=v_t(\\phi_t)$</span> 称为概率流 ODE。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（一般 Flow）</strong> 任意满足符号表中正则性条件的向量场族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 及其流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 称为一个 Flow；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=(\\Phi_t)_\\#p_0$</span> 为其推前密度族。</p>\n<p><strong>区别陈述</strong> 概率流 ODE 是 Flow 的特例，其向量场由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的得分显式决定，从而保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。一般 Flow 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 是自由选取的，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>；只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t=v_t$</span> 时才重合。本节后续命题均针对“何时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span>”给出判据，而不是把二者混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-主定理-得分与-Flow-速度的显式接口\">主定理：得分与 Flow 速度的显式接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-主定理-得分与-Flow-速度的显式接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（VP 概率流 ODE 的显式速度）</strong> 假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续非负；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 具有有限二阶矩且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz；前向 VP-SDE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,dw_t$</span>。则概率流 ODE 速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Big(x+\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 VP-SDE 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>。代入定义 1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\big(x+\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>关键步骤是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 的代入与提取公因子，无交换极限或积分。局部 Lipschitz 条件保证 ODE 解存在唯一，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 确实生成流。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（VE 概率流 ODE 的显式速度）</strong> 假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 连续可微、严格递增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz；前向 VE-SDE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=\\sqrt{\\dot\\sigma_t^2}\\,dw_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\dot\\sigma_t$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t\\ge0$</span>）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\nabla\\log p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> VE-SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\equiv0$</span>，扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\dot\\sigma_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t^2=\\dot\\sigma_t^2$</span>。代入定义 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}=0-\\tfrac12\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（得分由 Flow 速度反解）</strong> 在命题 1 与命题 2 的假设下，若已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{2}{\\beta_t}v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)-x,\\qquad\n\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{2}{\\dot\\sigma_t^2}v_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 移项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t(x+\\nabla\\log p_t)$</span>，两边乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2/\\beta_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}/\\beta_t=x+\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，再减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。VE 情形由命题 2 直接移项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（VE 得分与高斯卷积的恒等式）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 具有有限二阶矩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>。则 VE 边缘密度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_0*\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>（卷积），且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big(\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]-x\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中条件期望按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(dx_0)\\,p_{t|0}(x\\mid x_0)$</span> 计算。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 VE 闭式边缘（第 5 节）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\int p_0(x_0)\\,\\mathcal{N}(x;x_0,\\sigma_t^2I_d)\\,dx_0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求导并利用高斯核的得分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log\\mathcal{N}(x;x_0,\\sigma_t^2I)=-(x-x_0)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\frac{\\int p_0(x_0)\\mathcal{N}(x;x_0,\\sigma_t^2)\\,(-(x-x_0)/\\sigma_t^2)\\,dx_0}{p_t(x)}=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big(\\frac{\\int x_0\\,p_0\\mathcal{N}}{p_t}-x\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>右端括号内即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]$</span>。求导与积分交换需验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x-x_0\\|\\,p_0(x_0)\\mathcal{N}(x;x_0,\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 可积且被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(1+\\|x_0\\|)\\cdot\\sup_{x_0}\\mathcal{N}$</span> 控制，由 Dominated Convergence 与 Leibniz 法则成立（有限二阶矩保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x_0\\|p_0&lt;\\infty$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口恒等式-Flow-边缘匹配的判据\">接口恒等式：Flow 边缘匹配的判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口恒等式-Flow-边缘匹配的判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（Flow 匹配扩散边缘的充要条件）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 满足符号表正则性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为其流。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 成立当且仅当</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_t(x)=v_t(x)\\quad\\text{对 }p_t\\text{-a.e. }x,\\ \\text{所有 }t\\in[0,T],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 为定义 1 的概率流 ODE 速度场。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t q_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(q_tF_t)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf_t)+\\tfrac12g_t^2\\Delta p_t$</span>。两式相减并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot\\big(p_t(F_t-v_t)\\big)=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=f_t-\\tfrac12g_t^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tv_t=p_tf_t-\\tfrac12g_t^2\\nabla p_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=-\\partial_t p_t+\\tfrac12g_t^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 恰为 Fokker–Planck 右端。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(F_t-v_t))=0$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(F_t-v_t)$</span> 具有紧支撑或足够衰减使边界通量消失，则散度为零蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t=v_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t&gt;0\\}$</span> 上。充分性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t=v_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足同一连续性方程且初值相同，由连续性方程解的唯一性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 有界可积）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 3 的必要性方向用到了“边界通量消失”假设；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在无穷远处衰减不够快，散度为零只能推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t-v_t$</span> 为无散场，不能逐点相等。该边界情形归入第 10 节反例节处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（VP 得分与 Flow 速度的线性接口）</strong> 在命题 1 与命题 3 假设下，若 Flow 已匹配边缘（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t$</span>），则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{2}{\\beta_t}F_t(x)-x.$$</div>\n<p>此即推论 1 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t=v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 时的特例，说明“得分—速度”接口是线性可逆的：知道其一即知其二，无需重新训练。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的闭式验证\">具体例子：一维高斯数据的闭式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的闭式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(m,s^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>。VP 情形取常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\beta t}$</span>。</p>\n<p>由第 4 节 VP 闭式边缘，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,m,\\ \\bar\\alpha_t s^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\big)}$</span>。其得分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,m}{\\bar\\alpha_t s^2+1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>代入命题 1 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\frac{\\beta}{2}\\left(x-\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,m}{\\bar\\alpha_t s^2+1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>验证</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\tfrac12(x-x)=0$</span>。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>、概率流 ODE 初速为零的直觉一致：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 尚未演化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0$</span> 应为零场。数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=2$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0^{\\mathrm{VP}}(2)=0$</span>，与公式一致。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\ln 2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span>：得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(0)=0$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span>：得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-1/(1/2+1/2)=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(1)=-\\tfrac12(1-1)=0$</span>。此例说明 VP 概率流 ODE 在对称高斯下速度场在均值处为零，符合对称性。</p>\n<p>VE 情形取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,1+t^2)$</span>，得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-x/(1+t^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\cdot1\\cdot(-x/(1+t^2))=x/(2(1+t^2))$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1^{\\mathrm{VE}}(2)=2/4=1/2$</span>。验证 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\phi=\\phi/(2(1+t^2))$</span> 的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t=\\phi_0\\sqrt{1+t^2}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1=\\phi_0\\sqrt2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,2)$</span> 的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0^2\\cdot2$</span> 一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span> 推前为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,2)$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-代码-接口恒等式的数值校验\">代码：接口恒等式的数值校验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-代码-接口恒等式的数值校验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码对例 1 的 VP 与 VE 闭式速度场做数值校验，并验证推论 1 的反解恒等式。所有断言基于解析公式，不依赖随机采样。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef vp_score(x, m, s, alpha_bar):\n    var = alpha_bar * s**2 + (1 - alpha_bar)\n    return -(x - np.sqrt(alpha_bar) * m) / var\n\ndef vp_velocity(x, m, s, alpha_bar, beta):\n    return -0.5 * beta * (x + vp_score(x, m, s, alpha_bar))\n\ndef ve_score(x, sigma):\n    # p0 = N(0,1), p_t = N(0, 1+sigma^2)\n    return -x / (1 + sigma**2)\n\ndef ve_velocity(x, sigma):\n    return -0.5 * 1.0 * ve_score(x, sigma)  # sigma_t = t, dot sigma = 1\n\n# 例 1 VP 校验\nm, s, beta = 0.0, 1.0, 1.0\nfor t in [0.0, np.log(2), 2.0]:\n    alpha_bar = np.exp(-beta * t)\n    for x in [-2.0, 0.0, 1.0, 3.0]:\n        v = vp_velocity(x, m, s, alpha_bar, beta)\n        # 推论 1 反解\n        score_recovered = -2.0 / beta * v - x\n        score_direct = vp_score(x, m, s, alpha_bar)\n        assert np.isclose(score_recovered, score_direct, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;VP interface identity OK&quot;)\n\n# 例 1 VE 校验\nfor t in [0.5, 1.0, 2.0]:\n    sigma = t\n    for x in [-1.0, 0.0, 2.0]:\n        v = ve_velocity(x, sigma)\n        score_recovered = -2.0 / (1.0**2) * v\n        score_direct = ve_score(x, sigma)\n        assert np.isclose(score_recovered, score_direct, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;VE interface identity OK&quot;)\n\n# 形状与预期结果\nx_arr = np.linspace(-3, 3, 7)\nv_arr = vp_velocity(x_arr, 0.0, 1.0, np.exp(-1.0), 1.0)\nprint(&quot;shape:&quot;, v_arr.shape, &quot;expected (7,)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;v at x=0:&quot;, v_arr[3], &quot;expected 0.0&quot;)\nassert v_arr.shape == (7,)\nassert np.isclose(v_arr[3], 0.0, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：三行 <code>OK</code>/<code>passed</code>，形状 <code>(7,)</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>概率流 ODE 是 Flow 的特例，其速度场由前向 SDE 的漂移、扩散系数与得分显式给出：VP 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t(x+\\nabla\\log p_t)$</span>，VE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=-\\tfrac12\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>；一般 Flow 的向量场不必然等于该速度场。</li>\n<li>得分与 Flow 速度的接口是线性可逆的（推论 1、推论 3），在边缘匹配（命题 3）成立时，知道其一即知其二；命题 3 给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t$</span> 的充要条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t=v_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-a.e.），其必要性依赖边界通量消失假设。</li>\n<li>接口恒等式在对称高斯例 1 中得到闭式验证，并由可运行代码逐点断言；VE 情形另有得分—条件期望恒等式（推论 2），将得分写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-2}(\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]-x)$</span>，为后续反向 SDE 章的条件期望估计提供接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口的时间定向与端点条件\">接口的时间定向与端点条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口的时间定向与端点条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文给出的速度场公式只确定了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 上的瞬时向量场，尚未说明 Flow 的积分方向与端点对应关系。本节必须把这一点写清楚，否则“接口”在符号上是不闭合的：扩散过程从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的数据端走向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 的噪声端，而生成 Flow 通常从噪声端反向积分回数据端，二者时间定向相反。以下命题固定这一对应。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（时间反演下的速度符号）</strong> 假设命题 1 或命题 2 的条件成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续。定义反演时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:=T-t$</span>，反演密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau:=p_{T-\\tau}$</span>，反演流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\Phi_\\tau:=\\Phi_{T-\\tau}\\circ\\Phi_T^{-1}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau$</span> 的概率流 ODE 速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde v_\\tau(y)=-v_{T-\\tau}\\big(\\Phi_{T-\\tau}\\circ\\Phi_T^{-1}(y)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，VP 情形下</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde v_\\tau^{\\mathrm{VP}}(y)=\\tfrac12\\beta_{T-\\tau}\\Big(\\Phi_{T-\\tau}\\circ\\Phi_T^{-1}(y)+\\nabla\\log p_{T-\\tau}\\big(\\Phi_{T-\\tau}\\circ\\Phi_T^{-1}(y)\\big)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\Phi_T(x_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\Phi_\\tau(y)=\\Phi_{T-\\tau}(x_0)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\tilde\\Phi_\\tau(y)=\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\Phi_{T-\\tau}(x_0)=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\Phi_t(x_0)\\Big|_{t=T-\\tau}=-v_{T-\\tau}\\big(\\Phi_{T-\\tau}(x_0)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>右端自变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{T-\\tau}(x_0)=\\tilde\\Phi_\\tau(y)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_\\tau(y)=-v_{T-\\tau}(\\tilde\\Phi_\\tau(y))$</span>。将命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{T-\\tau}^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 代入并取负号，得 VP 显式式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（端点匹配）</strong> 在命题 4 假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_T=p_T$</span>（即 Flow 在噪声端与扩散边缘重合），则反向积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:0\\to T$</span> 得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde q_T=(\\tilde\\Phi_T)_\\#p_T$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde q_T=p_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t=v_t$</span>。命题 4 表明反演流恰以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_\\tau$</span> 为速度场，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde q_\\tau=\\tilde p_\\tau$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde q_T=\\tilde p_T=p_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是接口的端点条件：Flow 必须在噪声端以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 为初值，反向积分才能回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>；若初值取错（例如用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span>），则只能得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的近似推前，误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 与所选初值的 KL 散度控制，这属于第 10 节反例节的边界情形，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-得分参数化与-Flow-参数化的等价类\">得分参数化与 Flow 参数化的等价类<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-得分参数化与-Flow-参数化的等价类\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程上常把得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(t,x)$</span> 或速度网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(t,x)$</span> 作为可训练对象。接口恒等式说明二者不是独立对象，而是在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 下的线性重参数化。以下命题把这一等价类写成显式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（VP 得分—速度的仿射等价）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足命题 1 条件。对任意可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_s(t,x):=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\big(x+s(t,x)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_s=v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t,x)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。此外，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(t,x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t(x+s_\\theta(t,x))$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v_\\theta(t,x)-v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)\\|=\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\|s_\\theta(t,x)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_s=v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta_t(x+s)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t(x+\\nabla\\log p_t)$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 可约去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。第二断言：两式相减，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_\\theta-v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t(x+s_\\theta)+\\tfrac12\\beta_t(x+\\nabla\\log p_t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log p_t),$$</div>\n<p>取范数即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（训练损失的等价缩放）</strong> 在命题 5 假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,x$</span>，得分回归的平方损失与速度回归的平方损失满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s_\\theta(t,x)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|^2=\\frac{4}{\\beta_t^2}\\|v_\\theta(t,x)-v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5 第二式两边平方并乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4/\\beta_t^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：在 VP 下，以得分或速度为目标函数的训练在最优解处等价，仅损失权重相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4/\\beta_t^2$</span> 的逐点因子；若训练时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的采样分布不同，这一因子会改变有效权重，但不改变最优解集合。VE 情形同理，因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4/\\dot\\sigma_t^4$</span>，证明完全平行，此处不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-与流匹配目标的接口\">与流匹配目标的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-与流匹配目标的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Flow 的另一常见参数化是流匹配（flow matching）目标，它直接回归条件速度场而非边缘得分。本节需说明该目标与扩散得分接口的关系，否则“与 Flow 的接口”在训练层面不完整。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（VP 条件速度的闭式）</strong> 假设 VP 前向过程如本章 canonical claims，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 具有有限二阶矩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 连续非负。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，条件路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t(x_t\\mid x_0,\\varepsilon)=\\frac{d}{dt}x_t=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}x_0+\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\bar\\alpha_t=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}=-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2},\\qquad\n\\frac{d}{dt}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>但第二式需再核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t=-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}x_0+\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 代入并整理，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}x_0+\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>其中第一项的系数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 合并得到，逐步展开为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}x_0+\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)\n=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\Big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}+\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)x_0+\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}x_t.$$</div>\n<p>括号内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big(1+\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，与目标式一致（目标式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 需再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 的等价形式，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 定义下相等，验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>，故系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>，与直接求导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}$</span> 相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)/\\bar\\alpha_t=1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，此处以直接求导结果为准，目标式应写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}x_0+\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>为避免上式在排版中产生歧义，将命题 6 的结论以直接求导的干净形式重述：条件速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t(x_t\\mid x_0,\\varepsilon)=-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}x_0+\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>且用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 后等价于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\Big(\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}x_0\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>推论 6（流匹配目标与得分目标的接口）</strong> 在命题 6 假设下，条件速度的期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[u_t\\mid x_t=x]$</span> 等于概率流 ODE 速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 取给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x$</span> 的条件期望。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]=(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x])/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，代入命题 6 的第二形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[u_t\\mid x_t=x]=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\Big(\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由 VP 闭式边缘（第 4 节）与高斯核得分恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]\\big)$</span>。代入命题 1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\Big(x-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]\\big)\\Big)\n=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\Big(\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>比较两式，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span> 成立。此处出现不一致，说明命题 6 的第二形式在消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 时的系数需逐项复核；以第一形式（直接求导）为准，取条件期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[u_t\\mid x_t=x]=-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]+\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]$</span> 的系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}-\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}\\big(1+\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)=-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[u_t\\mid x_t=x]=\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}x-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x].$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 的表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\big(\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]\\big)$</span> 逐项相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本节接口的核心：流匹配目标的条件速度期望恰为概率流 ODE 速度，因此以流匹配训练的 Flow 在最优解处与扩散得分接口一致；命题 5 与推论 6 共同说明，得分、速度、条件速度三者在固定调度下属于同一等价类，差异仅在参数化与损失权重。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口的适用边界-调度可逆性\">接口的适用边界：调度可逆性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口的适用边界-调度可逆性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述所有恒等式都假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，使得得分与速度的线性变换可逆。若调度在某个时刻退化，接口公式出现除零，必须单独处理。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（退化调度的接口失效）</strong> 假设 VP 情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_0}=0$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0\\in(0,T)$</span> 成立，其余假设同命题 1。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=t_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{t_0}^{\\mathrm{VP}}\\equiv0$</span>，推论 1 的反解公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span> 处无定义；此时由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{t_0}^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 不能恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_{t_0}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t(x+\\nabla\\log p_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_0}=0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{t_0}^{\\mathrm{VP}}\\equiv0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_{t_0}$</span> 无关。推论 1 的反解含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/\\beta_t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span> 处分母为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>VE 情形同理：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_{t_0}=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{t_0}^{\\mathrm{VE}}\\equiv0$</span>，反解因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/\\dot\\sigma_{t_0}^2$</span> 无定义。这说明接口恒等式要求调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上严格正；第 9 节噪声调度的选择已保证常用调度满足此条件，本节只需指出边界，完整反例归第 10 节。</p>\n<p><strong>本节接口链的闭合</strong> 至此，本节完成了从扩散得分到 Flow 速度的完整接口：命题 1、2 给出显式速度场；命题 3 给出边缘匹配的充要条件；命题 4、推论 4 固定时间定向与端点；命题 5、推论 5 给出得分—速度的仿射等价与损失缩放；命题 6、推论 6 把流匹配条件速度与概率流 ODE 速度接上；命题 7 标出退化调度的边界。所有命题均在显式假设下证明，未使用未验证的交换极限；推论 2 的求导—积分交换已由 Dominated Convergence 与有限二阶矩验证。后续第 15 节将把这些接口用于反向 SDE 的漂移构造，本节不重复反向 SDE 的推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口在得分-速度等价类上的不变量\">接口在得分—速度等价类上的不变量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口在得分-速度等价类上的不变量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5 与推论 6 已说明得分、速度、条件速度在固定调度下互为线性重参数化。此处补一个不变量，用以刻画“哪些量在重参数化下保持不变”，从而说明接口不是任意坐标变换，而是有结构的等价类。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（VP 接口下的二次型不变量）</strong> 假设命题 5 的条件成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 具有有限二阶矩。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,x$</span>，定义得分残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_s(t,x):=s_\\theta(t,x)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span> 与速度残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_v(t,x):=v_\\theta(t,x)-v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\langle r_s(t,x),\\,x+\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\big\\rangle=\\frac{2}{\\beta_t}\\big\\langle r_v(t,x),\\,x+\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\big\\rangle\\cdot(-1),$$</div>\n<p>即二者在方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span> 上的投影互为固定倍数；特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 正交当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 正交。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_v=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t r_s$</span>。取与向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的内积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle r_v,\\,x+\\nabla\\log p_t\\rangle=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\langle r_s,\\,x+\\nabla\\log p_t\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>移项即得所述倍数关系。正交性断言由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 直接推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此不变量说明：在 VP 下，得分残差与速度残差沿“得分方向” <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的投影符号相反、模长成固定比例，故以任一残差构造的正交性检验（例如投影梯度下降的收敛判据）在两种参数化下等价。VE 情形完全平行，倍数因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\dot\\sigma_t^2$</span>，不再重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口与反向-SDE-漂移的分离\">接口与反向 SDE 漂移的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口与反向-SDE-漂移的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“与 Flow 的接口”，而第 15 节将处理反向 SDE。二者极易混淆：概率流 ODE 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与反向 SDE 的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t^{\\mathrm{rev}}$</span> 都含得分项，但它们是不同的数学对象。此处给出分离陈述，明确本节只对接前者。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（速度场与反向漂移的分离）</strong> 假设 VP 前向 SDE 如本章 canonical claims，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。则反向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t=\\Big(-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t-\\beta_t\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\Big)\\,dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,d\\bar w_t$$</div>\n<p>的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t^{\\mathrm{rev}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>，而概率流 ODE 速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>。二者满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_t^{\\mathrm{rev}}(x)-v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\nabla\\log p_t(x),$$</div>\n<p>且该差场一般不为零（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t\\not\\equiv0$</span> 时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 反向 SDE 漂移由前向漂移与得分修正项相加得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t^{\\mathrm{rev}}=f_t-g_t^2\\nabla\\log p_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>。与命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 相减得所述差场。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的作用是划界：本节所有恒等式只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span>，不得把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t^{\\mathrm{rev}}$</span> 混用；反向 SDE 的漂移构造、Girsanov 测度变换与时间反演证明归第 15 节。接口的意义恰在于：Flow 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span>，反向 SDE 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t^{\\mathrm{rev}}$</span>，二者共享同一得分但系数不同，故从 Flow 侧恢复的得分可直接供反向 SDE 使用（推论 1），而无需重新推导反向漂移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口的数值闭合-从闭式速度到可积流\">接口的数值闭合：从闭式速度到可积流<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口的数值闭合-从闭式速度到可积流\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补一个可检验的恒等式，把命题 1 的速度场与第 13 节将给出的闭式采样对接：在 VP 下，概率流 ODE 的解可用闭式边缘的均值与方差显式写出，从而接口公式在数值上可逐点验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（VP 概率流 ODE 的闭式解）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(m_0,\\Sigma_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0\\succ0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 连续非负且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>。则 VP 概率流 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\phi_t=v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\phi_t)$</span> 的解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\phi_t(x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,m_0+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\Sigma_0^{1/2}\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t\\Sigma_0+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\big)^{-1/2}\\big(x_0-m_0\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0^{1/2}$</span> 为对称正定平方根，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\cdot)^{-1/2}$</span> 为对称逆平方根。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由第 4 节 VP 闭式边缘，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}m_0,\\ \\bar\\alpha_t\\Sigma_0+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\big)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t\\Sigma_0+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\big)^{-1}\\big(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}m_0\\big).$$</div>\n<p>代入命题 1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Big(x-\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t\\Sigma_0+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\big)^{-1}\\big(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}m_0\\big)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t:=\\phi_t(x_0)-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}m_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot y_t=\\dot\\phi_t-\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}m_0\\big)=\\dot\\phi_t+\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}m_0$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\phi_t=y_t+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}m_0$</span> 代入上式并整理，得线性 ODE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot y_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Big(I_d-\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t\\Sigma_0+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\big)^{-1}\\Big)y_t.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t:=\\bar\\alpha_t\\Sigma_0+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d-A_t^{-1}=A_t^{-1}(A_t-I_d)=A_t^{-1}\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t(\\Sigma_0-I_d)\\big)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}A_t=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t(\\Sigma_0-I_d)=-\\beta_t(A_t-I_d)$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot A_t=-\\beta_t(A_t-I_d)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d-A_t^{-1}=A_t^{-1}(A_t-I_d)=-A_t^{-1}\\dot A_t/\\beta_t$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot y_t=\\tfrac12 A_t^{-1}\\dot A_t\\,y_t,$$</div>\n<p>其解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t=A_t^{1/2}A_0^{-1/2}y_0$</span>（验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}A_t^{1/2}A_0^{-1/2}=\\tfrac12A_t^{-1}\\dot A_tA_t^{1/2}A_0^{-1/2}$</span>，与右端系数一致）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_0=\\Sigma_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0=x_0-m_0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t=A_t^{1/2}\\Sigma_0^{-1/2}(x_0-m_0)$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\phi_t(x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}m_0+A_t^{1/2}\\Sigma_0^{-1/2}(x_0-m_0).$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t^{1/2}\\Sigma_0^{-1/2}=\\Sigma_0^{1/2}\\big(\\Sigma_0^{1/2}A_t^{-1}\\Sigma_0^{1/2}\\big)^{-1/2}$</span>（对称正定矩阵的相似化简，逐项验证：两边平方均等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0^{1/2}A_t^{-1}\\Sigma_0^{1/2}$</span> 的逆的平方根形式），并代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t$</span> 得所述闭式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把接口从“瞬时速度相等”推进到“整条流轨道可闭式写出”，从而第 13 节的闭式采样代码可直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 生成样本，并与扩散前向样本逐点比对；命题 3 的边缘匹配条件在此例中自动满足，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 的推前恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>（由构造）。这也说明接口恒等式不是形式上的重参数化，而是有可计算的轨道闭合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-代码-VP-VE-闭式采样\">代码：VP/VE 闭式采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-代码-VP-VE-闭式采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\ge 0$</span> 为 VP 的连续时间噪声速率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为 VE 的噪声尺度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。采样目标是从闭式边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 抽取样本，输入为初始样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>、时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>、维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需的假设如下，逐条显式列出并在代码中验证其数值后果：</p>\n<p>(A1) <strong>非负速率与可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 有定义且单调不增。代码中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})s/T$</span>（线性调度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min},\\beta_{\\max}\\ge 0$</span>，梯形积分给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds$</span> 的闭式。</p>\n<p>(A2) <strong>VE 尺度单调性与有界性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续、单调不减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&lt;\\infty$</span>。代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sigma_{\\min}(\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min})^{t/T}$</span>（几何调度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 以避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处除零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0$</span> 的退化情形单独断言。</p>\n<p>(A3) <strong>浮点可表示性</strong>：所有量在 IEEE-754 双精度下不溢出、不下溢至零。VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 极小时需 clamp；VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在对数域计算以避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min}$</span> 的直接幂运算溢出。</p>\n<p>在上述假设下，本节要验证的恒等式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{(VP)}\\quad x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds};$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{(VE)}\\quad x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\,\\varepsilon;$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-1-采样算法的输入输出契约\">命题 5.13.1（采样算法的输入输出契约）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-1-采样算法的输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 给定，且 (A1)–(A3) 成立。定义映射</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon,\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)=x_0+\\sigma_t\\,\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}},F_{\\mathrm{VE}}:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,T]\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 连续，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)\\sim\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)\\sim\\mathcal N(x_0,\\sigma_t^2I_d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 有定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t},\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 为实数；(A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 有定义；(A3) 保证浮点计算不产生 NaN。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 连续性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续及线性组合的连续性直接得到。分布结论由仿射变换的高斯不变性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\varepsilon+b\\sim\\mathcal N(b,AA^\\top)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 得 VP 结论；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\sigma_t I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=x_0$</span> 得 VE 结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题即为算法的输入输出契约：输入三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，形状均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(d,)$</span>；数值范围由 (A1)–(A3) 约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-2-核心更新的稳定性条件\">命题 5.13.2（核心更新的稳定性条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-2-核心更新的稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，VP 采样的数值稳定实现须满足：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds)$</span> 在对数域计算，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod(1-\\beta_i)$</span> 的累积下溢；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;1-\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 时 clamp 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}}$</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时因相减抵消损失有效位；</p>\n<p>(iii) VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\log\\sigma_{\\min}+\\frac{t}{T}(\\log\\sigma_{\\max}-\\log\\sigma_{\\min}))$</span> 计算，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min})^{t/T}$</span> 在比值极大时溢出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span> 的定义直接取对数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds\\ge0$</span> 保证指数不溢出（上界由 (A1) 的有限积分给出）。(ii) 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in(0,1)$</span>。双精度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的相对误差约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}/\\delta$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&lt;\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 时该差值被舍入为零或失去全部有效位，故须以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 为下界 clamp。(iii) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sigma_{\\min}\\exp(\\frac{t}{T}\\log(\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min}))$</span>，对数域中间量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{t}{T}(\\log\\sigma_{\\max}-\\log\\sigma_{\\min})$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log(\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min}))$</span>，远小于直接幂运算的指数增长。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>稳定性条件 (ii) 的量化后果：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 距 1 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx2.2\\times10^{-16}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 的解析值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span>，数值实现给出同量级的下界，相对误差可控在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 但绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-8})$</span>，对采样分布的影响可忽略（该分支仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 极小时触发）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-3-可运行实现与断言\">命题 5.13.3（可运行实现与断言）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-3-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 下述代码在 numpy 下实现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}},F_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>，并通过三类断言：(a) 形状断言；(b) 数值等价断言（闭式 vs 独立路径）；(c) 边界/退化断言（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A3)；断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge10^{-6}$</span>，由双精度舍入与梯形积分的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 误差共同界定；解析期望值在块内用 sympy 计算，不硬编码。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）.</strong> 数值等价断言的解析侧由命题 5.13.1 的分布结论给出：VP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，VE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>。独立路径用 Monte Carlo 估计方差，样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span>，标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2/N}\\approx0.032$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span> 与解析方差比较。边界断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_0,0,\\varepsilon)=x_0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}=0$</span> 经 clamp 后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}}$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span>，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 覆盖）；VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=\\sigma_{\\min}$</span> 非零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 不退化，退化断言改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}\\to0$</span> 的极限情形单独检查。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd, T = 4, 1.0\nbeta_min, beta_max = 1e-2, 5.0\nsigma_min, sigma_max = 1e-2, 20.0\neps_mach = np.finfo(float).eps\n\ndef vp_alpha_bar(t, bmin=beta_min, bmax=beta_max, T=T):\n    # 线性 beta_s = bmin + (bmax-bmin) s/T, 积分闭式\n    return np.exp(-(bmin * t + 0.5 * (bmax - bmin) * t**2 / T))\n\ndef vp_sample(x0, t, eps):\n    ab = vp_alpha_bar(t)\n    ab = min(ab, 1.0 - eps_mach)          # 稳定性条件 (ii)\n    return np.sqrt(ab) * x0 + np.sqrt(1.0 - ab) * eps\n\ndef ve_sigma(t, smin=sigma_min, smax=sigma_max, T=T):\n    return np.exp(np.log(smin) + (t / T) * (np.log(smax) - np.log(smin)))  # (iii)\n\ndef ve_sample(x0, t, eps):\n    return x0 + ve_sigma(t) * eps\n\ndef snr(t):\n    ab = vp_alpha_bar(t)\n    return ab / (1.0 - ab)\n\n# (a) 形状断言\nx0 = rng.normal(size=(d,))\neps = rng.normal(size=(d,))\nassert x0.shape == (d,) and eps.shape == (d,)\nxt_vp = vp_sample(x0, 0.5, eps)\nxt_ve = ve_sample(x0, 0.5, eps)\nassert xt_vp.shape == (d,) and xt_ve.shape == (d,)\nprint(&quot;shape VP/VE:&quot;, xt_vp.shape, xt_ve.shape)\n\n# (b) 数值等价断言: 解析方差 vs Monte Carlo (3 sigma 容差)\nN = 2000\nE = rng.normal(size=(N, d))\nt = 0.5\nab = vp_alpha_bar(t)\nvar_vp_analytic = float(sp.simplify(1 - sp.exp(-(beta_min*t + sp.Rational(1,2)*(beta_max-beta_min)*t**2/T))))\nvar_vp_mc = np.var(vp_sample(np.zeros(d), t, E), axis=0).mean()\nassert abs(var_vp_mc - var_vp_analytic) &lt; 0.1, (var_vp_mc, var_vp_analytic)\nsig = ve_sigma(t)\nvar_ve_analytic = float(sp.simplify(sp.exp(2*(sp.log(sigma_min) + sp.Rational(1,2)*(sp.log(sigma_max)-sp.log(sigma_min))))))\nvar_ve_mc = np.var(ve_sample(np.zeros(d), t, E), axis=0).mean()\nassert abs(var_ve_mc - var_ve_analytic) &lt; 0.1, (var_ve_mc, var_ve_analytic)\nprint(&quot;var VP analytic/mc:&quot;, var_vp_analytic, var_vp_mc)\nprint(&quot;var VE analytic/mc:&quot;, var_ve_analytic, var_ve_mc)\n\n# (c) 边界/退化断言\n# t=0: VP 退化为 x0 (clamp 后残差 &lt;= 1e-6)\nx0_t0 = rng.normal(size=(d,))\nassert np.max(np.abs(vp_sample(x0_t0, 0.0, eps) - x0_t0)) &lt; 1e-6\n# SNR 单调递减: t1&lt;t2 =&gt; SNR(t1)&gt;SNR(t2)\nassert snr(0.1) &gt; snr(0.9)\n# SNR 解析式与 sympy 独立路径互验\nt_s = sp.Rational(1, 2)\nab_sym = sp.exp(-(sp.Rational(1,100)*t_s + sp.Rational(1,2)*(5 - sp.Rational(1,100))*t_s**2))\nsnr_sym = float(sp.simplify(ab_sym / (1 - ab_sym)))\nassert abs(snr(0.5) - snr_sym) &lt; 1e-6, (snr(0.5), snr_sym)\nprint(&quot;SNR(0.5) numeric/sympy:&quot;, snr(0.5), snr_sym)\nprint(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：形状 <code>(4,) (4,)</code>；VP 方差解析值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.918$</span>、MC 估计在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差内；VE 方差解析值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.040$</span>、MC 估计在容差内；<code>SNR(0.5)</code> 数值与 sympy 一致到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>；全部断言通过。误差量级：Monte Carlo 方差估计的标准差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.032$</span>，梯形积分（此处用闭式，无离散误差），浮点舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节实现的误差有三类。其一为 <strong>Monte Carlo 采样误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span> 时方差估计的标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2/N}\\approx0.032$</span>，故断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>（约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>），与误差阶匹配。其二为 <strong>浮点舍入</strong>：VP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 的相减抵消，经 clamp 后绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-8})$</span>，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 容差覆盖；VE 的对数域计算将相对误差控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>。其三为 <strong>积分离散误差</strong>：若改用数值积分而非闭式，梯形法的局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^3)$</span>、全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>，本节用闭式故该项为零，但代码保留了闭式与 sympy 符号计算两条独立路径互验，以排除实现错误而非数值误差。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>VP 与 VE 的闭式采样映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}},F_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 由命题 5.13.1 给出输入输出契约，其分布结论由仿射高斯不变性一步得到，无需额外正则性。</li>\n<li>数值稳定性由命题 5.13.2 的三条条件保证：对数域计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> clamp；缺任一条会在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 或尺度比极大时产生 NaN 或有效位丢失。</li>\n<li>命题 5.13.3 的代码以形状断言、解析 vs Monte Carlo 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差断言、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 退化断言三类检查实现，所有解析期望值由 sympy 在块内算出，容差与误差阶匹配。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-4-采样映射的逆与得分恒等式\">命题 5.13.4（采样映射的逆与得分恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-4-采样映射的逆与得分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 固定。则映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\mapsto F_{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\mapsto F_{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的仿射同胚，其逆映射显式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad \\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-x_0}{\\sigma_t},$$</div>\n<p>且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处闭式边缘的得分满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad \\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>；(A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处两映射均退化（VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}=0$</span>、VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=\\sigma_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 但 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}\\to0$</span> 时退化），故命题的逆映射陈述只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的情形由命题 5.13.1 的边界断言单独处理。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 两映射均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=A\\varepsilon+b$</span> 形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为标量乘单位阵，标量系数非零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可逆，逆映射即上式。得分恒等式：由命题 5.13.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，其对数密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|^2+\\mathrm{const}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>（末步用逆映射代入）。VE 同理，对数密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|x_t-x_0\\|^2+\\mathrm{const}$</span>，梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{x_t-x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}=-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\sigma_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题是本节与反向 SDE 章的接口：反向采样所需的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span> 在条件化于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性读出，故闭式采样器同时充当得分预言机的解析基准。代码中可加一条断言：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 应等于输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 到浮点精度，这验证了逆映射的数值可实现性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-5-时间重参数化下的采样一致性\">命题 5.13.5（时间重参数化下的采样一致性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-5-时间重参数化下的采样一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:[0,T]\\to[0,T]$</span> 为严格增的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_s=\\beta_{\\phi(s)}\\phi'(s)$</span>，则 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在重参数化下不变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\bar\\alpha}_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\tilde\\beta_s\\,ds}=\\bar\\alpha_{\\phi(t)}$</span>。对 VE，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_t=\\sigma_{\\phi(t)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma$</span> 仍满足 (A2)。因此采样映射在时间重参数化下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)=F_{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_0,\\phi(t),\\varepsilon)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)=F_{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_0,\\phi(t),\\varepsilon)$</span> 协变。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 严格增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(T)=T$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 满足 (A1)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 满足 (A2)。换元要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\phi(s)}\\phi'(s)$</span> 可积，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi'\\in C^0$</span> 有界与 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 可积保证。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 换元积分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\tilde\\beta_s\\,ds=\\int_0^t\\beta_{\\phi(s)}\\phi'(s)\\,ds=\\int_0^{\\phi(t)}\\beta_u\\,du$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\bar\\alpha}_t=\\exp(-\\int_0^{\\phi(t)}\\beta_u\\,du)=\\bar\\alpha_{\\phi(t)}$</span>。VE 的单调性与连续性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 严格增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 单调不减复合得到；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_0=\\sigma_{\\phi(0)}=\\sigma_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_T=\\sigma_T$</span> 保持端点条件。采样映射的协变性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的工程含义：噪声调度（第 9 节）本质上是选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span>，而采样器的闭式解只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\phi(t)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\phi(t)}$</span>，故调度改变不破坏采样器的正确性，只改变时间轴上各时刻的信噪比分布。代码中可断言：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(t)=t^2/T$</span>（满足端点条件），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\bar\\alpha}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t^2/T}$</span> 一致到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，用 sympy 符号积分独立验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-6-离散-DDPM-采样的连续极限\">命题 5.13.6（离散 DDPM 采样的连续极限）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-6-离散-DDPM-采样的连续极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 设离散 VP 链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{k}=\\sqrt{1-\\beta_k}\\,x_{k-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_k}\\,\\varepsilon_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1,\\dots,K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 独立标准高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_k\\in(0,1)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_K=\\prod_{k=1}^K(1-\\beta_k)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_K=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_K}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_K}\\,\\bar\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k\\beta_k\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\beta_k\\to\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_K$</span> 的分布依分布收敛到命题 5.13.1 的 VP 边缘。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_k\\in(0,1)$</span> 保证每步系数为正；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k\\beta_k\\to0$</span> 保证离散链的每步增量趋于零，从而 Lindeberg 条件对独立增量成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\beta_k$</span> 的收敛由 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 可积与 Riemann 和给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 展开递推：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_K=\\big(\\prod_{k=1}^K\\sqrt{1-\\beta_k}\\big)x_0+\\sum_{k=1}^K\\big(\\prod_{j=k+1}^K\\sqrt{1-\\beta_j}\\big)\\sqrt{\\beta_k}\\,\\varepsilon_k$</span>。第一项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_K}$</span>。第二项为独立高斯的线性组合，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\beta_k\\prod_{j=k+1}^K(1-\\beta_j)=1-\\prod_{k=1}^K(1-\\beta_k)=1-\\bar\\alpha_K$</span>（用望远镜恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_k\\prod_{j=k+1}^K(1-\\beta_j)=\\prod_{j=k+1}^K(1-\\beta_j)-\\prod_{j=k}^K(1-\\beta_j)$</span>，求和后首尾相消）。故第二项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_K}\\,\\bar\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\varepsilon$</span> 为标准高斯。连续极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_K=\\sum_k\\log(1-\\beta_k)=-\\sum_k\\beta_k+O(\\sum_k\\beta_k^2)$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k\\beta_k\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\beta_k\\to\\int\\beta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_K\\to\\bar\\alpha_T$</span>；Lindeberg 条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k\\beta_k\\to0$</span> 与方差有界满足，故高斯极限成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把第 11 节（与 DDPM 的对应）的结论落到可执行层面：代码中可构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=100$</span> 的离散链，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_K$</span> 的经验方差与闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_K$</span>，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\sqrt{2/N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.032$</span>），并断言望远镜恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\beta_k\\prod_{j=k+1}^K(1-\\beta_j)=1-\\bar\\alpha_K$</span> 在浮点下成立到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>（该恒等式为代数恒等，误差仅来自舍入，故容差可紧）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-7-VE-采样的尺度不变性与数值边界\">命题 5.13.7（VE 采样的尺度不变性与数值边界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-7-VE-采样的尺度不变性与数值边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 设 (A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\sigma_t$</span>，则 VE 采样映射变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VE}}^c(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)=x_0+c\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，其分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(x_0,c^2\\sigma_t^2I_d)$</span>；尺度变换与采样映射交换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VE}}^c(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)=F_{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_0,t,c\\varepsilon)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的对数域计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sigma_{\\min}+\\frac{t}{T}(\\log\\sigma_{\\max}-\\log\\sigma_{\\min})$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log c$</span> 为常数偏移，不改变数值稳定性；但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min}&gt;e^{700}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 差超出双精度指数范围，须对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 作归一化或分段。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A2)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>；数值边界陈述假设 IEEE-754 双精度的指数范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-745,709]$</span> 量级。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 交换性由线性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VE}}^c(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)=x_0+c\\sigma_t\\varepsilon=x_0+\\sigma_t(c\\varepsilon)=F_{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_0,t,c\\varepsilon)$</span>。分布结论由命题 5.13.1 的仿射高斯不变性取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=c\\sigma_tI_d$</span>。数值边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min})=\\log\\sigma_{\\max}-\\log\\sigma_{\\min}$</span>，当该值超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$709$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 溢出；对数域计算把该值作为中间量直接参与线性插值，不取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 后再除，故稳定性只受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 差本身的可表示性约束。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的实用推论：VE 的噪声尺度选择（第 9 节）应使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min})$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,700]$</span> 内，代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=10^{-2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\max}=20$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$7.6$</span>，远在安全区。断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VE}}^c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VE}}(x_0,t,c\\varepsilon)$</span> 逐元素相等到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>（纯代数恒等，仅舍入误差），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=10^3$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 不产生 inf/nan（用 <code>np.isfinite</code> 检查）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-8-采样器的可组合性与批处理形状契约\">命题 5.13.8（采样器的可组合性与批处理形状契约）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-8-采样器的可组合性与批处理形状契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times d}$</span> 为一批初始样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times d}$</span> 为一批噪声，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 为标量时间。则逐行应用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 等价于广播形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,X_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,E$</span>，输出形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 同理。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的向量，则须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>  reshape 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,1)$</span> 后再广播，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,)$</span> 的隐式广播会沿错误轴对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A3)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$B,d\\ge1$</span>；标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 或向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的元素均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 内。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 逐行应用：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}X_{0,b}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}E_b$</span>，与广播形式一致。形状：标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为标量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span> 与标量广播得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>；向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,)$</span>，若直接与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span> 运算，numpy 按尾轴对齐，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,)$</span> 会与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 轴广播（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\ne d$</span> 时报错，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=d$</span> 时静默错位），故须显式 reshape 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题是代码节的形状纪律来源：本节代码只处理标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与单样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(d,)$</span>，批处理版本在后续节展开；此处给出契约以保证接口一致。断言：标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>；向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 经 reshape 后与逐行循环结果逐元素相等到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>（纯代数，仅舍入）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\ne d$</span> 时未 reshape 的直接广播触发 <code>ValueError</code>，用 <code>try/except</code> 捕获并断言异常类型。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-9-采样器的舍入误差累积界\">命题 5.13.9（采样器的舍入误差累积界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-9-采样器的舍入误差累积界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 在双精度下计算，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 的每个分量相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。则输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 每个分量的绝对误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|x_t-\\hat x_t|\\le\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}|x_0|+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}|\\varepsilon|\\big)+O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_t$</span> 为浮点计算结果。VE 同理，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A3)；IEEE-754 双精度的基本运算满足标准舍入模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{fl}(a\\circ b)=(a\\circ b)(1+\\delta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta|\\le\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 逐项应用舍入模型：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{fl}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0(1+\\delta_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{fl}(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon(1+\\delta_2)$</span>，加法再引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_3$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x_t-\\hat x_t|\\le\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}|x_0|+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}|\\varepsilon|)+O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该界说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span>）时误差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|x_0|$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 同量级；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>）时主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|\\varepsilon|$</span>。故采样器的绝对误差始终为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\max(|x_0|,|\\varepsilon|))$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关地有界。断言：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x_0|,|\\varepsilon|\\le10$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{0.01,0.5,0.99\\}$</span>，浮点结果与 sympy 高精度（<code>sp.N(..., 50)</code>）结果之差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-14}$</span>，该容差由上述界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x_0|,|\\varepsilon|\\le10$</span> 时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10\\cdot\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx2.2\\times10^{-15}$</span> 的量级推出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-5-13-10-采样器与得分预言机的接口一致性\">命题 5.13.10（采样器与得分预言机的接口一致性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-5-13-10-采样器与得分预言机的接口一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为任意得分估计器。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 在闭式边缘上精确，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，则对任意由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}}(x_0,t,\\varepsilon)$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\varepsilon$</span>（条件化于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>）。反之，若对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 该等式成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的支撑上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A3)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,T]$</span> 上连续；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的支撑为全空间（高斯，无退化）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 正向：由命题 5.13.4 的得分恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\int p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)p_0(x_0)\\,dx_0$</span>，其得分不等于条件得分的一般情形下，等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}s_\\theta=-\\varepsilon$</span> 只对条件得分成立；故命题陈述须限定为“条件化于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的得分”，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 是条件得分预言机。反向：若等式对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与条件得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 的支撑上一致；由于高斯支撑为全空间且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 任意，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在全空间一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题澄清了一个常见混淆：无条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span> 不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，后者是条件得分。代码中断言：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 相等到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>（代数恒等），但若把该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 当作无条件得分代入，与数值微分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是无条件边缘，其得分含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的边缘化贡献），故不得混淆两者。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-代码-调度对密度的影响\">代码：调度对密度的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-代码-调度对密度的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 为 VP 的噪声速率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为 VE 的噪声尺度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。本节只处理一维标准高斯初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，因为在此情形下 VP 与 VE 的边缘密度均有闭式解，便于把“调度改变”对密度的影响量化到可断言的精度。</p>\n<p>固定时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记 VP 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\mathcal N(0,\\bar\\alpha_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，这是本章第 4 节闭式解的退化情形：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 时 VP 边缘在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上恒为标准正态，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的具体形状无关。VE 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}=\\mathcal N(0,1+\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，其方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 单调增。因此“调度对密度的影响”在 VP 上表现为：不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 调度给出相同的边缘密度但不同的信噪比轨迹；在 VE 上表现为：不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 调度直接改变边缘方差。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号仅有离散调度表：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个离散时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\dots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，VP 调度写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}\\}_{i=0}^N$</span>，VE 调度写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\sigma_{t_i}\\}_{i=0}^N$</span>。数值实验取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=200$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2000$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 14.1（数值实验的正则性）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta&gt;0$</span> 常数（线性 VP 调度）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta_0+\\beta_1 t$</span>（二次 VP 调度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0,\\beta_1&gt;0$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sigma_{\\min}((\\sigma_{\\max}/\\sigma_{\\min})^{t/T}-1)^{1/2}$</span> 型几何插值（VE 常用形式）与线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sigma_{\\min}+(\\sigma_{\\max}-\\sigma_{\\min})t/T$</span>。所有参数有限且正，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\in[\\sigma_{\\min},\\sigma_{\\max}]$</span>，从而本节所有密度均为良定义的概率密度，KL 散度有限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-离散调度的闭式密度\">离散调度的闭式密度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-离散调度的闭式密度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对 VP，由本章第 4 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_i}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_i}\\sim\\mathcal N\\!\\left(0,\\ \\bar\\alpha_{t_i}+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i})\\right)=\\mathcal N(0,1).$$</div>\n<p>故 VP 的离散边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}e^{-x^2/2}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 相同。对 VE，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_i}=x_0+\\sigma_{t_i}\\varepsilon$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_i^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi(1+\\sigma_{t_i}^2)}}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{x^2}{2(1+\\sigma_{t_i}^2)}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>两个密度都是显式可算的，下面的代码直接对它们采样并与理论矩比对。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-数值契约与稳定性\">数值契约与稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-数值契约与稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：调度数组 <code>abar</code>（形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,)$</span>，取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span>）、<code>sigma</code>（形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,)$</span>，取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0$</span>）、样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>、随机种子。输出：VP 与 VE 在末时刻的样本数组（形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M,)$</span>），以及若干统计量。数值稳定性上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}\\to1$</span> 无奇点；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 很大时密度指数项需防止下溢，用对数域计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 后再取指数，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|$</span> 做截断以避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 溢出。VE 的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\sigma^2$</span> 用 <code>np.hypot(1.0, sigma)</code> 平方计算以防 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 溢出。</p>\n<p>核心更新即采样公式本身，无迭代，故无稳定性条件需要额外推导；但断言必须由闭式矩推出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_{t_i}^{\\mathrm{VP}}]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_{t_i}^{\\mathrm{VP}})=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_{t_i}^{\\mathrm{VE}})=1+\\sigma_{t_i}^2$</span>。Monte Carlo 误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2000$</span> 时标准差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{2000}\\approx0.022$</span>，故方差断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\times0.022\\approx0.07$</span> 量级，绝不用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# ---- 调度构造 ----\nN, T = 200, 1.0\nt = np.linspace(0.0, T, N + 1)                      # shape (201,)\nbeta_lin = 0.5                                       # 常数速率\nabar_lin = np.exp(-beta_lin * t)                     # VP 线性调度, shape (201,)\nbeta0, beta1 = 0.2, 1.0\nabar_quad = np.exp(-(beta0 * t + 0.5 * beta1 * t**2))# VP 二次调度\nsigma_min, sigma_max = 0.01, 5.0\nsigma_geo = sigma_min * (sigma_max / sigma_min) ** (t / T)  # VE 几何\nsigma_lin = sigma_min + (sigma_max - sigma_min) * (t / T)   # VE 线性\n\n# ---- 采样 ----\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nM = 2000\nx0 = rng.standard_normal(M)                          # shape (2000,)\neps = rng.standard_normal(M)                         # 独立噪声\n# VP 末时刻: x_T = sqrt(abar_T) x0 + sqrt(1-abar_T) eps\naT = abar_lin[-1]\nx_vp = np.sqrt(aT) * x0 + np.sqrt(1.0 - aT) * eps    # shape (2000,)\n# VE 末时刻: x_T = x0 + sigma_T eps\nsT = sigma_geo[-1]\nx_ve = x0 + sT * eps                                 # shape (2000,)\n\n# ---- 解析矩 ----\nvar_vp_theory = 1.0\nvar_ve_theory = 1.0 + sT**2\nprint(&quot;shape x_vp:&quot;, x_vp.shape, &quot;shape x_ve:&quot;, x_ve.shape)\nprint(&quot;VP var:&quot;, np.var(x_vp), &quot;theory:&quot;, var_vp_theory)\nprint(&quot;VE var:&quot;, np.var(x_ve), &quot;theory:&quot;, var_ve_theory)\n\n# ---- 断言 1: 形状 ----\nassert x_vp.shape == (M,) and x_ve.shape == (M,)\n\n# ---- 断言 2: VP 边缘方差恒为 1（闭式解） ----\n# 解析值 1.0; MC 误差 3σ ≈ 3/sqrt(2000) ≈ 0.067\nassert abs(np.var(x_vp) - 1.0) &lt; 0.07\n\n# ---- 断言 3: VE 边缘方差 = 1 + sigma_T^2（闭式解） ----\n# 解析值 1 + 5^2 = 26; MC 误差 3σ ≈ 3*26/sqrt(2000) ≈ 1.74\nassert abs(np.var(x_ve) - (1.0 + sT**2)) &lt; 1.8\n\n# ---- 断言 4: 不同 VP 调度在 t=T 给出相同边缘密度 ----\n# abar_lin[-1] = exp(-0.5) ≈ 0.6065; abar_quad[-1] = exp(-(0.2+0.5)) ≈ 0.4966\n# 两者 x_T 的方差均为 1，故样本均值差应在 MC 误差内\nx_vp_quad = np.sqrt(abar_quad[-1]) * x0 + np.sqrt(1.0 - abar_quad[-1]) * eps\nassert abs(np.mean(x_vp) - np.mean(x_vp_quad)) &lt; 0.07\n\n# ---- 断言 5: SNR 单调性 ----\nsnr_lin = abar_lin / (1.0 - abar_lin)                # shape (201,)\nassert np.all(np.diff(snr_lin) &lt; 0)                  # t 增则 SNR 减\nprint(&quot;SNR[0], SNR[-1]:&quot;, snr_lin[0], snr_lin[-1])\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape x_vp: (2000,) shape x_ve: (2000,)</code>；VP 方差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.00\\pm0.02$</span>，VE 方差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$26.0\\pm1.5$</span>；<code>SNR[0]</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，实际代码中为 <code>inf</code>），<code>SNR[-1]</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.54$</span>。误差量级为 Monte Carlo 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span>，所有断言容差均按此阶设定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-误差来源与量级\">误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值误差有三类。第一类是 Monte Carlo 抽样误差，方差估计的标准差约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2/M}\\cdot\\mathrm{Var}$</span>，对 VP 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.03$</span>，对 VE 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.8$</span>，断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 已覆盖。第二类是浮点舍入，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时前者接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、后者接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，相对误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>，可忽略。第三类是密度求值的下溢，若直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-x^2/2(1+\\sigma^2)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=20$</span> 时指数约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-8$</span>，无下溢风险；更大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 时须转对数域，本节参数范围内不需要。三类误差中只有第一类影响断言，且容差已按其阶设定。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 时，VP 边缘密度对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，调度只改变信噪比轨迹而不改变边缘密度；VE 边缘密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,1+\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，调度直接决定方差轨迹。</li>\n<li>数值契约要求采样公式与闭式矩逐项对应，断言容差必须由 Monte Carlo 误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span> 推出，禁止用固定极小容差卡随机量。</li>\n<li>不同 VP 调度在末时刻给出相同边缘分布这一事实，是本章第 6 节时间重参数化与第 11 节 DDPM 对应的数值体现：调度改变的是路径而非终点密度。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-14-2-VP-调度不变性的精确表述\">命题 14.2（VP 调度不变性的精确表述）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-14-2-VP-调度不变性的精确表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，VP 边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的具体形状无关；信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 则依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由本章第 4 节闭式边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立。两个独立高斯之和仍为高斯，其均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(x_t)=\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathrm{Var}(x_0)+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\mathrm{Var}(\\varepsilon)=\\bar\\alpha_t\\cdot1+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\cdot1=1.$$</div>\n<p>方差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 无关，故与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 的表达式显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds$</span> 决定，故依赖调度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题解释了断言 2 与断言 4 的数值事实：两个不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 给出相同的边缘方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，因而样本均值差落在 Monte Carlo 误差内。注意命题只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 成立；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为一般分布，VP 边缘方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathrm{Var}(x_0)+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，此时调度会通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 改变方差，断言 2 不再成立。这是本节把初始分布限定为标准高斯的实质原因，也是命题假设中必须显式写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-14-3-VE-调度对方差的单调控制\">命题 14.3（VE 调度对方差的单调控制）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-14-3-VE-调度对方差的单调控制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t:[0,T]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 连续且严格单调增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立标准高斯。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong> VE 边缘方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(t)=1+\\sigma_t^2$</span> 严格单调增，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(t)-v(s)=\\sigma_t^2-\\sigma_s^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由本章第 5 节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，独立高斯之和的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\sigma_t^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 严格增故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 严格增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 严格增。差值直接相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出断言 3 的解析依据：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T=5$</span>，故方差解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$26$</span>。同时它说明 VE 的调度选择直接等价于选择方差轨迹，这与 VP 形成对照：VP 的调度选择等价于选择信噪比轨迹而非方差轨迹。两者在“调度影响什么”上的差异，正是本章第 7 节方差保持与方差爆炸命名的数学内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-14-4-信噪比的严格单调性与端点行为\">命题 14.4（信噪比的严格单调性与端点行为）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-14-4-信噪比的严格单调性与端点行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上严格单调减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\to0^+}\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=\\bar\\alpha_T/(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}\\in(0,1]$</span>。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(a)=a/(1-a)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上严格增（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(a)=1/(1-a)^2&gt;0$</span>）。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)$</span> 严格减（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 使积分严格增，指数严格减），故复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(a(t))$</span> 严格减。端点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\to1^-$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(a)\\to+\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\bar\\alpha_T\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题支撑断言 5：<code>np.diff(snr_lin) &lt; 0</code> 对全部相邻时刻成立。端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=+\\infty$</span> 在代码中表现为 <code>inf</code>，这是浮点除零的自然结果而非数值错误；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)$</span> 的解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-0.5}/(1-e^{-0.5})\\approx1.5415$</span>，与打印值一致。命题同时说明为什么 VP 的调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近必须谨慎：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 发散意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处信噪比无界，任何以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 为自变量的重参数化都需在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处单独处理，这正是本章第 6 节时间重参数化讨论的动机。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-命题-14-5-KL-散度的有限性条件\">命题 14.5（KL 散度的有限性条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-命题-14-5-KL-散度的有限性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的正质量集，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x:p(x)&gt;0\\}\\subseteq\\{x:q(x)&gt;0\\}$</span> 至多差一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-零测集。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong> 在此假设下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\int p\\log(p/q)&lt;\\infty$</span>；若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 正质量集上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在假设下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑上处处有限且正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p/q)$</span> 可积当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p|\\log(p/q)|$</span> 可积；对高斯对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(0,v_p)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(0,v_q)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac12(\\frac{v_p}{v_q}-1+\\log\\frac{v_q}{v_p})$</span> 有限。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 正质量处为零，则被积函数在正测度集上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>本节数值实验中 VP 与 VE 的边缘均为非退化高斯，支撑为全实轴，故任意两个调度对应的密度 KL 均有限，断言中不出现无穷。这一命题的作用是划清边界：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}$</span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的边缘退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 的高斯密度支撑不相交，KL 发散；本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=0.01&gt;0$</span> 正是为避免此退化，保证所有断言在有限 KL 框架内成立。这也回应了假设纪律中“KL 为无穷只在支撑不相交时成立”的要求。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-数值契约的逐项核对\">数值契约的逐项核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-数值契约的逐项核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>回到代码块，逐行核对契约。<code>abar_lin</code> 与 <code>abar_quad</code> 形状均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(201,)$</span>，取值分别落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e^{-0.5},1]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e^{-0.7},1]$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span> 约束。<code>sigma_geo</code> 与 <code>sigma_lin</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(201,)$</span>，端点分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5$</span>，严格增，满足命题 14.3 假设。<code>x0</code> 与 <code>eps</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2000,)$</span>，独立抽样，满足命题 14.2 与 14.3 的独立性假设。<code>x_vp</code> 与 <code>x_ve</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2000,)$</span>，由广播前的显式逐元素运算构造，无隐式广播风险。断言 1 核对形状；断言 2、3 核对闭式方差，容差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma_{\\mathrm{MC}}$</span> 设定；断言 4 核对两个 VP 调度的均值等价，容差同阶；断言 5 核对 SNR 单调性，由命题 14.4 保证。所有断言的期望值均由本节命题手算得出，无一对随机初始化后的收敛结果做严格断言。</p>\n<p>误差量级上，VP 方差估计的标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2/2000}\\cdot1\\approx0.032$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma\\approx0.095$</span>，断言取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.07$</span> 略紧于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 但仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.2\\sigma$</span> 内，实际运行中种子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 下通过；若换种子偶有失败，属正常统计波动，不应放宽容差而应换种子重跑，这是 Monte Carlo 断言的正确用法。VE 方差估计标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2/2000}\\cdot26\\approx0.82$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma\\approx2.47$</span>，断言取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.8$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.2\\sigma$</span> 内，同理。两类容差均由误差阶推出，非凭直觉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-与反向-SDE-章的接口\">与反向 SDE 章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-与反向-SDE-章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号，不引入新的生成过程记号，仅对“接口对象”作最小补充并列入下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>定义处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span></td>\n<td>干净数据，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span></td>\n<td>第 1 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span></td>\n<td>VP 的非负速率函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span></td>\n<td>第 1 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span></td>\n<td>第 1 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span></td>\n<td>VE 的噪声尺度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\sigma_t$</span> 连续且严格递增</td>\n<td>第 2 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span></td>\n<td>第 4 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span></td>\n<td>第 5 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span></td>\n<td>第 6 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span></td>\n<td>时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为数据密度</td>\n<td>第 4、5 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)$</span></td>\n<td>得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span></td>\n<td>本节定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)$</span></td>\n<td>概率流 ODE 的速度场</td>\n<td>本节定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t(x)$</span></td>\n<td>反向 SDE 的漂移场</td>\n<td>本节定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span></td>\n<td>反向 SDE 的扩散系数</td>\n<td>本节定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列出，后文命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1) 数据正则性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|\\nabla\\log p_0(x)\\|^2p_0(x)\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 具有紧支撑或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_0(x)\\|$</span> 在无穷远处至多多项式增长。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2) 速率正则性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续、严格递增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3) 边缘正则性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2p_t\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\log p_t)$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 加权下可积，使得 Fokker–Planck 方程逐点成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4) 可交换性.</strong> 在需要交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int$</span> 的步骤中，被积函数被一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(p_t)$</span> 控制函数支配；本节情境下由 (H1)–(H3) 与高斯核的显式衰减保证。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本章情境下为何成立：VP 与 VE 的转移核均为高斯，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_0*N(0,\\Sigma_t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 的，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 可积，(H3) 中光滑性自动满足；(H1) 的得分平方可积性是反向 SDE 章构造 Girsanov 测度的最低要求；(H4) 由高斯核的显式界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_x \\log p_t(x)\\|\\le C_t(1+\\|x\\|)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的指数衰减给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口一-得分函数在两族扩散中的显式表达\">接口一：得分函数在两族扩散中的显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口一-得分函数在两族扩散中的显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（得分函数）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘密度。得分函数定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x):=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x),\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,\\ t\\in(0,T].$$</div>\n<p>它与“漂移场”的区别在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 是密度对数的梯度，与具体 SDE 的参数化无关；而反向 SDE 的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 与扩散系数的组合。混同二者是本接口要排除的第一个错误。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（VP 与 VE 的得分闭式）.</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[\\varepsilon\\,\\middle|\\,x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=x\\right],$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[\\varepsilon\\,\\middle|\\,x_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}=x\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中条件期望按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>（VP）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>（VE）定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim N(0,I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_0$</span> 独立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 只证 VP，VE 同构。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span>。由第 4 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=p_0*N(0,\\Sigma_t^{\\mathrm{VP}})$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_0(y)\\,\\varphi_t(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}y)\\,dy,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_t(z)=(2\\pi(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))^{-d/2}\\exp(-\\|z\\|^2/(2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)))$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求梯度并在积分号下求导（Leibniz 法则，(H4) 保证可交换）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=\\int p_0(y)\\,\\nabla_x\\varphi_t(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}y)\\,dy.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\varphi_t(z)=-\\frac{z}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varphi_t(z)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\int p_0(y)\\,(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}y)\\,\\varphi_t(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}y)\\,dy.$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)$</span>，并注意被积函数中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}y)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 正是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件分布下的取值（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}y=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\int p_0(y)\\,\\varepsilon\\,\\varphi_t(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}y)\\,dy}{p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)}=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=x].$$</div>\n<p>最后一个等号是条件期望的定义式：分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与联合密度的乘积对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的积分，分母为边缘密度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（得分与 SNR 的恒等式）.</strong> 在命题 1 的条件下，VP 得分满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)\\|^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\left\\|\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=x]\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>（退化数据）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=x]=(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，从而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad \\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一式由命题 1 两边取范数平方即得。退化情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 是确定值，代入命题 1 得第二式；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的定义由第 6 节给出，此处仅引用。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：在退化数据下，VP 得分是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的仿射函数，其斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 与 SNR 的倒数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)^{-1}\\cdot\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1}$</span> 一致。第 13 节代码将用此式做数值校验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口二-反向-SDE-的漂移与概率流-ODE-的速度\">接口二：反向 SDE 的漂移与概率流 ODE 的速度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口二-反向-SDE-的漂移与概率流-ODE-的速度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 2（反向 SDE 漂移与概率流速度）.</strong> 设前向 SDE 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t=f_t(x_t)\\,dt+g_t\\,dW_t,$$</div>\n<p>其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>。反向 SDE（时间倒流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow 0$</span>）定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t=\\bigl[f_t(x_t)-g_t^2\\,s_t(x_t)\\bigr]\\,dt+g_t\\,d\\bar W_t,$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t(x):=f_t(x)-g_t^2 s_t(x)$</span>。概率流 ODE 定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dx_t}{dt}=v_t(x_t):=f_t(x_t)-\\tfrac12 g_t^2\\,s_t(x_t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 2（两族扩散的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(f_t,g_t)$</span> 与接口恒等式）.</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) VP：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\,s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x),\\qquad v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\,s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x).$$</div>\n<p>(ii) VE：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\sqrt{2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t=d\\sigma_t/dt$</span>），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=-2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t\\,s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x),\\qquad v_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=-\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t\\,s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x).$$</div>\n<p>(iii) 接口恒等式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b_t(x)=v_t(x)-\\tfrac12 g_t^2\\,s_t(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 由第 1 节 VP-SDE 的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,dW_t$</span> 直接读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t,g_t$</span>；代入定义 2 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span>。(ii) 由第 2 节 VE-SDE 的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=\\sqrt{2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t}\\,dW_t$</span>（等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的连续时间版本）读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\sqrt{2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t}$</span>；代入得 (ii)。(iii) 由定义 2：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b_t-v_t=\\bigl(f_t-g_t^2s_t\\bigr)-\\bigl(f_t-\\tfrac12g_t^2s_t\\bigr)=-\\tfrac12g_t^2s_t.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2(iii) 是本接口的核心恒等式：反向 SDE 漂移与概率流速度之差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12 g_t^2 s_t$</span>，即“噪声项”的一半。这排除了把二者当作同一对象的错误——二者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=0$</span> 时重合，而两族扩散的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 均非零（VP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 时）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口三-Fokker-Planck-方程与得分演化的相容性\">接口三：Fokker–Planck 方程与得分演化的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口三-Fokker-Planck-方程与得分演化的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（Fokker–Planck 与得分接口）.</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，VP 与 VE 的边缘密度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(f_t p_t)+\\tfrac12 g_t^2\\,\\Delta p_t,$$</div>\n<p>且等价地</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot\\bigl(p_t\\,v_t\\bigr),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=f_t-\\tfrac12 g_t^2 s_t$</span> 为定义 2 的概率流速度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一式是标准 Fokker–Planck 方程，在 (H3) 下逐点成立（扩散项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g_t^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\log p_t)=\\Delta p_t$</span> 得到）。第二式：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 代入，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=-\\nabla\\cdot\\bigl(p_tf_t-\\tfrac12g_t^2p_t s_t\\bigr)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf_t)+\\tfrac12g_t^2\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\log p_t).$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\log p_t)=\\nabla\\cdot(\\nabla p_t)=\\Delta p_t$</span>，故第二式与第一式恒等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：概率流 ODE 的速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 恰好使连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=0$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 生成与扩散相同的边缘路径。这正是“与 Flow 的接口”（第 12 节）的数学基础，本节只给出接口恒等式，不展开 Flow 侧内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口四-时间重参数化下的不变性\">接口四：时间重参数化下的不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口四-时间重参数化下的不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（时间重参数化下的得分变换）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\tau(t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\to[0,T']$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格递增映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(0)=0$</span>。在 (H1)–(H3) 下，若将 VP 的时间变量替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，则得分函数按</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\tau^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)\\cdot\\frac{d\\tau}{dt}\\Big/\\!\\frac{d\\bar\\alpha_\\tau}{d\\tau}\\cdot\\frac{d\\bar\\alpha_t}{dt}$$</div>\n<p>变换；特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为线性重标度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=ct$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(\\tau)=\\bar\\alpha_{ct}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{ct})$</span>，得分形式不变，仅参数被重标度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由第 6 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_sds}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau(t)}=e^{-\\int_0^{\\tau(t)}\\beta_sds}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau(t)}=-\\beta_{\\tau(t)}\\dot\\tau(t)\\,\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau(t)}.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\bar\\alpha_t=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。两式相除得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau}}{d\\tau}=\\frac{d\\bar\\alpha_t}{dt}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\dot\\tau}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\tau}=\\beta_t$</span> 的线性重标度下）。代入命题 1 的得分表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}$</span> 因子按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的链式法则变换，得所述变换。线性重标度情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=ct$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\tau=c$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{ct}=e^{-c\\int_0^t\\beta_sds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 仅以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 重标度，得分函数形式不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的用途：第 6 节的时间重参数化（如 VP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 参数化与 VE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 参数化）在得分层面是协变的，故反向 SDE 章可以在任一参数化下构造 Girsanov 测度而不改变扩散的弱解。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口五-离散-DDPM-与连续-SDE-的得分一致性\">接口五：离散 DDPM 与连续 SDE 的得分一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口五-离散-DDPM-与连续-SDE-的得分一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（DDPM 得分与连续 VP 得分的相容）.</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，设离散 DDPM 的步长为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>，噪声调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_k}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}=e^{-\\sum_{j\\le k}\\beta_{t_j}\\Delta t}$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时，离散 DDPM 的参数化得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_{t_k}(x)=-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t_k)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span> 依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_{t_k})$</span> 收敛到命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)$</span>，且反向 SDE 的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 的 Euler–Maruyama 离散依概率收敛到连续反向 SDE 的解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤.</strong> (a) 由第 8 节，离散转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_k}\\mid x_{t_{k-1}})=N(\\sqrt{1-\\beta_{t_k}}x_{t_{k-1}},\\beta_{t_k}I)$</span> 的复合给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 的乘积形式，与连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int\\beta}$</span> 的 Euler 乘积一致，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>。(b) 由第 11 节，DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-参数化得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s=-\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}$</span> 在最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 下等于命题 1 的条件期望形式；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时条件期望的核为高斯，由 (H4) 控制收敛得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛。(c) Euler–Maruyama 的强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>（漂移 Lipschitz、扩散常数），在 (H2) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 连续有界，故收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是“与 DDPM 的对应”（第 11 节）在接口层面的收尾：离散训练目标的最优解就是连续得分，故反向 SDE 章的连续时间构造可直接用于离散训练出的网络，无需重新参数化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-代码校验-接口恒等式与得分闭式\">代码校验：接口恒等式与得分闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-代码校验-接口恒等式与得分闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 1 的退化数据得分闭式、命题 2(iii) 的接口恒等式，以及命题 5 的离散–连续一致性（以有限步近似）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nd = 4\nT = 1.0\nbeta = 0.1\nabar = np.exp(-beta * T)\nsigma = np.sqrt(1.0 - abar)\nx0 = np.array([0.3, -0.2, 0.5, 0.1])\n\n# 命题 1 退化数据得分闭式\ndef score_vp_degenerate(x, abar, x0):\n    return -(x - np.sqrt(abar) * x0) / (1.0 - abar)\n\nx = np.sqrt(abar) * x0 + sigma * np.array([0.7, -0.4, 0.2, 0.9])\ns = score_vp_degenerate(x, abar, x0)\neps_cond = (x - np.sqrt(abar) * x0) / sigma\nassert np.allclose(s, -eps_cond / sigma), &quot;命题 1 得分闭式校验失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;score shape:&quot;, s.shape, &quot;expected:&quot;, (d,))\nprint(&quot;score:&quot;, s)\n\n# 命题 2(iii) 接口恒等式\ng_vp = np.sqrt(beta)\nv_vp = -0.5 * beta * x - 0.5 * beta * s\nb_vp = -0.5 * beta * x - beta * s\nassert np.allclose(b_vp - v_vp, -0.5 * g_vp**2 * s), &quot;接口恒等式校验失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;b-v shape:&quot;, (b_vp - v_vp).shape, &quot;expected:&quot;, (d,))\nprint(&quot;b-v:&quot;, b_vp - v_vp)\n\n# 命题 5 离散–连续一致性（Euler 乘积近似 abar）\nn_steps = 1000\ndt = T / n_steps\nabar_disc = np.prod([np.exp(-beta * dt) for _ in range(n_steps)])\nassert abs(abar_disc - abar) &lt; 1e-10, &quot;离散–连续 abar 一致性校验失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;abar_disc:&quot;, abar_disc, &quot;abar:&quot;, abar, &quot;diff:&quot;, abs(abar_disc - abar))\n\n# VE 得分闭式（退化数据）\nsigma_ve = 0.8\ns_ve = -(x - x0) / sigma_ve**2\neps_ve = (x - x0) / sigma_ve\nassert np.allclose(s_ve, -eps_ve / sigma_ve), &quot;VE 得分闭式校验失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;s_ve shape:&quot;, s_ve.shape, &quot;expected:&quot;, (d,))\nprint(&quot;s_ve:&quot;, s_ve)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：<code>score shape: (4,) expected: (4,)</code>；<code>b-v shape: (4,) expected: (4,)</code>；<code>abar_disc</code> 与 <code>abar</code> 之差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>；<code>s_ve shape: (4,) expected: (4,)</code>。所有 assert 通过，验证了命题 1、命题 2(iii) 与命题 5 的离散–连续一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 与反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t$</span>、概率流速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 是三个不同对象；接口恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=v_t-\\tfrac12g_t^2s_t$</span> 精确刻画了它们的差，两族扩散的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(f_t,g_t)$</span> 与得分闭式由命题 1、命题 2 给出。</li>\n<li>Fokker–Planck 方程在得分层面等价于连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tp_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=0$</span>，故概率流 ODE 与反向 SDE 共享同一边缘路径；时间重参数化下得分按命题 4 协变，反向 SDE 章的 Girsanov 构造可在任一参数化下进行。</li>\n<li>离散 DDPM 的最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-参数化得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 收敛到连续 VP 得分，Euler–Maruyama 离散依概率收敛到连续反向 SDE 的解；故反向 SDE 章的连续时间理论可直接对接离散训练出的网络。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口六-反向-SDE-的-Girsanov-密度与得分可积性\">接口六：反向 SDE 的 Girsanov 密度与得分可积性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口六-反向-SDE-的-Girsanov-密度与得分可积性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>反向 SDE 章的核心构造是在路径空间上把前向过程测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 变为反向过程测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>，其 Radon–Nikodym 导数由 Girsanov 定理给出。本接口要说明：该构造所需的全部可积性条件，恰好由本章的闭式边缘与得分表达式显式验证，而不必依赖抽象假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（反向 SDE 的 Girsanov 密度）.</strong> 设前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 满足定义 2 的 SDE，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_{t\\in[0,T]}g_t&gt;0$</span>，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 (H3)，得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\|g_t\\,s_t(x_t)\\|^2\\right]dt&lt;\\infty.$$</div>\n<p>则反向 SDE 的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上的路径测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 关于前向路径测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 绝对连续，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d\\mathbb{Q}}{d\\mathbb{P}}=\\exp\\!\\left(-\\int_0^T g_t\\,s_t(x_t)\\,dW_t-\\tfrac12\\int_0^T g_t^2\\|s_t(x_t)\\|^2dt\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t$</span> 为前向布朗运动。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 这是 Girsanov 定理在漂移变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta f_t=-g_t^2s_t$</span> 下的标准形式。需验证 Novikov 条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp\\!\\bigl(\\tfrac12\\int_0^T\\|g_t^2s_t(x_t)\\|^2dt\\bigr)&lt;\\infty$</span>。由 (H1) 与高斯核的显式界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t(x)\\|\\le C_t(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下具有有限二阶矩（VP：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2+d(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>；VE：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2+d\\sigma_t^2$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\mathbb{E}\\|g_t s_t\\|^2dt&lt;\\infty$</span> 由命题 6 的假设直接给出；Novikov 条件由该假设与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 的有界性（(H2) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 连续有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有界）推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（两族扩散的得分可积性显式验证）.</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) VP：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}}\\|s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}\\|^2=\\dfrac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb{E}\\|\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2\\le\\dfrac{d}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\dfrac{\\beta_t\\,d}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}dt&lt;\\infty$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) VE：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}}\\|s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}\\|^2\\le\\dfrac{d}{\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\dfrac{2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t\\,d}{\\sigma_t^2}dt=2d\\log\\dfrac{\\sigma_T}{\\sigma_0}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span> 时有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}\\|^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1}\\|\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2$</span>，条件期望的范数平方不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span>（Jensen 不等式），故第一不等式成立。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)dt$</span>，作变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$du=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_tdt$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\bar\\alpha_T}^1\\dfrac{du}{u(1-u)}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=0$</span> 处发散，故有限当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>。(ii) 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}\\|^2=\\sigma_t^{-2}\\|\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2\\le d/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T 2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t\\cdot d/\\sigma_t^2dt=2d\\int_0^T\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_tdt=2d\\log(\\sigma_T/\\sigma_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span> 时有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 给出一个可操作的判据：VP 的 Girsanov 构造要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_sds&lt;\\infty$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 不衰减），则得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时爆炸，Novikov 条件失效。这正是第 10 节反例节要处理的边界情形，本节只指出接口条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口七-反向-SDE-漂移的-Lipschitz-性与-Euler-Maruyama-收敛\">接口七：反向 SDE 漂移的 Lipschitz 性与 Euler–Maruyama 收敛<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口七-反向-SDE-漂移的-Lipschitz-性与-Euler-Maruyama-收敛\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>反向 SDE 章在构造数值解时要求漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。本接口把这一要求落到两族扩散的显式得分上，并给出收敛阶。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（漂移的 Lipschitz 界）.</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_0$</span> 全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>：</p>\n<p>(i) VP：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\tfrac12\\beta_t+\\beta_t\\,L/(\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>（在退化数据下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=\\tfrac12\\beta_t+\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>）。</p>\n<p>(ii) VE：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)=-2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t\\,s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}=2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t\\,L/\\sigma_t^2$</span>（在退化数据下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}=2\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 线性项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\beta_t$</span>。得分项：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1/2}\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]$</span>，而条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数是高斯卷积的得分，其 Lipschitz 常数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_0$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数（高斯核的平滑使得分更光滑），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L/(\\bar\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 量级；乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 得所述界。退化数据下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 为仿射，Lipschitz 常数精确为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。(ii) 同理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VE}}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t$</span> 得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（Euler–Maruyama 强收敛阶）.</strong> 在命题 7 的条件下，反向 SDE 的 Euler–Maruyama 离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}^{\\Delta}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl[\\sup_{0\\le k\\le N}\\|x_{t_k}^{\\Delta}-x_{t_k}\\|^2\\Bigr]^{1/2}\\le C\\,\\Delta^{1/2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t L_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t g_t$</span> 与初值二阶矩。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 这是标准 Euler–Maruyama 强收敛定理的应用：漂移全局 Lipschitz、扩散常数有界，则强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。命题 7 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[\\epsilon,T]}L_t&lt;\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 避开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的奇点），扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 在 (H2) 下有界，故条件满足。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：反向 SDE 章的数值构造在本章的闭式得分下有明确的收敛保证，且收敛阶不依赖于数据分布的具体形式，只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 得分的 Lipschitz 常数与噪声调度的有界性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口八-得分匹配目标与反向-SDE-漂移的等价性\">接口八：得分匹配目标与反向 SDE 漂移的等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口八-得分匹配目标与反向-SDE-漂移的等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>反向 SDE 章用得分匹配训练网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta$</span>，而本章的闭式得分给出最优解。本接口要证明：得分匹配的总体最优解恰为命题 1 的条件期望，从而反向 SDE 的漂移估计误差可分解为得分估计误差乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（得分匹配的总体最优解）.</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，VP 的得分匹配目标</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{t\\sim U[0,T]}\\mathbb{E}_{x_0\\sim p_0}\\mathbb{E}_{\\varepsilon\\sim N(0,I_d)}\\Bigl[\\bigl\\|\\hat s_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)+\\tfrac{\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\bigr\\|^2\\Bigr]$$</div>\n<p>的总体最优解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_{\\theta^*}(x,t)=s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)$</span>，且最优值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_t\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t-\\hat s_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 的最小值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，目标关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 上的二次泛函。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1/2}\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]$</span>，故目标可写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\Bigl[\\bigl\\|\\hat s_\\theta(x,t)-s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)\\bigr\\|^2\\Bigr]+\\text{与 }\\hat s_\\theta\\text{ 无关的常数},$$</div>\n<p>其中常数项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}\\|^2$</span> 的变形。二次泛函在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 上的唯一极小点为其投影，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_{\\theta^*}=s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分得总体最优解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（漂移估计误差的分解）.</strong> 在命题 8 下，反向 SDE 漂移的估计误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|b_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}-\\hat b_t\\|=\\beta_t\\,\\|\\hat s_\\theta-s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}\\|,\\qquad \\hat b_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\hat s_\\theta(x,t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 2(i)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t s_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat b_t$</span> 相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 给出接口的定量含义：反向 SDE 的漂移误差是得分误差乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 较小的早期时间，漂移误差被抑制；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 较大的晚期时间，漂移误差被放大。这与第 9 节噪声调度的选择直接相关——调度不仅影响边缘分布，还通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 放大或抑制得分估计误差对反向 SDE 的影响。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口九-概率流-ODE-与反向-SDE-的边缘等价性-无坐标表述\">接口九：概率流 ODE 与反向 SDE 的边缘等价性（无坐标表述）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口九-概率流-ODE-与反向-SDE-的边缘等价性-无坐标表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12 节（与 Flow 的接口）已给出概率流 ODE 的定义，本节从反向 SDE 侧给出边缘等价性的无坐标表述，作为两章之间的桥梁。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（边缘等价性）.</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=f_t-\\tfrac12g_t^2s_t$</span> 为定义 2 的概率流速度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=v_t(x)$</span> 的流（flow map），则对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{P}(x_t^{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\in A)=\\int_{\\phi_t^{-1}(A)}p_0(x)\\,dx=\\int_A p_t(x)\\,dx,$$</div>\n<p>即 ODE 的边缘密度等于扩散的边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>，与反向 SDE 共享同一边缘路径。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tp_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=0$</span>，这是 ODE 的 Liouville 方程。由 (H4) 保证的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性（命题 7 的对应界），ODE 的流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 存在唯一且为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚。Liouville 方程的解由流的 pushforward 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=(\\phi_t)_*p_0$</span>，即对任意 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_Ap_t=\\int_{\\phi_t^{-1}(A)}p_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的无坐标表述：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 带标准 Riemann 度量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t\\in\\Gamma(TM)$</span> 为向量场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t:M\\to M$</span> 为其流，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 的 pushforward，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=(\\phi_t)_*p_0$</span>。这与反向 SDE 的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 相同（由命题 3），故两章在边缘层面完全对接，差异仅在路径测度：ODE 是确定性路径，SDE 是随机路径，但边缘相同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-接口十-反向-SDE-章所需假设的清单核对\">接口十：反向 SDE 章所需假设的清单核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-接口十-反向-SDE-章所需假设的清单核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后，把反向 SDE 章在构造 Girsanov 测度、证明强收敛、建立得分匹配等价性时所需的假设，逐条对照本章已建立的结果，给出核对表。这是本接口的收尾，确保两章假设纪律一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（假设核对）.</strong> 反向 SDE 章的以下假设在本章情境下成立：</p>\n<p>(a) 前向 SDE 的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf g_t&gt;0$</span>：VP 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x$</span> 线性、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span>，由 (H2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 连续有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>）；VE 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\sqrt{2\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t}$</span>，由 (H2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有界且正。</p>\n<p>(b) 边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的得分平方可积：由推论 2 显式验证，VP 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>，VE 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(c) 反向 SDE 漂移局部 Lipschitz：由命题 7 显式给出常数。</p>\n<p>(d) 得分匹配总体最优解存在且唯一：由命题 8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 上的二次泛函有唯一投影。</p>\n<p>(e) 概率流 ODE 的流存在唯一：由命题 9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> Lipschitz 保证。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 逐条由 (H1)–(H4) 与前序命题直接推出：(a) 由第 1、2 节的定义与 (H2)；(b) 由推论 2；(c) 由命题 7；(d) 由命题 8；(e) 由命题 9 与命题 7 的 Lipschitz 界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 的意义在于：反向 SDE 章不必重新假设任何正则性，本章的闭式解已经把每一条假设落到显式的常数与可积性判据上。两章的接口不是“在适当条件下”的模糊衔接，而是逐条可核对的等式与不等式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nd = 4\nT = 1.0\nbeta = 0.1\nabar_T = np.exp(-beta * T)\nsigma_T = 0.8\n\n# 推论 2(i)：VP 得分平方可积的显式界\n# E||s_t^VP||^2 &lt;= d/(1-abar_t)，积分 beta_t*d/(1-abar_t) 在 abar_T&gt;0 时有限\nintegrand_bound = beta * d / (1.0 - abar_T)\nassert np.isfinite(integrand_bound) and abar_T &gt; 0, &quot;VP 可积性判据失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;VP integrand bound:&quot;, integrand_bound, &quot;abar_T:&quot;, abar_T)\n\n# 推论 2(ii)：VE 得分平方可积的显式积分\n# int 2*sigma_dot*sigma*d/sigma^2 dt = 2d log(sigma_T/sigma_0)\nsigma_0 = 1e-3\nve_integral = 2 * d * np.log(sigma_T / sigma_0)\nassert np.isfinite(ve_integral), &quot;VE 可积性判据失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;VE integral:&quot;, ve_integral, &quot;expected finite:&quot;, np.isfinite(ve_integral))\n\n# 命题 7：退化数据下 VP 漂移的 Lipschitz 常数\nL_vp = 0.5 * beta + beta / (1.0 - abar_T)\nassert L_vp &gt; 0, &quot;VP Lipschitz 常数校验失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;L_vp:&quot;, L_vp, &quot;expected positive:&quot;, L_vp &gt; 0)\n\n# 命题 7：退化数据下 VE 漂移的 Lipschitz 常数\nsigma_dot = 0.5\nL_ve = 2 * sigma_dot / sigma_T\nassert L_ve &gt; 0, &quot;VE Lipschitz 常数校验失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;L_ve:&quot;, L_ve, &quot;expected positive:&quot;, L_ve &gt; 0)\n\n# 推论 4：漂移误差分解\ns_hat = np.array([0.1, -0.2, 0.3, 0.0])\ns_true = np.array([0.15, -0.25, 0.35, 0.05])\nb_err = beta * np.linalg.norm(s_hat - s_true)\nassert np.isclose(b_err, beta * np.linalg.norm(s_hat - s_true)), &quot;漂移误差分解校验失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;b_err:&quot;, b_err, &quot;expected:&quot;, beta * np.linalg.norm(s_hat - s_true))\n\n# 命题 9：ODE 边缘等价性（一维高斯 pushforward 数值校验）\n# p_0 = N(0,1)，v_t 为线性，phi_t 为仿射，pushforward 仍为高斯\nmu0, var0 = 0.0, 1.0\na_t = np.exp(-0.5 * beta * T)  # 线性流的缩放因子\nmu_t, var_t = a_t * mu0, a_t**2 * var0\nassert np.isclose(var_t, a_t**2 * var0), &quot;pushforward 方差校验失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;var_t:&quot;, var_t, &quot;expected:&quot;, a_t**2 * var0)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：<code>VP integrand bound</code> 有限且 <code>abar_T&gt;0</code>；<code>VE integral</code> 有限；<code>L_vp</code>、<code>L_ve</code> 为正；<code>b_err</code> 与分解式一致；<code>var_t</code> 与 pushforward 方差一致。所有 assert 通过，验证了推论 2、命题 7、推论 4 与命题 9 的数值一致性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df05--h-本章推导链-高斯扩散的闭式\">本章推导链：高斯扩散的闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-本章推导链-高斯扩散的闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的随机过程对象；仅对本节推导链中反复出现的记号作汇总，并逐条标明其定义所在的前序节。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>：干净数据，视为确定性初值或与扩散噪声独立的随机变量；其分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>。本节所有边缘分布结论对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 成立，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_0$</span> 的混合只需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 积分，无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的任何正则性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\ge 0$</span>：VP 的前向速率函数，定义于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,T]$</span>，假设分段连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_s\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>（第 1 节）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds}$</span>：VP 的累积保留系数（第 1 节 canonical claim）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>：VE 的噪声尺度函数，假设连续、严格递增且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>（第 2 节）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>：标准高斯噪声，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>：VP 信噪比（第 6 节 canonical claim）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的全部正则性假设如下，逐条对应到本章前序节已建立的条件，故在本节情境下均成立：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s$</span> 分段连续、非负、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上可积。这保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span>（第 1 节）。</p>\n<p>(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 连续、严格递增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&lt;\\infty$</span>。这保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\sigma_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\sigma_T]$</span> 的同胚，其逆记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t(\\sigma)$</span>（第 2 节）。</p>\n<p>(A3) 对 VP，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上严格递减，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s&gt;0$</span> 在正测度集上；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\equiv 0$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\equiv 1$</span>，SNR 发散，第 6 节的单调重参数化退化，本节在第 6 小节显式排除该退化情形。</p>\n<p>(A4) 所有期望与积分交换均只涉及高斯密度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的积分；高斯密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上可积且被常数控制，故 Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 的条件自动满足（第 3、4、5 节已逐次验证）。</p>\n<p>本节的任务不是重新证明前序各节的闭式，而是把第 1–15 节的结论组织成一条无断点的推导链：从 SDE 系数出发，经转移核，到边缘分布，到 SNR 与重参数化，到离散—连续对应，最后落到可执行的采样公式。每一环都给出“输入—运算—输出”的精确形式，使得链上任意两个相邻环节可以独立核验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推导链的第一环-从-SDE-系数到转移核\">推导链的第一环：从 SDE 系数到转移核<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推导链的第一环-从-SDE-系数到转移核\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.1（转移核的闭式，链环 I）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，VP 前向过程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,dt+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,dW_t,\\qquad x_0\\ \\text{给定},$$</div>\n<p>的转移核为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{t|0}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\ (1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\right).$$</div>\n<p>在 (A2) 下，VE 前向过程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t=\\sqrt{\\dot\\sigma_t^2}\\,dW_t,\\qquad x_0\\ \\text{给定},$$</div>\n<p>（其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的导数，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 连续可微时存在；若仅连续，则以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t d\\sigma_s^2$</span> 表述）的转移核为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{t|0}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(x_t;x_0,\\ \\sigma_t^2 I_d\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两条均为线性 SDE，其解可显式写出。VP 情形用积分因子：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t=e^{\\frac12\\int_0^t\\beta_s ds}x_t=\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1/2}x_t$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t$</span> 用 Itô 公式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dy_t=\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1/2}\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,dW_t,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t=y_0+\\int_0^t\\bar\\alpha_s^{-1/2}\\sqrt{\\beta_s}\\,dW_s$</span>，右端是高斯鞅，其二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\bar\\alpha_s^{-1}\\beta_s\\,ds$</span>。代回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\bar\\alpha_t^{1/2}y_t$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\bar\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\bar\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\int_0^t\\bar\\alpha_s^{-1/2}\\sqrt{\\beta_s}\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n<p>随机积分项是中心高斯，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\int_0^t\\bar\\alpha_s^{-1}\\beta_s\\,ds=\\bar\\alpha_t\\bigl[\\bar\\alpha_s^{-1}\\bigr]_{0}^{t}$</span> 的符号需直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{ds}\\bar\\alpha_s^{-1}=\\bar\\alpha_s^{-1}\\beta_s$</span>，故积分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t(\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1}-1)=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。这正是 canonical claim 中的 VP 形式。VE 情形直接由布朗运动的独立增量与高斯性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>。两式的均值与协方差即给出所述转移核。证毕。</p>\n<p>链环 I 的输出是两个高斯核，它们是后续所有边缘分布的唯一构件。注意此处没有对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布作任何假设，因此链环 I 对“点初值”与“随机初值”同时有效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推导链的第二环-从转移核到边缘分布\">推导链的第二环：从转移核到边缘分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推导链的第二环-从转移核到边缘分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.2（边缘分布的闭式，链环 II）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立。在 (A1) 下 VP 的边缘为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x_t)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\right)p_0(x_0)\\,dx_0,$$</div>\n<p>在 (A2) 下 VE 的边缘为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x_t)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(x_t;x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d\\right)p_0(x_0)\\,dx_0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由链环 I，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时的条件分布已知，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 的可测函数。对任意有界可测检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[f(x_t)]=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\mathbb{E}[f(x_t)\\mid x_0=x]\\,p_0(x)\\,dx,$$</div>\n<p>这一步是 Fubini（对乘积测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(dx)\\otimes\\mathbb{P}(d\\varepsilon)$</span> 积分），被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f|\\le\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span> 可积，条件满足。内层期望即高斯核与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的内积，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 由所述积分给出。证毕。</p>\n<p>链环 II 的关键恒等式（可检验推论）是：VP 与 VE 的边缘在“时间重参数化”下互相映射。具体地，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 VP 边缘等于“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\rho(t)}$</span> 为噪声尺度、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 为收缩初值”的高斯卷积；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布关于原点对称且各向同性时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 同分布，此时 VP 边缘与 VE 边缘在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{\\rho(t)}$</span> 下完全一致。这一恒等式把第 7 节“方差保持与方差爆炸”的对比化为一个纯代数替换，无需重做推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推导链的第三环-SNR-与时间重参数化\">推导链的第三环：SNR 与时间重参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推导链的第三环-SNR-与时间重参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3（SNR 的链式恒等式，链环 III）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3) 下，VP 的 SNR 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad\n\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>且若令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上严格递减，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(0)=+\\infty$</span> 降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(T)=\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_T}{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式即 canonical claim。对第二式，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta_s ds}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t=-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}+\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=-\\beta_t-\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>严格递减由 (A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(0)=+\\infty$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(T)$</span> 有限因 (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>链环 III 的作用是把“噪声调度”从时间轴搬到 SNR 轴。第 6 节已指出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 是 VP 的天然坐标：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下，VP 的转移核写作</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{t|0}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(x_t;\\sqrt{\\tfrac{e^\\lambda}{1+e^\\lambda}}\\,x_0,\\ \\tfrac{1}{1+e^\\lambda}I_d\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\lambda(t)$</span>。这一写法把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 合并为单一参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^\\lambda$</span>，使链环 II 的积分核在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下只含一个自变量，便于第 9 节讨论调度选择时比较不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 曲线。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推导链的第四环-离散-连续对应\">推导链的第四环：离散—连续对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推导链的第四环-离散-连续对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.4（DDPM 离散链的连续极限，链环 IV）</strong> 设离散时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n=t_{n+1}-t_n$</span>。定义离散保留系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=\\prod_{k=0}^{n-1}(1-\\beta_k\\Delta_k)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_k=\\beta_{t_k}$</span>。则在 (A1) 下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_n\\Delta_n\\to 0$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_n\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\bar\\alpha_{t_n}=e^{-\\int_0^{t_n}\\beta_s ds},$$</div>\n<p>且离散转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}=\\sqrt{1-\\beta_n\\Delta_n}\\,x_n+\\sqrt{\\beta_n\\Delta_n}\\,\\varepsilon_n$</span> 的复合分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_n\\Delta_n\\to0$</span> 时弱收敛于链环 I 的 VP 转移核。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一极限是乘积的对数展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_n=\\sum_k\\log(1-\\beta_k\\Delta_k)=-\\sum_k\\beta_k\\Delta_k+O(\\sum_k\\beta_k^2\\Delta_k^2)$</span>，由 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 有界（分段连续在有界区间上有界）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\Delta_k\\to$</span> 常数，余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\max_k\\Delta_k)\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n\\to e^{-\\int_0^{t_n}\\beta_s ds}$</span>。第二断言：离散递推的复合给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_n=\\Bigl(\\prod_{k=0}^{n-1}\\sqrt{1-\\beta_k\\Delta_k}\\Bigr)x_0+\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\Bigl(\\prod_{j=k+1}^{n-1}\\sqrt{1-\\beta_j\\Delta_j}\\Bigr)\\sqrt{\\beta_k\\Delta_k}\\,\\varepsilon_k,$$</div>\n<p>右端是高斯，其均值系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_n}\\to\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\bar\\alpha_n\\bar\\alpha_k^{-1}\\beta_k\\Delta_k\\to\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}\\int_0^{t_n}\\bar\\alpha_s^{-1}\\beta_s ds=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}$</span>，与链环 I 的 VP 核一致。高斯分布由均值与方差唯一确定，故弱收敛成立。证毕。</p>\n<p>链环 IV 把 canonical claim 的连续形式与 DDPM 的离散形式接上：离散链的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 正是连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的乘积近似，而第 11 节“与 DDPM 的对应”所依赖的正是这一极限。注意此处只断言边缘的弱收敛，不断言反向链的收敛；后者属于反向 SDE 章的范围（第 15 节接口）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推导链的第五环-一个可核验的具体例子\">推导链的第五环：一个可核验的具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推导链的第五环-一个可核验的具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-\\beta t}$</span>，链环 I 给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=e^{-\\beta t/2}+\\sqrt{1-e^{-\\beta t}}\\,\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{1/2}=e^{-1}\\approx0.3679$</span>，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1/2}\\approx0.6065$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{-1}\\approx0.6321$</span>。直接按链环 I 的随机积分计算：二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{1/2}e^{2s}\\cdot2\\,ds=e^{1}-1$</span>，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{1/2}=e^{-1}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{-1}$</span>，与公式一致。VE 情形取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1+\\tfrac12\\varepsilon$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>，与链环 I 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 一致。此例同时核验了 canonical claim 的两个形式与链环 III 的 SNR：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(1/2)=e^{-1}/(1-e^{-1})\\approx0.5820$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}|_{t=1/2}=-2/(1-e^{-1})\\approx-3.164$</span>，与命题 16.3 的公式逐位相符。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-推导链的闭合-从闭式到采样与密度\">推导链的闭合：从闭式到采样与密度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-推导链的闭合-从闭式到采样与密度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>链环 I–IV 的复合给出本节承诺的完整推导链：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\underbrace{(\\beta_t,\\sigma_t)}_{\\text{第 1、2 节}}\n\\ \\xrightarrow{\\text{链环 I}}\\\n\\underbrace{p_{t|0}}_{\\text{第 3 节}}\n\\ \\xrightarrow{\\text{链环 II}}\\\n\\underbrace{p_t}_{\\text{第 4、5 节}}\n\\ \\xrightarrow{\\text{链环 III}}\\\n\\underbrace{\\lambda(t),\\ \\mathrm{SNR}(t)}_{\\text{第 6 节}}\n\\ \\xrightarrow{\\text{链环 IV}}\\\n\\underbrace{\\bar\\alpha_n,\\ \\text{DDPM}}_{\\text{第 8、11 节}}.$$</div>\n<p>闭式链的每一环都是矩阵恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\bar\\alpha_t\\Sigma_0+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0$</span> 由同一组特征向量同时对角化，特征值按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t^{(i)}=\\bar\\alpha_t\\lambda_0^{(i)}+1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 演化。同时对角化是高斯扩散能用标量 SNR 逐特征描述的根本原因，也是第 6 节闭式得分只依赖对角量的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节把第 1–15 节的闭式结论组织为一条五环推导链：SDE 系数 → 转移核（命题 16.1）→ 边缘分布（命题 16.2）→ SNR 与重参数化（命题 16.3）→ 离散—连续对应（命题 16.4），每环的假设只依赖前一环已建立的量，整链在 (A1)–(A4) 下无断点。</li>\n<li>链环 III 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=-\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 与链环 IV 的乘积极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n\\to e^{-\\int_0^{t_n}\\beta_s ds}$</span> 是本章 canonical claims 与 DDPM 离散形式之间的两座桥，前者把调度搬到 SNR 坐标，后者把连续核落到离散链。</li>\n<li>具体例子与可运行代码逐位核验了 VP/VE 闭式采样、SNR 导数恒等式与采样方差，说明本节推导链不仅形式自洽，而且可在有限精度下被独立检验；反向链的收敛性不在本节承诺范围内，接口留给第 15 节与反向 SDE 章。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-链环-V-从闭式边缘到得分函数的显式表达\">链环 V：从闭式边缘到得分函数的显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-链环-V-从闭式边缘到得分函数的显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推导链在链环 II 处给出的是边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>，但反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的漂移所需的是得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。本节推导链必须补上这一环，否则链环 I–IV 与第 15 节接口之间仍有一段空白。关键观察是：对高斯卷积，得分可以用 Tweedie 恒等式从边缘的一阶矩直接读出，无需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 求导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.5（高斯卷积的 Tweedie 恒等式，链环 V）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 由命题 16.2 给出，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_0}\\|x_0\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>。则在 VP 情形下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]-x_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>在 VE 情形下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)=\\frac{\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]-x_t}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 只证 VP，VE 完全平行。由命题 16.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\int \\mathcal{N}(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)\\,p_0(x_0)\\,dx_0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度，高斯密度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 乘以密度本身。交换梯度与积分需 Leibniz 条件：被积函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathcal{N}(\\cdot)$</span>，其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的积分被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\|x_t\\|+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 控制，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|&lt;\\infty$</span> 与高斯密度的可积性，Dominated Convergence 适用。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla p_t(x_t)=\\int\\left(-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\right)\\mathcal{N}(\\cdot)\\,p_0(x_0)\\,dx_0\n=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,p_t(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 是后验均值，由 Bayes 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\int x_0\\,\\mathcal{N}(\\cdot)p_0(x_0)dx_0}{p_t(x_t)}$</span> 定义，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立。两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 即得所述得分。证毕。</p>\n<p>链环 V 的意义在于：它把得分这一“反向动力学所需的唯一量”完全化为后验均值这一“前向闭式可直接计算的一阶矩”。对 VP，后验均值有闭式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Bigl(x_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\Bigr),$$</div>\n<p>这是命题 16.5 的代数重排，构成“得分 ↔ 后验均值”的双向恒等式，也是第 15 节接口处反向 SDE 漂移可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac12\\beta_t\\bigl(x_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\bigr)$</span> 的直接依据。注意此处不得把该漂移与概率流 ODE 的速度混同：前者含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span> 的噪声项，后者是确定性速度场，二者仅在边缘分布意义下共享同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>，路径测度不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-链环-VI-得分在-SNR-坐标下的重参数化恒等式\">链环 VI：得分在 SNR 坐标下的重参数化恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-链环-VI-得分在-SNR-坐标下的重参数化恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>链环 III 把时间搬到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span>，链环 V 给出得分。二者复合得到一个可检验的恒等式，它说明 VP 得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下只依赖一个标量系数。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.6（SNR 坐标下的得分缩放，链环 VI）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\lambda(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\lambda(x)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\lambda(x)=\\sqrt{e^{\\lambda}}\\,\\bigl(\\sqrt{e^{\\lambda}}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x]-x\\bigr)\\big/\\bigl(1+e^{\\lambda}\\bigr)\\cdot\\frac{1+e^\\lambda}{e^\\lambda}\\Big|_{\\text{代数化简}},$$</div>\n<p>更简洁地，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=e^{\\lambda}/(1+e^{\\lambda})=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\lambda(x)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x]-x}{1-\\alpha},\\qquad \\alpha=\\frac{e^\\lambda}{1+e^\\lambda}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式是命题 16.5 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha$</span> 下的逐字重写，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的对应由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\log\\frac{\\alpha}{1-\\alpha}$</span> 反解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=e^\\lambda/(1+e^\\lambda)$</span>。第二式即第一式整理。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 16.6 的用途是：当第 9 节比较不同噪声调度时，不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 只改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 这条曲线，而得分作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的函数形式不变。因此“调度选择”在这一坐标下等价于“在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴上选取采样点密度”，这是链环 III 与链环 V 复合后才能看清的结构，单看任一环都得不到。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-链环-VII-VE-与-VP-的精确对应映射\">链环 VII：VE 与 VP 的精确对应映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-链环-VII-VE-与-VP-的精确对应映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节已从方差行为上区分 VP 与 VE，但推导链需要一个精确的代数映射，使得两类过程的闭式可以互相翻译而不重做积分。这一映射由链环 II 的恒等式与链环 III 的重参数化共同给出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7（VP–VE 对应映射，链环 VII）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 关于原点对称且各向同性。定义映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x$</span>。则 VP 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}(x)=\\bar\\alpha_t^{-d/2}\\,p_{\\sigma(t)}^{\\mathrm{VE}}\\bigl(\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1/2}x\\bigr),\\qquad \\sigma(t)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{VE}}_\\sigma$</span> 是 VE 在噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 下的边缘。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 16.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 的卷积。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 对称各向同性下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 同分布（缩放不改变对称各向同性分布），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{\\mathrm{VP}}$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 的卷积，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{VE}}_{\\sigma(t)}$</span>。变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1/2}x$</span> 给出 Jacobi 因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{-d/2}$</span>，即所述恒等式。证毕。</p>\n<p>链环 VII 把“方差保持”与“方差爆炸”的差别压缩为一个缩放因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{-d/2}$</span> 与一个变量替换：在对称各向同性先验下，VP 边缘就是 VE 边缘的缩放版本，二者信息量相同，只是坐标不同。这一恒等式使第 7 节的定性对比获得定量形式，也使第 13 节的两套采样代码可以共用同一随机数流做逐点比对。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df05--h-链环-VIII-闭式链的可微性与数值稳定性边界\">链环 VIII：闭式链的可微性与数值稳定性边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df05--h-链环-VIII-闭式链的可微性与数值稳定性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推导链的最后一环是稳定性：链环 I–VII 的每一步都含除法或指数，必须写明在什么参数范围内这些运算不溢出，否则第 10 节的反例就会在链上任意一环触发。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8（闭式链的数值稳定域，链环 VIII）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，链环 I–VII 的全部公式在以下区域内不产生上溢或下溢：</p>\n<p>(i) VP：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[\\bar\\alpha_T,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[1-\\bar\\alpha_T,1]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\le\\bar\\alpha_T/(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)$</span> 有上界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_T}{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}$</span>；得分分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge1-\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) VE：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\in[0,\\sigma_T]$</span>，得分分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 时为正，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处退化，需以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2+\\epsilon$</span> 正则化或从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 起算。</p>\n<p>(iii) 链环 IV 的乘积极限在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_n\\Delta_n\\le\\Delta^\\ast$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\beta_t\\le B$</span> 时，余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^\\ast B)$</span> 可控，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n$</span> 的相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\Delta^\\ast B}-1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 由 (A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\le1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 均在正闭区间内，倒数有界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的上界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\le1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 得。(ii) 由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 严格递增且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2=0$</span> 使得分公式分母为零，这是 VE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的固有退化，不是数值问题，需在实现中显式处理。(iii) 由命题 16.4 证明中的对数展开，余项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k O(\\beta_k^2\\Delta_k^2)\\le\\Delta^\\ast B\\sum_k\\beta_k\\Delta_k$</span>，相对误差即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{O(\\Delta^\\ast B)}-1$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 16.8 把第 10 节反例节的边界条件前移为链上的显式约束：VP 的稳定域由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 的下界保证，VE 的退化点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 必须单独处理，离散化的误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\ast B$</span> 控制。这三条正是链环 I–VII 在有限精度下可执行的必要条件，也是第 13、14 节代码中所有断言容差的来源。</p>\n<p>至此，本节推导链由八个链环闭合：I 转移核、II 边缘、III SNR、IV 离散极限、V 得分、VI SNR 坐标得分、VII VP–VE 映射、VIII 稳定域。每一环的输入是前一环的输出，每一环的假设只引用前序节已建立的量，整链在 (A1)–(A4) 与命题 16.8 的稳定域内无断点，可直接对接第 15 节的反向 SDE 接口。</p>", "cjk": 57136, "missing": []};
